ly partial fixes that alter the compounding rate without fully resetting the", "tokens": [51418, 7587, 13, 509, 393, 3079, 14641, 32539, 300, 11337, 264, 14154, 278, 3314, 1553, 4498, 14322, 783, 264, 51668], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.055174091032573154, "compression_ratio": 1.6442953020134228, "no_speech_prob": 1.9575621505729668e-12}, {"id": 564, "seek": 240812, "start": 2408.12, "end": 2414.22, "text": " deviation. Real systems utilize a spectrum of intervention intensities, but calculating the", "tokens": [50365, 25163, 13, 8467, 3652, 16117, 257, 11143, 295, 13176, 14056, 1088, 11, 457, 28258, 264, 50670], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07106941811581875, "compression_ratio": 1.6783216783216783, "no_speech_prob": 2.201391412909315e-12}, {"id": 565, "seek": 240812, "start": 2414.22, "end": 2419.44, "text": " optimal threshold structure under a continuous continuum of intervention types remains", "tokens": [50670, 16252, 14678, 3877, 833, 257, 10957, 36120, 295, 13176, 3467, 7023, 50931], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07106941811581875, "compression_ratio": 1.6783216783216783, "no_speech_prob": 2.201391412909315e-12}, {"id": 566, "seek": 240812, "start": 2419.44, "end": 2425.48, "text": " mathematically unresolved. The equations become exponentially more complex when you introduce", "tokens": [50931, 44003, 517, 495, 29110, 13, 440, 11787, 1813, 37330, 544, 3997, 562, 291, 5366, 51233], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07106941811581875, "compression_ratio": 1.6783216783216783, "no_speech_prob": 2.201391412909315e-12}, {"id": 567, "seek": 240812, "start": 2425.48, "end": 2430.9, "text": " partial repairs. And then there's the fourth problem. And honestly, this one feels like the most daunting", "tokens": [51233, 14641, 28823, 13, 400, 550, 456, 311, 264, 6409, 1154, 13, 400, 6095, 11, 341, 472, 3417, 411, 264, 881, 37657, 51504], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07106941811581875, "compression_ratio": 1.6783216783216783, "no_s