ch_prob": 1.6039861496300323e-12}, {"id": 581, "seek": 248758, "start": 2508.2, "end": 2514.5, "text": " institutional measurement. Right. How do you quantify the true hidden cognitive cost of maintaining a JIRA", "tokens": [51396, 18391, 13160, 13, 1779, 13, 1012, 360, 291, 40421, 264, 2074, 7633, 15605, 2063, 295, 14916, 257, 50172, 3750, 51711], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06209990073894632, "compression_ratio": 1.5676691729323309, "no_speech_prob": 1.6039861496300323e-12}, {"id": 582, "seek": 251450, "start": 2514.5, "end": 2518.76, "text": " backlog versus the political capital required to stand up a new engineering department?", "tokens": [50365, 47364, 5717, 264, 3905, 4238, 4739, 281, 1463, 493, 257, 777, 7043, 5882, 30, 50578], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1412716599198075, "compression_ratio": 1.578616352201258, "no_speech_prob": 1.67476113272641e-12}, {"id": 583, "seek": 251450, "start": 2519.28, "end": 2521.7, "text": " It is incredibly, perhaps impossibly difficult.", "tokens": [50604, 467, 307, 6252, 11, 4317, 38802, 3545, 2252, 13, 50725], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1412716599198075, "compression_ratio": 1.578616352201258, "no_speech_prob": 1.67476113272641e-12}, {"id": 584, "seek": 251450, "start": 2522.12, "end": 2528.62, "text": " And yet, just knowing the hidden structure exists changes how you look at the world. It fundamentally rewired my brain", "tokens": [50746, 400, 1939, 11, 445, 5276, 264, 7633, 3877, 8198, 2962, 577, 291, 574, 412, 264, 1002, 13, 467, 17879, 319, 86, 1824, 452, 3567, 51071], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1412716599198075, "compression_ratio": 1.578616352201258, "no_speech_prob": 1.67476113272641e-12}, {"id": 585, "seek": 251450, "start": 2528.62, "end": 2533.56, "text": " regarding how I prioritize my own life. So, to bring all this together and summarize the incredible journey", "tokens": [51071, 8595, 577, 286, 25164, 452, 1065, 993, 13, 407, 11, 281, 1565, 439, 341, 1214, 293, 20858, 264, 4651, 4671, 51318], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1412716599198075, "compression_ratio": 1.578616352201258, "no_speech_prob": 1.67476113272641e-12}, {"id": 586, "seek": 251450, "start": 2533.56, "end": 2534.34, "text": " we've been on today.", "tokens": [51318, 321, 600, 668, 322, 965, 13, 51357], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1412716599198075, "compression_ratio": 1.578616352201258, "no_speech_prob": 1.67476113272641e-12}, {"id": 587, "seek": 251450, "start": 2534.66, "end": 2535.22, "text": " Let's review.", "tokens": [51373, 961, 311, 3131, 13, 51401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1412716599198075, "compression_ratio": 1.578616352201258, "no_speech_prob": 1.67476113272641e-12}, {"id": 588, "seek": 251450, "start": 2535.64, "end": 2541.58, "text": " We started by learning that maintenance and repair are entirely different beasts, separated not by size,", "tokens": [51422, 492, 1409, 538, 2539, 300, 11258, 293, 10535, 366, 7696, 819, 37386, 11, 12005, 406, 538, 2744, 11, 51719], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1412716599198075, "compression_ratio": 1.578616352201258, "no_speech_prob": 1.67476113272641e-12}, {"id": 589, "seek": 254158, "start": 2541.58, "end": 2546.7999999999997, "text": " but by their triggering conditions. We learned that the agonizing decision to delay a fix is actually", "tokens": [50365, 457, 538, 641, 40406, 4487, 13, 492, 3264, 300, 264, 623, 266, 3319, 3537, 281, 8577, 257, 3191, 307, 767, 50626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1142771469919305, "compression_ratio": 1.7022058823529411, "no_speech_prob": 1.7827629563565983e-12}, {"id": 590, "seek": 254158, "start": 2546.7999999999997, "end": 2553.7999999999997, "text": " split into two distinct mechanisms. An immediate static comparison of fixed organizational overheads", "tokens": [50626, 7472, 666, 732, 10644, 15902, 13, 1107, 11629, 13437, 9660, 295, 6806, 24730, 19922, 82, 50976], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1142771469919305, "compres