 2599.8, "end": 2604.6400000000003, "text": " So bring it back to you, the listener. The next time you're sitting there deciding whether to fix", "tokens": [50365, 407, 1565, 309, 646, 281, 291, 11, 264, 31569, 13, 440, 958, 565, 291, 434, 3798, 456, 17990, 1968, 281, 3191, 50607], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06111633777618408, "compression_ratio": 1.6213991769547325, "no_speech_prob": 2.0802038477180096e-12}, {"id": 601, "seek": 259980, "start": 2604.6400000000003, "end": 2609.1000000000004, "text": " something now or later, whether it's that tiny crack in your windshield, a leaky faucet in the", "tokens": [50607, 746, 586, 420, 1780, 11, 1968, 309, 311, 300, 5870, 6226, 294, 428, 39996, 11, 257, 476, 15681, 49567, 302, 294, 264, 50830], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06111633777618408, "compression_ratio": 1.6213991769547325, "no_speech_prob": 2.0802038477180096e-12}, {"id": 602, "seek": 259980, "start": 2609.1000000000004, "end": 2615.34, "text": " kitchen, a strained relationship with a friend, or a massive delayed project at work, stop and ask", "tokens": [50830, 6525, 11, 257, 2148, 2001, 2480, 365, 257, 1277, 11, 420, 257, 5994, 20268, 1716, 412, 589, 11, 1590, 293, 1029, 51142], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06111633777618408, "compression_ratio": 1.6213991769547325, "no_speech_prob": 2.0802038477180096e-12}, {"id": 603, "seek": 259980, "start": 2615.34, "end": 2621.8, "text": " yourself a new set of questions. A new framework. Ask yourself, am I judging this purely based on this", "tokens": [51142, 1803, 257, 777, 992, 295, 1651, 13, 316, 777, 8388, 13, 12320, 1803, 11, 669, 286, 23587, 341, 17491, 2361, 322, 341, 51465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06111633777618408, "compression_ratio": 1.6213991769547325, "no_speech_prob": 2.0802038477180096e-12}, {"id": 604, "seek": 262180, "start": 2621.8, "end": 2629.26, "text": " static immediate cost of the fix? Or am I forgetting to calculate the compounding rate of the damage?", "tokens": [50365, 13437, 11629, 2063, 295, 264, 3191, 30, 1610, 669, 286, 25428, 281, 8873, 264, 14154, 278, 3314, 295, 264, 4344, 30, 50738], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09771200815836588, "compression_ratio": 1.5951417004048583, "no_speech_prob": 1.8076009439260687e-12}, {"id": 605, "seek": 262180, "start": 2629.6800000000003, "end": 2634.6800000000003, "text": " Because whether you calculate it or not, the math is running in the background. The math is always", "tokens": [50759, 1436, 1968, 291, 8873, 309, 420, 406, 11, 264, 5221, 307, 2614, 294, 264, 3678, 13, 440, 5221, 307, 1009, 51009], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09771200815836588, "compression_ratio": 1.5951417004048583, "no_speech_prob": 1.8076009439260687e-12}, {"id": 606, "seek": 262180, "start": 2634.6800000000003, "end": 2640.5600000000004, "text": " watching. And if I may add one final lingering thought to close this out, building on the source", "tokens": [51009, 1976, 13, 400, 498, 286, 815, 909, 472, 2572, 49542, 1194, 281, 1998, 341, 484, 11, 2390, 322, 264, 4009, 51303], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09771200815836588, "compression_ratio": 1.5951417004048583, "no_speech_prob": 1.8076009439260687e-12}, {"id": 607, "seek": 262180, "start": 2640.5600000000004, "end": 2646.02, "text": " materials' deep exploration of overheads and capacity. Please do. We have spent this entire deep", "tokens": [51303, 5319, 6, 2452, 16197, 295, 19922, 82, 293, 6042, 13, 2555, 360, 13, 492, 362, 4418, 341, 2302, 2452, 51576], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09771200815836588, "compression_ratio": 1.5951417004048583, "no_speech_prob": 1.8076009439260687e-12}, {"id": 608, "seek": 264602, "start": 2646.02, "end": 2650.52, "text": " dive talking about the capacity of physical and institutional systems to repair themselves", "tokens": [50365, 9192, 1417, 466, 264, 6042, 295, 4001, 293, 18391, 3652, 281, 10535, 2969, 50590], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09057527322035569, "compress