? Oh, wow. By simply obsessing over these problems,", "tokens": [50728, 5994, 1254, 295, 10957, 11258, 19922, 30, 876, 11, 6076, 13, 3146, 2935, 35803, 278, 670, 613, 2740, 11, 51025], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09671649267507154, "compression_ratio": 1.5513307984790874, "no_speech_prob": 1.797196614618246e-12}, {"id": 614, "seek": 266894, "start": 2682.26, "end": 2687.46, "text": " by trying to perfectly calculate the optimal threshold of when to fix the myriad systems in our lives,", "tokens": [51031, 538, 1382, 281, 6239, 8873, 264, 16252, 14678, 295, 562, 281, 3191, 264, 452, 45192, 3652, 294, 527, 2909, 11, 51291], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09671649267507154, "compression_ratio": 1.5513307984790874, "no_speech_prob": 1.797196614618246e-12}, {"id": 615, "seek": 266894, "start": 2687.58, "end": 2693.48, "text": " are we draining the very cognitive capacity required to actually execute the repairs? Are we spending our", "tokens": [51297, 366, 321, 42916, 264, 588, 15605, 6042, 4739, 281, 767, 14483, 264, 28823, 30, 2014, 321, 6434, 527, 51592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09671649267507154, "compression_ratio": 1.5513307984790874, "no_speech_prob": 1.797196614618246e-12}, {"id": 616, "seek": 269348, "start": 2693.48, "end": 2699.28, "text": " mental kappa M just trying to calculate our kappa M? Exactly. The overhead of managing the overhead.", "tokens": [50365, 4973, 350, 25637, 376, 445, 1382, 281, 8873, 527, 350, 25637, 376, 30, 7587, 13, 440, 19922, 295, 11642, 264, 19922, 13, 50655], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11166796626814876, "compression_ratio": 1.6009174311926606, "no_speech_prob": 2.068353084291874e-12}, {"id": 617, "seek": 269348, "start": 2699.6, "end": 2705.0, "text": " That is, honestly, that is a profound thing to chew on. And maybe, just maybe, that hidden cognitive drain", "tokens": [50671, 663, 307, 11, 6095, 11, 300, 307, 257, 14382, 551, 281, 21200, 322, 13, 400, 1310, 11, 445, 1310, 11, 300, 7633, 15