tters. It deceives the functional profile. Translated to the math, a chair that collapses has exited its viability manifold. Exactly. Or the teleological theory. A true heart continuously pumps blood. If it stubs, it is a false heart. The mathematical boundary of the viability manifold is literally the philosophical concept of a true object. Like a cancer cell, it escapes its constraints, so it is quite literally a false human cell. Truth is about maintaining organizational integrity against the entropy of time. Truth is mathematical admissibility. It's a profound synthesis. Survival is about preserving vital distinctions across endless transformations. So for you listening, think about what this means. If you declare someone a true friend, you aren't just using a metaphor. You are stating a systems-level fact. They stay inside the functional viability manifold of friendship, even as life gets complicated and their internal parameters update. It grounds our highest ideals in the bedrock mathematics of survival. Okay, let's pull this all together. The real takeaway isn't to cower in fear of AGI just because it can rewrite its code. Your immune cells do that every day. Recursion is the baseline state of the universe. What we should fear is an AGI engineered as a correlated monoculture that updates faster than reality can cross-check it. Capability is cheap, but repair is incredibly expensive. Diversity isn't a buzzword. It is a rigid mathematical prerequisite for civilizational continuation. Which leaves us with one final, deeply provocative thought. Right now, governments and tech conglomerates are pushing for unified, centralized AI safety standards. One massive regulatory bottleneck. A single global alignment protocol. But if centralizing self-improvement into a highly correlated monoculture guarantees a catastrophic systemic collapse when a novel error occurs, does that mean the global push for unified safety regulations might actually be engineering the exact mathematical conditions for the disaster it's trying to prevent? Think about that the next time you hear someone ask for a single ruling algorithm for humanity. Until next time, keep diving deep. Thank you. So,", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 9.6, "text": " So I want you to just imagine this massive global corporation, like a sprawling, multi-billion-dollar logistics empire.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 286, 528, 291, 281, 445, 3811, 341, 5994, 4338, 22197, 11, 411, 257, 22734, 1688, 11, 4825, 12, 65, 11836, 12, 40485, 27420, 17506, 13, 50845], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15332000454266867, "compression_ratio": 1.4945054945054945, "no_speech_prob": 1.098575115425493e-12}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 9.72, "end": 11.44, "text": " Right. Something truly huge.", "tokens": [50851, 1779, 13, 6595, 4908, 2603, 13, 50937], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15332000454266867, "compression_ratio": 1.4945054945054945, "no_speech_prob": 1.098575115425493e-12}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 11.66, "end": 20.98, "text": " Exactly. And for decades, they have been laser-focused on one singular goal, which is optimizing their supply chain.", "tokens": [50948, 7587, 13, 400, 337, 7878, 11, 436, 362, 668, 12530, 12, 44062, 322, 472, 20010, 3387, 11, 597, 307, 40425, 641, 5847, 5021, 13, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15332000454266867, "compression_ratio": 1.4945054945054945, "no_speech_prob": 1.098575115425493e-12}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 21.080000000000002, "end": 23.66, "text": " Just squeezing out every drop of efficiency.", "tokens": [51419, 1449, 36645, 484, 633, 3270, 295, 10493, 13, 51548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15332000454266867, "compression_ratio": 1.4945054945054945, "no_speech_prob": 1.098575115425493e-12}, {"id": 4, "seek": 0, "start": 23.66, "end": 28.18, "text": " Yeah, exactly. So they bring in all these smart consultants, they deploy cutting-edge algorithms,", "tokens": [51548, 865, 11, 2293, 13, 407, 436, 1565, 294, 439, 613, 4069, 38935, 11, 436, 7274, 6492, 12, 12203, 14642, 11, 51774], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15332000454266867, "compression_ratio": 1.4945054945054945, "no_speech_prob": 1.098575115425493e-12}, {"id": 5, "seek": 2818, "start": 28.18, "end": 35.64, "text": " and every single quarter, they take the data from their last restructuring to make the rules for the next restructuring even more ruthless.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 633, 2167, 6555, 11, 436, 747, 264, 1412, 490, 641, 1036, 1472, 1757, 1345, 281, 652, 264, 4474, 337, 264, 958, 1472, 1757, 1345, 754, 544, 47096, 13, 50738], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11013031745141791, "compression_ratio": 1.7028753993610224, "no_speech_prob": 7.520626374261929e-13}, {"id": 6, "seek": 2818, "start": 35.76, "end": 36.58, "text": " Trimming the fat.", "tokens": [50744, 1765, 40471, 264, 4046, 13, 50785], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11013031745141791, "compression_ratio": 1.7028753993610224, "no_speech_prob": 7.520626374261929e-13}, {"id": 7, "seek": 2818, "start": 36.74, "end": 41.88, "text": " Right. They move to completely just-in-time delivery. They eliminate every single redundant warehouse.", "tokens": [50793, 1779, 13, 814, 1286, 281, 2584, 445, 12, 259, 12, 3766, 8982, 13, 814, 13819, 633, 2167, 40997, 22244, 13, 51050], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11013031745141791, "compression_ratio": 1.7028753993610224, "no_speech_prob": 7.520626374261929e-13}, {"id": 8, "seek": 2818, "start": 42.34, "end": 44.86, "text": " It is this absolute masterpiece of corporate evolution.", "tokens": [51073, 467, 307, 341, 8236, 32208, 295, 10896, 9303, 13, 51199], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11013031745141791, "compression_ratio": 1.7028753993610224, "no_speech_prob": 7.520626374261929e-13}, {"id": 9, "seek": 2818, "start": 44.96, "end": 46.239999999999995, "text": " It sounds perfect on paper.", "tokens": [51204, 467, 3263, 2176, 322, 3035, 13, 51268], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11013031745141791, "compression_ratio": 1.7028753993610224, "no_speech_prob": 7.520626374261929e-13}, {"id": 10, "seek": 2818, "start": 46.5, "end": 52.72, "text": " Right, on paper. And then one single cargo ship gets wedged sideways in the Suez Canal for a week.", "tokens": [51281, 1779, 11, 322, 3035, 13, 400, 550, 472, 2167, 19449, 5374, 2170, 6393, 3004, 26092, 294, 264, 25332, 89, 38250, 337, 257, 1243, 13, 51592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11013031745141791, "compression_ratio": 1.7028753993610224, "no_speech_prob": 7.520626374261929e-13}, {"id": 11, "seek": 2818, "start": 52.72, "end": 53.9, "text": " Oh, I remember that.", "tokens": [51592, 876, 11, 286, 1604, 300, 13, 51651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11013031745141791, "compression_ratio": 1.7028753993610224, "no_speech_prob": 7.520626374261929e-13}, {"id": 12, "seek": 2818, "start": 54.0, "end": 57.8, "text": " Yeah. And the entire corporation instantly goes bankrupt. Just gone.", "tokens": [51656, 865, 13, 400, 264, 2302, 22197, 13518, 1709, 21780, 13, 1449, 2780, 13, 51846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11013031745141791, "compression_ratio": 1.7028753993610224, "no_speech_prob": 7.520626374261929e-13}, {"id": 13, "seek": 5818, "start": 58.18, "end": 61.98, "text": " And they didn't fail because they were stupid or, you know, because they lacked capability.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 436, 994, 380, 3061, 570, 436, 645, 6631, 420, 11, 291, 458, 11, 570, 436, 41481, 13759, 13, 50555], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16558392842610678, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9579732800367733e-12}, {"id": 14, "seek": 5818, "start": 61.98, "end": 65.56, "text": " They failed because they literally optimized themselves to death.", "tokens": [50555, 814, 7612, 570, 436, 3736, 26941, 2969, 281, 2966, 13, 50734], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16558392842610678, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9579732800367733e-12}, {"id": 15, "seek": 5818, "start": 65.56, "end": 71.94, "text": " Yeah. They became so highly tuned that they completely lost the capacity to survive a surprise.", "tokens": [50734, 865, 13, 814, 3062, 370, 5405, 10870, 300, 436, 2584, 2731, 264, 6042, 281, 7867, 257, 6365, 13, 51053], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16558392842610678, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9579732800367733e-12}, {"id": 16, "seek": 5818, "start": 72.26, "end": 75.53999999999999, "text": " Exactly. And, you know, welcome to the deep dive, everyone.", "tokens": [51069, 7587, 13, 400, 11, 291, 458, 11, 2928, 281, 264, 2452, 9192, 11, 1518, 13, 51233], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16558392842610678, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9579732800367733e-12}, {"id": 17, "seek": 5818, "start": 75.72, "end": 80.96000000000001, "text": " Because that scenario right there is the exact blind spot we are tearing into today.", "tokens": [51242, 1436, 300, 9005, 558, 456, 307, 264, 1900, 6865, 4008, 321, 366, 29401, 666, 965, 13, 51504], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16558392842610678, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9579732800367733e-12}, {"id": 18, "seek": 8096, "start": 80.96, "end": 91.02, "text": " It really is the perfect starting point because it isolates this massive flaw in how we think about intelligence and evolution and especially our fears about the future.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 534, 307, 264, 2176, 2891, 935, 570, 309, 7381, 1024, 341, 5994, 13717, 294, 577, 321, 519, 466, 7599, 293, 9303, 293, 2318, 527, 15649, 466, 264, 2027, 13, 50868], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12209613800048828, "compression_ratio": 1.5276073619631902, "no_speech_prob": 1.61026617387372e-12}, {"id": 19, "seek": 8096, "start": 91.19999999999999, "end": 95.6, "text": " Right. Because we constantly hear about artificial general intelligence or AGI.", "tokens": [50877, 1779, 13, 1436, 321, 6460, 1568, 466, 11677, 2674, 7599, 420, 316, 26252, 13, 51097], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12209613800048828, "compression_ratio": 1.5276073619631902, "no_speech_prob": 1.61026617387372e-12}, {"id": 20, "seek": 9560, "start": 95.6, "end": 100.33999999999999, "text": " And there's this one terrifying phrase that always gets dropped.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 456, 311, 341, 472, 18106, 9535, 300, 1009, 2170, 8119, 13, 50602], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1620736079933369, "compression_ratio": 1.6791666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.201600993185059e-12}, {"id": 21, "seek": 9560, "start": 100.86, "end": 102.55999999999999, "text": " Recursive self-improvement.", "tokens": [50628, 9647, 2156, 488, 2698, 12, 332, 46955, 518, 13, 50713], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1620736079933369, "compression_ratio": 1.6791666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.201600993185059e-12}, {"id": 22, "seek": 9560, "start": 102.72, "end": 104.24, "text": " Recursive self-improvement. Yes.", "tokens": [50721, 9647, 2156, 488, 2698, 12, 332, 46955, 518, 13, 1079, 13, 50797], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1620736079933369, "compression_ratio": 1.6791666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.201600993185059e-12}, {"id": 23, "seek": 9560, "start": 104.28, "end": 104.39999999999999, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50799, 865, 13, 50805], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1620736079933369, "compression_ratio": 1.6791666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.201600993185059e-12}, {"id": 24, "seek": 9560, "start": 104.74, "end": 110.19999999999999, "text": " The story is always humanity builds an AI that is smart enough to look at its own source code.", "tokens": [50822, 440, 1657, 307, 1009, 10243, 15182, 364, 7318, 300, 307, 4069, 1547, 281, 574, 412, 1080, 1065, 4009, 3089, 13, 51095], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1620736079933369, "compression_ratio": 1.6791666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.201600993185059e-12}, {"id": 25, "seek": 9560, "start": 110.46, "end": 114.38, "text": " It finds inefficiencies and it rewrites that code to make itself a little bit smarter.", "tokens": [51108, 467, 10704, 7167, 3341, 31294, 293, 309, 319, 86, 30931, 300, 3089, 281, 652, 2564, 257, 707, 857, 20294, 13, 51304], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1620736079933369, "compression_ratio": 1.6791666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.201600993185059e-12}, {"id": 26, "seek": 9560, "start": 114.56, "end": 118.66, "text": " And because it's smarter, the next time it rewrites its code, it does an even better job.", "tokens": [51313, 400, 570, 309, 311, 20294, 11, 264, 958, 565, 309, 319, 86, 30931, 1080, 3089, 11, 309, 775, 364, 754, 1101, 1691, 13, 51518], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1620736079933369, "compression_ratio": 1.6791666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.201600993185059e-12}, {"id": 27, "seek": 11866, "start": 118.66, "end": 125.0, "text": " Right. A massive feedback loop. An intelligence explosion. It becomes this godlike entity before we can even pull the plug.", "tokens": [50365, 1779, 13, 316, 5994, 5824, 6367, 13, 1107, 7599, 15673, 13, 467, 3643, 341, 3044, 4092, 13977, 949, 321, 393, 754, 2235, 264, 5452, 13, 50682], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10226885734065887, "compression_ratio": 1.589171974522293, "no_speech_prob": 1.1739438631266919e-12}, {"id": 28, "seek": 11866, "start": 125.24, "end": 128.34, "text": " It's treated as this ultimate unprecedented threshold.", "tokens": [50694, 467, 311, 8668, 382, 341, 9705, 21555, 14678, 13, 50849], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10226885734065887, "compression_ratio": 1.589171974522293, "no_speech_prob": 1.1739438631266919e-12}, {"id": 29, "seek": 11866, "start": 128.48, "end": 134.22, "text": " The singularity. The point of no return. But, well, what if that entire framework is just upside down?", "tokens": [50856, 440, 20010, 507, 13, 440, 935, 295, 572, 2736, 13, 583, 11, 731, 11, 437, 498, 300, 2302, 8388, 307, 445, 14119, 760, 30, 51143], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10226885734065887, "compression_ratio": 1.589171974522293, "no_speech_prob": 1.1739438631266919e-12}, {"id": 30, "seek": 11866, "start": 134.5, "end": 136.1, "text": " Which is such a wild thought.", "tokens": [51157, 3013, 307, 1270, 257, 4868, 1194, 13, 51237], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10226885734065887, "compression_ratio": 1.589171974522293, "no_speech_prob": 1.1739438631266919e-12}, {"id": 31, "seek": 11866, "start": 136.16, "end": 140.66, "text": " It is. What if rewriting your own rules isn't some futuristic sci-fi concept?", "tokens": [51240, 467, 307, 13, 708, 498, 319, 19868, 428, 1065, 4474, 1943, 380, 512, 44932, 2180, 12, 13325, 3410, 30, 51465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10226885734065887, "compression_ratio": 1.589171974522293, "no_speech_prob": 1.1739438631266919e-12}, {"id": 32, "seek": 11866, "start": 140.92, "end": 146.56, "text": " What if it's literally the oldest trick in the universe? I mean, what if your own body is doing it right now?", "tokens": [51478, 708, 498, 309, 311, 3736, 264, 14026, 4282, 294, 264, 6445, 30, 286, 914, 11, 437, 498, 428, 1065, 1772, 307, 884, 309, 558, 586, 30, 51760], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10226885734065887, "compression_ratio": 1.589171974522293, "no_speech_prob": 1.1739438631266919e-12}, {"id": 33, "seek": 14656, "start": 146.56, "end": 153.52, "text": " And that is our mission today. We are unpacking this really incredible 2026 paper by Flixion.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 300, 307, 527, 4447, 965, 13, 492, 366, 26699, 278, 341, 534, 4651, 945, 10880, 3035, 538, 3235, 970, 313, 13, 50713], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09630449977489787, "compression_ratio": 1.550877192982456, "no_speech_prob": 1.6232314971331707e-12}, {"id": 34, "seek": 14656, "start": 154.04, "end": 155.94, "text": " It's called Recursive Continuation.", "tokens": [50739, 467, 311, 1219, 9647, 2156, 488, 14674, 16073, 13, 50834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09630449977489787, "compression_ratio": 1.550877192982456, "no_speech_prob": 1.6232314971331707e-12}, {"id": 35, "seek": 14656, "start": 156.12, "end": 157.4, "text": " It's a brilliant piece of work.", "tokens": [50843, 467, 311, 257, 10248, 2522, 295, 589, 13, 50907], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09630449977489787, "compression_ratio": 1.550877192982456, "no_speech_prob": 1.6232314971331707e-12}, {"id": 36, "seek": 14656, "start": 157.7, "end": 165.12, "text": " It really is. And our goal here for you listening is to shortcut through all that deafening noise of AI doomsday hype.", "tokens": [50922, 467, 534, 307, 13, 400, 527, 3387, 510, 337, 291, 4764, 307, 281, 24822, 807, 439, 300, 15559, 4559, 5658, 295, 7318, 360, 4785, 810, 24144, 13, 51293], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09630449977489787, "compression_ratio": 1.550877192982456, "no_speech_prob": 1.6232314971331707e-12}, {"id": 37, "seek": 14656, "start": 165.34, "end": 170.84, "text": " We want to look at the true mathematics of how complex systems actually survive modifying themselves.", "tokens": [51304, 492, 528, 281, 574, 412, 264, 2074, 18666, 295, 577, 3997, 3652, 767, 7867, 42626, 2969, 13, 51579], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09630449977489787, "compression_ratio": 1.550877192982456, "no_speech_prob": 1.6232314971331707e-12}, {"id": 38, "seek": 14656, "start": 171.02, "end": 173.82, "text": " Because we aren't just talking about silicon and code here.", "tokens": [51588, 1436, 321, 3212, 380, 445, 1417, 466, 22848, 293, 3089, 510, 13, 51728], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09630449977489787, "compression_ratio": 1.550877192982456, "no_speech_prob": 1.6232314971331707e-12}, {"id": 39, "seek": 17382, "start": 173.82, "end": 180.28, "text": " No, not at all. We are diving into biological cells, the evolution of human languages, the collapse of ancient empires.", "tokens": [50365, 883, 11, 406, 412, 439, 13, 492, 366, 20241, 666, 13910, 5438, 11, 264, 9303, 295, 1952, 8650, 11, 264, 15584, 295, 7832, 4012, 3145, 13, 50688], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11223930609030802, "compression_ratio": 1.6312292358803986, "no_speech_prob": 1.4664702828806608e-12}, {"id": 40, "seek": 17382, "start": 180.4, "end": 184.29999999999998, "text": " And eventually the literal philosophical nature of truth itself.", "tokens": [50694, 400, 4728, 264, 20411, 25066, 3687, 295, 3494, 2564, 13, 50889], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11223930609030802, "compression_ratio": 1.6312292358803986, "no_speech_prob": 1.4664702828806608e-12}, {"id": 41, "seek": 17382, "start": 184.51999999999998, "end": 186.12, "text": " Yes. It goes so deep.", "tokens": [50900, 1079, 13, 467, 1709, 370, 2452, 13, 50980], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11223930609030802, "compression_ratio": 1.6312292358803986, "no_speech_prob": 1.4664702828806608e-12}, {"id": 42, "seek": 17382, "start": 186.6, "end": 188.44, "text": " So let's just get into the mechanics of it.", "tokens": [51004, 407, 718, 311, 445, 483, 666, 264, 12939, 295, 309, 13, 51096], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11223930609030802, "compression_ratio": 1.6312292358803986, "no_speech_prob": 1.4664702828806608e-12}, {"id": 43, "seek": 17382, "start": 188.5, "end": 191.66, "text": " The first thing Flixion does is he goes right after the terminology.", "tokens": [51099, 440, 700, 551, 3235, 970, 313, 775, 307, 415, 1709, 558, 934, 264, 27575, 13, 51257], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11223930609030802, "compression_ratio": 1.6312292358803986, "no_speech_prob": 1.4664702828806608e-12}, {"id": 44, "seek": 17382, "start": 191.9, "end": 192.88, "text": " Yeah, the linguistic trap.", "tokens": [51269, 865, 11, 264, 43002, 11487, 13, 51318], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11223930609030802, "compression_ratio": 1.6312292358803986, "no_speech_prob": 1.4664702828806608e-12}, {"id": 45, "seek": 17382, "start": 193.06, "end": 196.54, "text": " Right. We automatically conflate the word change with improvement.", "tokens": [51327, 1779, 13, 492, 6772, 1497, 17593, 264, 1349, 1319, 365, 10444, 13, 51501], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11223930609030802, "compression_ratio": 1.6312292358803986, "no_speech_prob": 1.4664702828806608e-12}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17382, "start": 196.74, "end": 200.66, "text": " We just assume that if a machine alters itself, it must be optimizing itself.", "tokens": [51511, 492, 445, 6552, 300, 498, 257, 3479, 419, 1559, 2564, 11, 309, 1633, 312, 40425, 2564, 13, 51707], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11223930609030802, "compression_ratio": 1.6312292358803986, "no_speech_prob": 1.4664702828806608e-12}, {"id": 47, "seek": 20066, "start": 200.66, "end": 204.26, "text": " So Flixion lays out this formal adaptation hierarchy.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 3235, 970, 313, 32714, 484, 341, 9860, 21549, 22333, 13, 50545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1610767410462161, "compression_ratio": 1.5380952380952382, "no_speech_prob": 1.1922475810430266e-12}, {"id": 48, "seek": 20066, "start": 204.52, "end": 207.12, "text": " There are three distinct levels. Walk me through level one.", "tokens": [50558, 821, 366, 1045, 10644, 4358, 13, 10818, 385, 807, 1496, 472, 13, 50688], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1610767410462161, "compression_ratio": 1.5380952380952382, "no_speech_prob": 1.1922475810430266e-12}, {"id": 49, "seek": 20066, "start": 207.4, "end": 211.18, "text": " Okay. So level one is defined mathematically as a state update.", "tokens": [50702, 1033, 13, 407, 1496, 472, 307, 7642, 44003, 382, 257, 1785, 5623, 13, 50891], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1610767410462161, "compression_ratio": 1.5380952380952382, "no_speech_prob": 1.1922475810430266e-12}, {"id": 50, "seek": 20066, "start": 211.98, "end": 216.85999999999999, "text": " So in this scenario, the fundamental rule governing the system is locked completely in place.", "tokens": [50931, 407, 294, 341, 9005, 11, 264, 8088, 4978, 30054, 264, 1185, 307, 9376, 2584, 294, 1081, 13, 51175], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1610767410462161, "compression_ratio": 1.5380952380952382, "no_speech_prob": 1.1922475810430266e-12}, {"id": 51, "seek": 20066, "start": 217.0, "end": 218.01999999999998, "text": " It cannot be altered.", "tokens": [51182, 467, 2644, 312, 28783, 13, 51233], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1610767410462161, "compression_ratio": 1.5380952380952382, "no_speech_prob": 1.1922475810430266e-12}, {"id": 52, "seek": 20066, "start": 218.26, "end": 219.18, "text": " Okay. Locked in place.", "tokens": [51245, 1033, 13, 16736, 292, 294, 1081, 13, 51291], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1610767410462161, "compression_ratio": 1.5380952380952382, "no_speech_prob": 1.1922475810430266e-12}, {"id": 53, "seek": 20066, "start": 219.3, "end": 219.5, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51297, 1779, 13, 51307], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1610767410462161, "compression_ratio": 1.5380952380952382, "no_speech_prob": 1.1922475810430266e-12}, {"id": 54, "seek": 21950, "start": 219.5, "end": 224.56, "text": " What changes is merely the state of the system as it moves through a defined space.", "tokens": [50365, 708, 2962, 307, 17003, 264, 1785, 295, 264, 1185, 382, 309, 6067, 807, 257, 7642, 1901, 13, 50618], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14719143350615757, "compression_ratio": 1.6868686868686869, "no_speech_prob": 1.642768169760056e-12}, {"id": 55, "seek": 21950, "start": 224.8, "end": 226.36, "text": " So let's use a classic example.", "tokens": [50630, 407, 718, 311, 764, 257, 7230, 1365, 13, 50708], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14719143350615757, "compression_ratio": 1.6868686868686869, "no_speech_prob": 1.642768169760056e-12}, {"id": 56, "seek": 21950, "start": 226.76, "end": 227.24, "text": " Deep Blue.", "tokens": [50728, 14895, 8510, 13, 50752], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14719143350615757, "compression_ratio": 1.6868686868686869, "no_speech_prob": 1.642768169760056e-12}, {"id": 57, "seek": 21950, "start": 227.62, "end": 230.82, "text": " Oh, the IBM computer that beat Garry Kasparov in the 90s.", "tokens": [50771, 876, 11, 264, 23487, 3820, 300, 4224, 7995, 627, 28059, 2181, 5179, 294, 264, 4289, 82, 13, 50931], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14719143350615757, "compression_ratio": 1.6868686868686869, "no_speech_prob": 1.642768169760056e-12}, {"id": 58, "seek": 21950, "start": 231.06, "end": 233.12, "text": " Exactly. The brute force calculator.", "tokens": [50943, 7587, 13, 440, 47909, 3464, 24993, 13, 51046], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14719143350615757, "compression_ratio": 1.6868686868686869, "no_speech_prob": 1.642768169760056e-12}, {"id": 59, "seek": 21950, "start": 233.86, "end": 236.38, "text": " Deep Blue ran on an evaluation function.", "tokens": [51083, 14895, 8510, 5872, 322, 364, 13344, 2445, 13, 51209], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14719143350615757, "compression_ratio": 1.6868686868686869, "no_speech_prob": 1.642768169760056e-12}, {"id": 60, "seek": 21950, "start": 236.72, "end": 241.78, "text": " It's basically this massive mathematical polynomial that looks at a chessboard and spits out a score.", "tokens": [51226, 467, 311, 1936, 341, 5994, 18894, 26110, 300, 1542, 412, 257, 24122, 3787, 293, 637, 1208, 484, 257, 6175, 13, 51479], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14719143350615757, "compression_ratio": 1.6868686868686869, "no_speech_prob": 1.642768169760056e-12}, {"id": 61, "seek": 21950, "start": 241.92000000000002, "end": 244.54, "text": " Like a pawn is worth this much. A knight is worth that much.", "tokens": [51486, 1743, 257, 30905, 307, 3163, 341, 709, 13, 316, 26054, 307, 3163, 300, 709, 13, 51617], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14719143350615757, "compression_ratio": 1.6868686868686869, "no_speech_prob": 1.642768169760056e-12}, {"id": 62, "seek": 21950, "start": 244.64, "end": 248.02, "text": " Exactly. King safety is worth this much. Center control is worth this much.", "tokens": [51622, 7587, 13, 3819, 4514, 307, 3163, 341, 709, 13, 5169, 1969, 307, 3163, 341, 709, 13, 51791], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14719143350615757, "compression_ratio": 1.6868686868686869, "no_speech_prob": 1.642768169760056e-12}, {"id": 63, "seek": 24802, "start": 248.02, "end": 255.32000000000002, "text": " But the crucial thing to understand is that the math of that evaluation function never, ever changed while the game was being played.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 264, 11462, 551, 281, 1223, 307, 300, 264, 5221, 295, 300, 13344, 2445, 1128, 11, 1562, 3105, 1339, 264, 1216, 390, 885, 3737, 13, 50730], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12922650083489373, "compression_ratio": 1.688212927756654, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012518138346476e-12}, {"id": 64, "seek": 24802, "start": 255.58, "end": 257.78000000000003, "text": " The search algorithm never changed.", "tokens": [50743, 440, 3164, 9284, 1128, 3105, 13, 50853], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12922650083489373, "compression_ratio": 1.688212927756654, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012518138346476e-12}, {"id": 65, "seek": 24802, "start": 258.18, "end": 263.6, "text": " The only thing that adapted was the sequence of board states it visited in response to Kasparov's moves.", "tokens": [50873, 440, 787, 551, 300, 20871, 390, 264, 8310, 295, 3150, 4368, 309, 11220, 294, 4134, 281, 28059, 2181, 5179, 311, 6067, 13, 51144], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12922650083489373, "compression_ratio": 1.688212927756654, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012518138346476e-12}, {"id": 66, "seek": 24802, "start": 263.84000000000003, "end": 265.82, "text": " So I was thinking about this like a baking recipe.", "tokens": [51156, 407, 286, 390, 1953, 466, 341, 411, 257, 12102, 6782, 13, 51255], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12922650083489373, "compression_ratio": 1.688212927756654, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012518138346476e-12}, {"id": 67, "seek": 24802, "start": 266.38, "end": 268.86, "text": " It's like following a recipe card exactly as it's written.", "tokens": [51283, 467, 311, 411, 3480, 257, 6782, 2920, 2293, 382, 309, 311, 3720, 13, 51407], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12922650083489373, "compression_ratio": 1.688212927756654, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012518138346476e-12}, {"id": 68, "seek": 24802, "start": 269.76, "end": 271.62, "text": " The recipe is the fixed rule.", "tokens": [51452, 440, 6782, 307, 264, 6806, 4978, 13, 51545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12922650083489373, "compression_ratio": 1.688212927756654, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012518138346476e-12}, {"id": 69, "seek": 24802, "start": 271.82, "end": 272.78000000000003, "text": " That's a great way to put it.", "tokens": [51555, 663, 311, 257, 869, 636, 281, 829, 309, 13, 51603], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12922650083489373, "compression_ratio": 1.688212927756654, "no_speech_prob": 1.5012518138346476e-12}, {"id": 70, "seek": 27278, "start": 272.78, "end": 274.79999999999995, "text": " Like you might adapt to the environment.", "tokens": [50365, 1743, 291, 1062, 6231, 281, 264, 2823, 13, 50466], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200815640963042, "compression_ratio": 1.5893536121673004, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279116064002677e-12}, {"id": 71, "seek": 27278, "start": 275.09999999999997, "end": 277.78, "text": " Say you realize you're out of chocolate chips, so you grab walnuts instead.", "tokens": [50481, 6463, 291, 4325, 291, 434, 484, 295, 6215, 11583, 11, 370, 291, 4444, 21346, 29251, 2602, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200815640963042, "compression_ratio": 1.5893536121673004, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279116064002677e-12}, {"id": 72, "seek": 27278, "start": 278.35999999999996, "end": 280.14, "text": " The physical state of your kitchen is changing.", "tokens": [50644, 440, 4001, 1785, 295, 428, 6525, 307, 4473, 13, 50733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200815640963042, "compression_ratio": 1.5893536121673004, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279116064002677e-12}, {"id": 73, "seek": 27278, "start": 280.96, "end": 284.09999999999997, "text": " But you aren't fundamentally rewriting the instructions on the paper.", "tokens": [50774, 583, 291, 3212, 380, 17879, 319, 19868, 264, 9415, 322, 264, 3035, 13, 50931], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200815640963042, "compression_ratio": 1.5893536121673004, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279116064002677e-12}, {"id": 74, "seek": 27278, "start": 284.26, "end": 285.58, "text": " You're just executing the algorithm.", "tokens": [50939, 509, 434, 445, 32368, 264, 9284, 13, 51005], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200815640963042, "compression_ratio": 1.5893536121673004, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279116064002677e-12}, {"id": 75, "seek": 27278, "start": 286.03999999999996, "end": 287.5, "text": " That is pure level one.", "tokens": [51028, 663, 307, 6075, 1496, 472, 13, 51101], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200815640963042, "compression_ratio": 1.5893536121673004, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279116064002677e-12}, {"id": 76, "seek": 27278, "start": 288.44, "end": 292.78, "text": " Now things get a lot more sophisticated at level two, which Fliction calls the parameter update.", "tokens": [51148, 823, 721, 483, 257, 688, 544, 16950, 412, 1496, 732, 11, 597, 3235, 4105, 5498, 264, 13075, 5623, 13, 51365], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200815640963042, "compression_ratio": 1.5893536121673004, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279116064002677e-12}, {"id": 77, "seek": 27278, "start": 293.88, "end": 295.21999999999997, "text": " Parameter update. Got it.", "tokens": [51420, 34882, 2398, 5623, 13, 5803, 309, 13, 51487], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18200815640963042, "compression_ratio": 1.5893536121673004, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279116064002677e-12}, {"id": 78, "seek": 29522, "start": 295.22, "end": 302.32000000000005, "text": " Here, the overall architecture of the system is still completely fixed, but the internal parameters within that architecture are moving.", "tokens": [50365, 1692, 11, 264, 4787, 9482, 295, 264, 1185, 307, 920, 2584, 6806, 11, 457, 264, 6920, 9834, 1951, 300, 9482, 366, 2684, 13, 50720], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20231038470600926, "compression_ratio": 1.5225225225225225, "no_speech_prob": 2.052432225910228e-12}, {"id": 79, "seek": 29522, "start": 302.54, "end": 303.1, "text": " They're adjusting.", "tokens": [50731, 814, 434, 23559, 13, 50759], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20231038470600926, "compression_ratio": 1.5225225225225225, "no_speech_prob": 2.052432225910228e-12}, {"id": 80, "seek": 29522, "start": 303.64000000000004, "end": 306.0, "text": " The perfect modern example is AlphaZero.", "tokens": [50786, 440, 2176, 4363, 1365, 307, 20588, 57, 2032, 13, 50904], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20231038470600926, "compression_ratio": 1.5225225225225225, "no_speech_prob": 2.052432225910228e-12}, {"id": 81, "seek": 29522, "start": 306.28000000000003, "end": 306.76000000000005, "text": " Okay, wait.", "tokens": [50918, 1033, 11, 1699, 13, 50942], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20231038470600926, "compression_ratio": 1.5225225225225225, "no_speech_prob": 2.052432225910228e-12}, {"id": 82, "seek": 29522, "start": 307.14000000000004, "end": 311.74, "text": " AlphaZero is the deep-mind AI that taught itself to master Go and chess, right?", "tokens": [50961, 20588, 57, 2032, 307, 264, 2452, 12, 13733, 7318, 300, 5928, 2564, 281, 4505, 1037, 293, 24122, 11, 558, 30, 51191], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20231038470600926, "compression_ratio": 1.5225225225225225, "no_speech_prob": 2.052432225910228e-12}, {"id": 83, "seek": 29522, "start": 311.86, "end": 312.20000000000005, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51197, 1079, 13, 51214], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20231038470600926, "compression_ratio": 1.5225225225225225, "no_speech_prob": 2.052432225910228e-12}, {"id": 84, "seek": 29522, "start": 312.42, "end": 314.82000000000005, "text": " By playing millions of games against itself.", "tokens": [51225, 3146, 2433, 6803, 295, 2813, 1970, 2564, 13, 51345], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20231038470600926, "compression_ratio": 1.5225225225225225, "no_speech_prob": 2.052432225910228e-12}, {"id": 85, "seek": 31482, "start": 314.82, "end": 320.59999999999997, "text": " But it started with random moves and eventually discovered all these strategies humans had never seen before.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 309, 1409, 365, 4974, 6067, 293, 4728, 6941, 439, 613, 9029, 6255, 632, 1128, 1612, 949, 13, 50654], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17231214457544788, "compression_ratio": 1.523489932885906, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191793135971299e-12}, {"id": 86, "seek": 31482, "start": 321.4, "end": 324.2, "text": " That really feels like it's rewriting its own rules.", "tokens": [50694, 663, 534, 3417, 411, 309, 311, 319, 19868, 1080, 1065, 4474, 13, 50834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17231214457544788, "compression_ratio": 1.523489932885906, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191793135971299e-12}, {"id": 87, "seek": 31482, "start": 324.68, "end": 328.1, "text": " How is that not level three recursive self-improvement?", "tokens": [50858, 1012, 307, 300, 406, 1496, 1045, 20560, 488, 2698, 12, 332, 46955, 518, 30, 51029], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17231214457544788, "compression_ratio": 1.523489932885906, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191793135971299e-12}, {"id": 88, "seek": 31482, "start": 328.36, "end": 331.48, "text": " And this is exactly where the public gets tripped up.", "tokens": [51042, 400, 341, 307, 2293, 689, 264, 1908, 2170, 1376, 3320, 493, 13, 51198], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17231214457544788, "compression_ratio": 1.523489932885906, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191793135971299e-12}, {"id": 89, "seek": 31482, "start": 331.56, "end": 332.71999999999997, "text": " I mean, it feels like magic.", "tokens": [51202, 286, 914, 11, 309, 3417, 411, 5585, 13, 51260], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17231214457544788, "compression_ratio": 1.523489932885906, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191793135971299e-12}, {"id": 90, "seek": 31482, "start": 333.38, "end": 335.88, "text": " But mechanically, it's a parameter update.", "tokens": [51293, 583, 4236, 984, 11, 309, 311, 257, 13075, 5623, 13, 51418], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17231214457544788, "compression_ratio": 1.523489932885906, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191793135971299e-12}, {"id": 91, "seek": 31482, "start": 336.02, "end": 336.26, "text": " Really?", "tokens": [51425, 4083, 30, 51437], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17231214457544788, "compression_ratio": 1.523489932885906, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191793135971299e-12}, {"id": 92, "seek": 31482, "start": 336.56, "end": 336.8, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51452, 865, 13, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17231214457544788, "compression_ratio": 1.523489932885906, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191793135971299e-12}, {"id": 93, "seek": 31482, "start": 337.15999999999997, "end": 342.48, "text": " When researchers built AlphaZero, they fixed the architecture of the neural network in advance.", "tokens": [51482, 1133, 10309, 3094, 20588, 57, 2032, 11, 436, 6806, 264, 9482, 295, 264, 18161, 3209, 294, 7295, 13, 51748], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17231214457544788, "compression_ratio": 1.523489932885906, "no_speech_prob": 1.5191793135971299e-12}, {"id": 94, "seek": 34248, "start": 342.48, "end": 347.12, "text": " They decided exactly how many layers of artificial neurons there would be.", "tokens": [50365, 814, 3047, 2293, 577, 867, 7914, 295, 11677, 22027, 456, 576, 312, 13, 50597], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 95, "seek": 34248, "start": 347.40000000000003, "end": 348.64000000000004, "text": " Okay, so the structure is rigid.", "tokens": [50611, 1033, 11, 370, 264, 3877, 307, 22195, 13, 50673], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 96, "seek": 34248, "start": 348.98, "end": 349.64000000000004, "text": " Totally rigid.", "tokens": [50690, 22837, 22195, 13, 50723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 97, "seek": 34248, "start": 349.76, "end": 351.84000000000003, "text": " They set the reinforcement learning update rule.", "tokens": [50729, 814, 992, 264, 29280, 2539, 5623, 4978, 13, 50833], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 98, "seek": 34248, "start": 352.5, "end": 356.16, "text": " What actually changes during those millions of games are just the weights.", "tokens": [50866, 708, 767, 2962, 1830, 729, 6803, 295, 2813, 366, 445, 264, 17443, 13, 51049], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 99, "seek": 34248, "start": 356.42, "end": 356.88, "text": " The weights.", "tokens": [51062, 440, 17443, 13, 51085], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 100, "seek": 34248, "start": 357.34000000000003, "end": 358.1, "text": " Break that down for me.", "tokens": [51108, 16925, 300, 760, 337, 385, 13, 51146], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 101, "seek": 34248, "start": 358.14000000000004, "end": 358.8, "text": " What does that mean?", "tokens": [51148, 708, 775, 300, 914, 30, 51181], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 102, "seek": 34248, "start": 358.90000000000003, "end": 363.38, "text": " Imagine millions of little volume nogs connecting different parts of the network.", "tokens": [51186, 11739, 6803, 295, 707, 5523, 572, 21559, 11015, 819, 3166, 295, 264, 3209, 13, 51410], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 103, "seek": 34248, "start": 363.76, "end": 365.1, "text": " Initially, they're just set randomly.", "tokens": [51429, 29446, 11, 436, 434, 445, 992, 16979, 13, 51496], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 104, "seek": 34248, "start": 365.68, "end": 371.94, "text": " When AlphaZero plays a game and loses, an algorithm calculates which knobs contributed to the loss,", "tokens": [51525, 1133, 20588, 57, 2032, 5749, 257, 1216, 293, 18293, 11, 364, 9284, 4322, 1024, 597, 46999, 18434, 281, 264, 4470, 11, 51838], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14824481237502324, "compression_ratio": 1.6273291925465838, "no_speech_prob": 1.42157607300325e-12}, {"id": 105, "seek": 37194, "start": 371.94, "end": 374.88, "text": " and it turns them down a tiny fraction of a percent.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 309, 4523, 552, 760, 257, 5870, 14135, 295, 257, 3043, 13, 50512], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 106, "seek": 37194, "start": 375.21999999999997, "end": 375.52, "text": " Oh, I see.", "tokens": [50529, 876, 11, 286, 536, 13, 50544], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 107, "seek": 37194, "start": 375.6, "end": 376.74, "text": " And when it wins, it turns them up.", "tokens": [50548, 400, 562, 309, 10641, 11, 309, 4523, 552, 493, 13, 50605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 108, "seek": 37194, "start": 376.86, "end": 377.16, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50611, 7587, 13, 50626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 109, "seek": 37194, "start": 377.62, "end": 382.84, "text": " Over millions of iterations, it finds the optimal configuration for those volume nogs.", "tokens": [50649, 4886, 6803, 295, 36540, 11, 309, 10704, 264, 16252, 11694, 337, 729, 5523, 572, 21559, 13, 50910], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 110, "seek": 37194, "start": 383.18, "end": 387.96, "text": " But no matter how many games it plays, it can never sprout a new layer of neurons.", "tokens": [50927, 583, 572, 1871, 577, 867, 2813, 309, 5749, 11, 309, 393, 1128, 43728, 257, 777, 4583, 295, 22027, 13, 51166], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 111, "seek": 37194, "start": 388.14, "end": 389.78, "text": " It can't invent a new math function.", "tokens": [51175, 467, 393, 380, 7962, 257, 777, 5221, 2445, 13, 51257], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 112, "seek": 37194, "start": 389.88, "end": 390.02, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51262, 1779, 13, 51269], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 113, "seek": 37194, "start": 390.14, "end": 390.84, "text": " It's locked.", "tokens": [51275, 467, 311, 9376, 13, 51310], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 114, "seek": 37194, "start": 391.06, "end": 391.14, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51321, 1779, 13, 51325], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 115, "seek": 37194, "start": 391.38, "end": 392.5, "text": " So back to the kitchen analogy.", "tokens": [51337, 407, 646, 281, 264, 6525, 21663, 13, 51393], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 116, "seek": 37194, "start": 393.02, "end": 395.52, "text": " Level two is like you're using the same recipe card,", "tokens": [51419, 16872, 732, 307, 411, 291, 434, 1228, 264, 912, 6782, 2920, 11, 51544], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 117, "seek": 37194, "start": 395.68, "end": 400.12, "text": " but now you're actively adjusting the seasoning to taste over time.", "tokens": [51552, 457, 586, 291, 434, 13022, 23559, 264, 23421, 281, 3939, 670, 565, 13, 51774], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1507283203990747, "compression_ratio": 1.65, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310968638770905e-12}, {"id": 118, "seek": 40012, "start": 400.12, "end": 405.26, "text": " You bake a batch, it's too bland, so the next time you add more salt, you tweak the baking time.", "tokens": [50365, 509, 16562, 257, 15245, 11, 309, 311, 886, 29849, 11, 370, 264, 958, 565, 291, 909, 544, 5139, 11, 291, 29879, 264, 12102, 565, 13, 50622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13588707045753404, "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356198079964246e-12}, {"id": 119, "seek": 40012, "start": 405.8, "end": 411.7, "text": " But the fundamental architecture, cream, the butter, and the sugar, is identical.", "tokens": [50649, 583, 264, 8088, 9482, 11, 4689, 11, 264, 5517, 11, 293, 264, 5076, 11, 307, 14800, 13, 50944], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13588707045753404, "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356198079964246e-12}, {"id": 120, "seek": 40012, "start": 411.94, "end": 412.42, "text": " Precisely.", "tokens": [50956, 48746, 736, 13, 50980], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13588707045753404, "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356198079964246e-12}, {"id": 121, "seek": 40012, "start": 412.56, "end": 415.96, "text": " And this is the most common category error in the tech world today.", "tokens": [50987, 400, 341, 307, 264, 881, 2689, 7719, 6713, 294, 264, 7553, 1002, 965, 13, 51157], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13588707045753404, "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356198079964246e-12}, {"id": 122, "seek": 40012, "start": 416.18, "end": 421.38, "text": " People look at large language models getting dramatically better at answering questions,", "tokens": [51168, 3432, 574, 412, 2416, 2856, 5245, 1242, 17548, 1101, 412, 13430, 1651, 11, 51428], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13588707045753404, "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356198079964246e-12}, {"id": 123, "seek": 40012, "start": 421.62, "end": 424.18, "text": " and they see a system updating its parameters.", "tokens": [51440, 293, 436, 536, 257, 1185, 25113, 1080, 9834, 13, 51568], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13588707045753404, "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356198079964246e-12}, {"id": 124, "seek": 40012, "start": 424.26, "end": 424.76, "text": " And they panic.", "tokens": [51572, 400, 436, 14783, 13, 51597], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13588707045753404, "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873, "no_speech_prob": 1.6356198079964246e-12}, {"id": 125, "seek": 42476, "start": 424.76, "end": 428.58, "text": " They completely panic because they conflate that parameter tweaking with level three.", "tokens": [50365, 814, 2584, 14783, 570, 436, 1497, 17593, 300, 13075, 6986, 2456, 365, 1496, 1045, 13, 50556], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 126, "seek": 42476, "start": 428.86, "end": 432.4, "text": " They think the machine is suddenly going to rewrite its own underlying architecture.", "tokens": [50570, 814, 519, 264, 3479, 307, 5800, 516, 281, 28132, 1080, 1065, 14217, 9482, 13, 50747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 127, "seek": 42476, "start": 432.8, "end": 434.03999999999996, "text": " But it can't do that.", "tokens": [50767, 583, 309, 393, 380, 360, 300, 13, 50829], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 128, "seek": 42476, "start": 434.44, "end": 439.24, "text": " A system locked in level two cannot organically graduate to level three just by practicing a lot.", "tokens": [50849, 316, 1185, 9376, 294, 1496, 732, 2644, 1798, 984, 8080, 281, 1496, 1045, 445, 538, 11350, 257, 688, 13, 51089], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 129, "seek": 42476, "start": 439.38, "end": 439.68, "text": " Wow.", "tokens": [51096, 3153, 13, 51111], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 130, "seek": 42476, "start": 440.32, "end": 440.59999999999997, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51143, 1033, 13, 51157], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 131, "seek": 42476, "start": 440.86, "end": 443.76, "text": " Which brings us to level three itself, the rule update.", "tokens": [51170, 3013, 5607, 505, 281, 1496, 1045, 2564, 11, 264, 4978, 5623, 13, 51315], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 132, "seek": 42476, "start": 443.84, "end": 444.02, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51319, 1779, 13, 51328], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 133, "seek": 42476, "start": 444.09999999999997, "end": 444.88, "text": " The holy grail.", "tokens": [51332, 440, 10622, 1295, 388, 13, 51371], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 134, "seek": 42476, "start": 445.03999999999996, "end": 448.78, "text": " This is where the mapping governing the future behavior is itself modified.", "tokens": [51379, 639, 307, 689, 264, 18350, 30054, 264, 2027, 5223, 307, 2564, 15873, 13, 51566], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 135, "seek": 42476, "start": 449.3, "end": 451.59999999999997, "text": " The rule that makes the rules gets changed.", "tokens": [51592, 440, 4978, 300, 1669, 264, 4474, 2170, 3105, 13, 51707], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15823585756363406, "compression_ratio": 1.694915254237288, "no_speech_prob": 1.3935664688186078e-12}, {"id": 136, "seek": 45160, "start": 451.6, "end": 452.20000000000005, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50395], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18124940477568527, "compression_ratio": 1.6293706293706294, "no_speech_prob": 2.553062795895844e-12}, {"id": 137, "seek": 45160, "start": 452.62, "end": 457.12, "text": " In level three, the object being modified isn't a state, and it isn't a weight parameter.", "tokens": [50416, 682, 1496, 1045, 11, 264, 2657, 885, 15873, 1943, 380, 257, 1785, 11, 293, 309, 1943, 380, 257, 3364, 13075, 13, 50641], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18124940477568527, "compression_ratio": 1.6293706293706294, "no_speech_prob": 2.553062795895844e-12}, {"id": 138, "seek": 45160, "start": 457.66, "end": 459.82000000000005, "text": " It is the functional form of the system.", "tokens": [50668, 467, 307, 264, 11745, 1254, 295, 264, 1185, 13, 50776], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18124940477568527, "compression_ratio": 1.6293706293706294, "no_speech_prob": 2.553062795895844e-12}, {"id": 139, "seek": 45160, "start": 460.28000000000003, "end": 462.44, "text": " The equations themselves mutate.", "tokens": [50799, 440, 11787, 2969, 5839, 473, 13, 50907], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18124940477568527, "compression_ratio": 1.6293706293706294, "no_speech_prob": 2.553062795895844e-12}, {"id": 140, "seek": 45160, "start": 462.52000000000004, "end": 467.78000000000003, "text": " And people treat this like it's this impossible apocalyptic threshold that we haven't crossed yet.", "tokens": [50911, 400, 561, 2387, 341, 411, 309, 311, 341, 6243, 1882, 47407, 14678, 300, 321, 2378, 380, 14622, 1939, 13, 51174], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18124940477568527, "compression_ratio": 1.6293706293706294, "no_speech_prob": 2.553062795895844e-12}, {"id": 141, "seek": 45160, "start": 467.88, "end": 471.6, "text": " But level three is already a completely standard engineering technique.", "tokens": [51179, 583, 1496, 1045, 307, 1217, 257, 2584, 3832, 7043, 6532, 13, 51365], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18124940477568527, "compression_ratio": 1.6293706293706294, "no_speech_prob": 2.553062795895844e-12}, {"id": 142, "seek": 45160, "start": 471.74, "end": 472.34000000000003, "text": " Wait, really?", "tokens": [51372, 3802, 11, 534, 30, 51402], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18124940477568527, "compression_ratio": 1.6293706293706294, "no_speech_prob": 2.553062795895844e-12}, {"id": 143, "seek": 45160, "start": 473.32000000000005, "end": 477.40000000000003, "text": " We already have AI that rewrites its own architectural rules.", "tokens": [51451, 492, 1217, 362, 7318, 300, 319, 86, 30931, 1080, 1065, 26621, 4474, 13, 51655], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18124940477568527, "compression_ratio": 1.6293706293706294, "no_speech_prob": 2.553062795895844e-12}, {"id": 144, "seek": 45160, "start": 477.58000000000004, "end": 478.12, "text": " We do.", "tokens": [51664, 492, 360, 13, 51691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18124940477568527, "compression_ratio": 1.6293706293706294, "no_speech_prob": 2.553062795895844e-12}, {"id": 145, "seek": 45160, "start": 478.58000000000004, "end": 480.24, "text": " Think about neural architecture search.", "tokens": [51714, 6557, 466, 18161, 9482, 3164, 13, 51797], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18124940477568527, "compression_ratio": 1.6293706293706294, "no_speech_prob": 2.553062795895844e-12}, {"id": 146, "seek": 48024, "start": 480.24, "end": 484.14, "text": " Usually, a human engineer designs the layout of a neural network.", "tokens": [50365, 11419, 11, 257, 1952, 11403, 11347, 264, 13333, 295, 257, 18161, 3209, 13, 50560], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 147, "seek": 48024, "start": 484.54, "end": 489.88, "text": " But in neural architecture search, you have an AI that evaluates candidate network topologies.", "tokens": [50580, 583, 294, 18161, 9482, 3164, 11, 291, 362, 364, 7318, 300, 6133, 1024, 11532, 3209, 1192, 6204, 13, 50847], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 148, "seek": 48024, "start": 490.08, "end": 491.48, "text": " So it's testing different structures.", "tokens": [50857, 407, 309, 311, 4997, 819, 9227, 13, 50927], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 149, "seek": 48024, "start": 491.7, "end": 491.94, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50938, 1079, 13, 50950], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 150, "seek": 48024, "start": 492.2, "end": 496.3, "text": " It tests them, discards the bad ones, selects better performing ones.", "tokens": [50963, 467, 6921, 552, 11, 2983, 2287, 264, 1578, 2306, 11, 3048, 82, 1101, 10205, 2306, 13, 51168], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 151, "seek": 48024, "start": 496.40000000000003, "end": 500.58, "text": " It is literally changing the functional form that future training will operate on.", "tokens": [51173, 467, 307, 3736, 4473, 264, 11745, 1254, 300, 2027, 3097, 486, 9651, 322, 13, 51382], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 152, "seek": 48024, "start": 500.76, "end": 502.86, "text": " That sounds exactly like what people are terrified of.", "tokens": [51391, 663, 3263, 2293, 411, 437, 561, 366, 23051, 295, 13, 51496], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 153, "seek": 48024, "start": 502.88, "end": 503.44, "text": " It does.", "tokens": [51497, 467, 775, 13, 51525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 154, "seek": 48024, "start": 503.56, "end": 503.72, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51531, 865, 13, 51539], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 155, "seek": 48024, "start": 503.8, "end": 507.0, "text": " But let's look at an even older example, the self-hosting compiler.", "tokens": [51543, 583, 718, 311, 574, 412, 364, 754, 4906, 1365, 11, 264, 2698, 12, 6037, 278, 31958, 13, 51703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 156, "seek": 48024, "start": 507.42, "end": 508.74, "text": " This has been around for decades.", "tokens": [51724, 639, 575, 668, 926, 337, 7878, 13, 51790], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11967939362490088, "compression_ratio": 1.665615141955836, "no_speech_prob": 1.7900143173266159e-12}, {"id": 157, "seek": 50874, "start": 508.74, "end": 513.98, "text": " A compiler is just the software that translates human readable code into machine code, right?", "tokens": [50365, 316, 31958, 307, 445, 264, 4722, 300, 28468, 1952, 49857, 3089, 666, 3479, 3089, 11, 558, 30, 50627], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21025424390225797, "compression_ratio": 1.4894736842105263, "no_speech_prob": 1.3881404706261868e-12}, {"id": 158, "seek": 50874, "start": 514.08, "end": 514.92, "text": " The ones in the arrows.", "tokens": [50632, 440, 2306, 294, 264, 19669, 13, 50674], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21025424390225797, "compression_ratio": 1.4894736842105263, "no_speech_prob": 1.3881404706261868e-12}, {"id": 159, "seek": 50874, "start": 515.3, "end": 515.7, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50693, 7587, 13, 50713], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21025424390225797, "compression_ratio": 1.4894736842105263, "no_speech_prob": 1.3881404706261868e-12}, {"id": 160, "seek": 50874, "start": 516.08, "end": 518.9, "text": " Now, early compilers had to be written in assembly language.", "tokens": [50732, 823, 11, 2440, 715, 388, 433, 632, 281, 312, 3720, 294, 12103, 2856, 13, 50873], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21025424390225797, "compression_ratio": 1.4894736842105263, "no_speech_prob": 1.3881404706261868e-12}, {"id": 161, "seek": 50874, "start": 519.1, "end": 523.28, "text": " But eventually, a compiler gets good enough that it can translate its own source code.", "tokens": [50883, 583, 4728, 11, 257, 31958, 2170, 665, 1547, 300, 309, 393, 13799, 1080, 1065, 4009, 3089, 13, 51092], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21025424390225797, "compression_ratio": 1.4894736842105263, "no_speech_prob": 1.3881404706261868e-12}, {"id": 162, "seek": 50874, "start": 523.46, "end": 524.0, "text": " Oh, wow.", "tokens": [51101, 876, 11, 6076, 13, 51128], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21025424390225797, "compression_ratio": 1.4894736842105263, "no_speech_prob": 1.3881404706261868e-12}, {"id": 163, "seek": 52400, "start": 524.0, "end": 536.32, "text": " Yeah, so you can write a C++ compiler in C++ and 1, meaning the compiler can literally rewrite the algorithmic rules it uses to compile programs, including compiling the next version of itself.", "tokens": [50365, 865, 11, 370, 291, 393, 2464, 257, 383, 25472, 31958, 294, 383, 25472, 293, 502, 11, 3620, 264, 31958, 393, 3736, 28132, 264, 9284, 299, 4474, 309, 4960, 281, 31413, 4268, 11, 3009, 715, 4883, 264, 958, 3037, 295, 2564, 13, 50981], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15787764329176682, "compression_ratio": 1.5085714285714287, "no_speech_prob": 1.500935335220499e-12}, {"id": 164, "seek": 52400, "start": 536.44, "end": 537.02, "text": " That is wise.", "tokens": [50987, 663, 307, 10829, 13, 51016], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15787764329176682, "compression_ratio": 1.5085714285714287, "no_speech_prob": 1.500935335220499e-12}, {"id": 165, "seek": 52400, "start": 537.04, "end": 540.62, "text": " It is pure, mathematically verifiable level 3 recursion.", "tokens": [51017, 467, 307, 6075, 11, 44003, 1306, 30876, 1496, 805, 20560, 313, 13, 51196], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15787764329176682, "compression_ratio": 1.5085714285714287, "no_speech_prob": 1.500935335220499e-12}, {"id": 166, "seek": 54062, "start": 540.62, "end": 541.96, "text": " Okay, but hold on.", "tokens": [50365, 1033, 11, 457, 1797, 322, 13, 50432], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15290133158365884, "compression_ratio": 1.435897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.1739464652119058e-12}, {"id": 167, "seek": 54062, "start": 541.96, "end": 551.84, "text": " If self-hosting compilers have existed for decades and they're already doing level 3 recursion, meaning they can rewrite the rules that rewrite the rules, why haven't compilers taken over the world?", "tokens": [50432, 759, 2698, 12, 6037, 278, 715, 388, 433, 362, 13135, 337, 7878, 293, 436, 434, 1217, 884, 1496, 805, 20560, 313, 11, 3620, 436, 393, 28132, 264, 4474, 300, 28132, 264, 4474, 11, 983, 2378, 380, 715, 388, 433, 2726, 670, 264, 1002, 30, 50926], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15290133158365884, "compression_ratio": 1.435897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.1739464652119058e-12}, {"id": 168, "seek": 54062, "start": 551.98, "end": 552.34, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50933, 1779, 13, 50951], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15290133158365884, "compression_ratio": 1.435897435897436, "no_speech_prob": 1.1739464652119058e-12}, {"id": 169, "seek": 55234, "start": 552.34, "end": 561.7800000000001, "text": " Why didn't a C++ compiler from 1995 undergo an intelligence explosion and, you know, turn the solar system into paperclips?", "tokens": [50365, 1545, 994, 380, 257, 383, 25472, 31958, 490, 22601, 26426, 364, 7599, 15673, 293, 11, 291, 458, 11, 1261, 264, 7936, 1185, 666, 3035, 3474, 2600, 30, 50837], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12797361261704387, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.4271361870044075e-12}, {"id": 170, "seek": 55234, "start": 562.08, "end": 565.1800000000001, "text": " And there is the fatal flaw in the AI doomsday narrative.", "tokens": [50852, 400, 456, 307, 264, 24069, 13717, 294, 264, 7318, 360, 4785, 810, 9977, 13, 51007], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12797361261704387, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.4271361870044075e-12}, {"id": 171, "seek": 55234, "start": 565.36, "end": 567.02, "text": " Fliction highlights this so brilliantly.", "tokens": [51016, 3235, 4105, 14254, 341, 370, 8695, 42580, 13, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12797361261704387, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.4271361870044075e-12}, {"id": 172, "seek": 55234, "start": 567.62, "end": 571.46, "text": " The assumption is that modifying a rule automatically leads to a better rule.", "tokens": [51129, 440, 15302, 307, 300, 42626, 257, 4978, 6772, 6689, 281, 257, 1101, 4978, 13, 51321], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12797361261704387, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.4271361870044075e-12}, {"id": 173, "seek": 55234, "start": 571.58, "end": 572.32, "text": " Which isn't true.", "tokens": [51327, 3013, 1943, 380, 2074, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12797361261704387, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.4271361870044075e-12}, {"id": 174, "seek": 55234, "start": 572.7800000000001, "end": 576.98, "text": " Mathematically, just because you can change your foundational algorithm doesn't mean you make it more capable.", "tokens": [51387, 15776, 40197, 11, 445, 570, 291, 393, 1319, 428, 32195, 9284, 1177, 380, 914, 291, 652, 309, 544, 8189, 13, 51597], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12797361261704387, "compression_ratio": 1.5, "no_speech_prob": 1.4271361870044075e-12}, {"id": 175, "seek": 57698, "start": 576.98, "end": 582.0600000000001, "text": " You can absolutely undergo a level 3 recursive modification and make yourself worse.", "tokens": [50365, 509, 393, 3122, 26426, 257, 1496, 805, 20560, 488, 26747, 293, 652, 1803, 5324, 13, 50619], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1572533349196116, "compression_ratio": 1.592741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735382831796874e-12}, {"id": 176, "seek": 57698, "start": 582.5600000000001, "end": 583.5, "text": " You can break yourself.", "tokens": [50644, 509, 393, 1821, 1803, 13, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1572533349196116, "compression_ratio": 1.592741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735382831796874e-12}, {"id": 177, "seek": 57698, "start": 583.64, "end": 584.08, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50698, 7587, 13, 50720], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1572533349196116, "compression_ratio": 1.592741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735382831796874e-12}, {"id": 178, "seek": 57698, "start": 584.38, "end": 589.14, "text": " In fact, statistically, most random changes to a complex system will destroy it.", "tokens": [50735, 682, 1186, 11, 36478, 11, 881, 4974, 2962, 281, 257, 3997, 1185, 486, 5293, 309, 13, 50973], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1572533349196116, "compression_ratio": 1.592741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735382831796874e-12}, {"id": 179, "seek": 57698, "start": 589.66, "end": 594.0600000000001, "text": " A system can recursively self-modify itself straight into a brick wall.", "tokens": [50999, 316, 1185, 393, 20560, 3413, 2698, 12, 8014, 2505, 2564, 2997, 666, 257, 16725, 2929, 13, 51219], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1572533349196116, "compression_ratio": 1.592741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735382831796874e-12}, {"id": 180, "seek": 57698, "start": 594.5, "end": 597.94, "text": " Which brings us right back to that corporate supply chain scenario.", "tokens": [51241, 3013, 5607, 505, 558, 646, 281, 300, 10896, 5847, 5021, 9005, 13, 51413], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1572533349196116, "compression_ratio": 1.592741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735382831796874e-12}, {"id": 181, "seek": 57698, "start": 598.12, "end": 598.38, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51422, 1079, 13, 51435], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1572533349196116, "compression_ratio": 1.592741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735382831796874e-12}, {"id": 182, "seek": 57698, "start": 598.66, "end": 601.58, "text": " That logistics company was doing level 3 recursion.", "tokens": [51449, 663, 27420, 2237, 390, 884, 1496, 805, 20560, 313, 13, 51595], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1572533349196116, "compression_ratio": 1.592741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 1.5735382831796874e-12}, {"id": 183, "seek": 60158, "start": 601.58, "end": 607.6, "text": " The rules generating their future restructuring decisions were a product of their prior decisions.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 4474, 17746, 641, 2027, 1472, 1757, 1345, 5327, 645, 257, 1674, 295, 641, 4059, 5327, 13, 50666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16458868765616202, "compression_ratio": 1.7178571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.783202058236455e-12}, {"id": 184, "seek": 60158, "start": 607.84, "end": 609.0, "text": " They were self-modifying.", "tokens": [50678, 814, 645, 2698, 12, 8014, 5489, 13, 50736], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16458868765616202, "compression_ratio": 1.7178571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.783202058236455e-12}, {"id": 185, "seek": 60158, "start": 609.36, "end": 611.5, "text": " But they didn't become a godlike entity.", "tokens": [50754, 583, 436, 994, 380, 1813, 257, 3044, 4092, 13977, 13, 50861], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16458868765616202, "compression_ratio": 1.7178571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.783202058236455e-12}, {"id": 186, "seek": 60158, "start": 611.74, "end": 611.98, "text": " No.", "tokens": [50873, 883, 13, 50885], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16458868765616202, "compression_ratio": 1.7178571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.783202058236455e-12}, {"id": 187, "seek": 60158, "start": 612.2800000000001, "end": 613.6800000000001, "text": " They became horribly brittle.", "tokens": [50900, 814, 3062, 45028, 49325, 13, 50970], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16458868765616202, "compression_ratio": 1.7178571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.783202058236455e-12}, {"id": 188, "seek": 60158, "start": 614.1600000000001, "end": 621.22, "text": " Their idea of improvement was narrowly focused on cutting costs, and they pursued that until they destroyed the structural integrity of the company.", "tokens": [50994, 6710, 1558, 295, 10444, 390, 9432, 356, 5178, 322, 6492, 5497, 11, 293, 436, 34893, 300, 1826, 436, 8937, 264, 15067, 16000, 295, 264, 2237, 13, 51347], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16458868765616202, "compression_ratio": 1.7178571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.783202058236455e-12}, {"id": 189, "seek": 60158, "start": 621.36, "end": 624.36, "text": " That is the core insight of Fliction's adaptation hierarchy.", "tokens": [51354, 663, 307, 264, 4965, 11269, 295, 3235, 4105, 311, 21549, 22333, 13, 51504], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16458868765616202, "compression_ratio": 1.7178571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.783202058236455e-12}, {"id": 190, "seek": 60158, "start": 625.08, "end": 628.76, "text": " The AGI community is obsessively focused on the concept of improvement.", "tokens": [51540, 440, 316, 26252, 1768, 307, 35803, 3413, 5178, 322, 264, 3410, 295, 10444, 13, 51724], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16458868765616202, "compression_ratio": 1.7178571428571427, "no_speech_prob": 1.783202058236455e-12}, {"id": 191, "seek": 62876, "start": 628.76, "end": 631.4, "text": " But improvement is a human construct.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 10444, 307, 257, 1952, 7690, 13, 50497], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 192, "seek": 62876, "start": 631.74, "end": 632.38, "text": " It's subjective.", "tokens": [50514, 467, 311, 25972, 13, 50546], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 193, "seek": 62876, "start": 632.6, "end": 632.98, "text": " Completely.", "tokens": [50557, 39978, 13, 50576], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 194, "seek": 62876, "start": 633.26, "end": 635.14, "text": " And it's often a very dangerous vector.", "tokens": [50590, 400, 309, 311, 2049, 257, 588, 5795, 8062, 13, 50684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 195, "seek": 62876, "start": 635.84, "end": 639.4399999999999, "text": " For complex systems in reality, the actual goal isn't improvement.", "tokens": [50719, 1171, 3997, 3652, 294, 4103, 11, 264, 3539, 3387, 1943, 380, 10444, 13, 50899], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 196, "seek": 62876, "start": 639.8199999999999, "end": 640.78, "text": " The goal is continuation.", "tokens": [50918, 440, 3387, 307, 29357, 13, 50966], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 197, "seek": 62876, "start": 641.3, "end": 641.86, "text": " Continuation.", "tokens": [50992, 14674, 16073, 13, 51020], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 198, "seek": 62876, "start": 642.0, "end": 642.28, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51027, 1079, 13, 51041], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 199, "seek": 62876, "start": 642.58, "end": 648.36, "text": " A system must modify its rules in a way that doesn't undermine the very conditions that make future modification possible.", "tokens": [51056, 316, 1185, 1633, 16927, 1080, 4474, 294, 257, 636, 300, 1177, 380, 39257, 264, 588, 4487, 300, 652, 2027, 26747, 1944, 13, 51345], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 200, "seek": 62876, "start": 648.54, "end": 650.6, "text": " So it just has to survive its own upgrades.", "tokens": [51354, 407, 309, 445, 575, 281, 7867, 1080, 1065, 24868, 13, 51457], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 201, "seek": 62876, "start": 650.9399999999999, "end": 651.5, "text": " Precisely.", "tokens": [51474, 48746, 736, 13, 51502], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 202, "seek": 62876, "start": 652.22, "end": 656.38, "text": " Fliction formalizes this as admissible recursive continuation.", "tokens": [51538, 3235, 4105, 9860, 5660, 341, 382, 5910, 41073, 20560, 488, 29357, 13, 51746], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16778129642292605, "compression_ratio": 1.6451612903225807, "no_speech_prob": 1.6108513177862105e-12}, {"id": 203, "seek": 65638, "start": 656.38, "end": 661.3, "text": " Every system has a mathematical space called a viability manifold.", "tokens": [50365, 2048, 1185, 575, 257, 18894, 1901, 1219, 257, 1932, 2310, 47138, 13, 50611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1781894943930886, "compression_ratio": 1.5483870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 1.8321869629106535e-12}, {"id": 204, "seek": 65638, "start": 661.8, "end": 662.96, "text": " Like an invisible boundary.", "tokens": [50636, 1743, 364, 14603, 12866, 13, 50694], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1781894943930886, "compression_ratio": 1.5483870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 1.8321869629106535e-12}, {"id": 205, "seek": 65638, "start": 663.12, "end": 664.18, "text": " Exactly like that.", "tokens": [50702, 7587, 411, 300, 13, 50755], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1781894943930886, "compression_ratio": 1.5483870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 1.8321869629106535e-12}, {"id": 206, "seek": 65638, "start": 664.56, "end": 668.58, "text": " As long as the system's state stays inside that boundary, it survives.", "tokens": [50774, 1018, 938, 382, 264, 1185, 311, 1785, 10834, 1854, 300, 12866, 11, 309, 46231, 13, 50975], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1781894943930886, "compression_ratio": 1.5483870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 1.8321869629106535e-12}, {"id": 207, "seek": 65638, "start": 669.0, "end": 672.2, "text": " If it steps outside that boundary, it undergoes divergent collapse.", "tokens": [50996, 759, 309, 4439, 2380, 300, 12866, 11, 309, 26426, 279, 18558, 6930, 15584, 13, 51156], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1781894943930886, "compression_ratio": 1.5483870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 1.8321869629106535e-12}, {"id": 208, "seek": 65638, "start": 672.46, "end": 673.08, "text": " It dies.", "tokens": [51169, 467, 2714, 13, 51200], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1781894943930886, "compression_ratio": 1.5483870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 1.8321869629106535e-12}, {"id": 209, "seek": 65638, "start": 673.2, "end": 676.98, "text": " So the true challenge of AGI isn't getting it to recursively self-improve.", "tokens": [51206, 407, 264, 2074, 3430, 295, 316, 26252, 1943, 380, 1242, 309, 281, 20560, 3413, 2698, 12, 332, 46955, 13, 51395], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1781894943930886, "compression_ratio": 1.5483870967741935, "no_speech_prob": 1.8321869629106535e-12}, {"id": 210, "seek": 67698, "start": 676.98, "end": 685.5600000000001, "text": " No, the challenge is getting a system to undergo massive rule changes without accidentally stepping outside its own viability manifold.", "tokens": [50365, 883, 11, 264, 3430, 307, 1242, 257, 1185, 281, 26426, 5994, 4978, 2962, 1553, 15715, 16821, 2380, 1080, 1065, 1932, 2310, 47138, 13, 50794], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14923670671988223, "compression_ratio": 1.5369458128078817, "no_speech_prob": 1.9347626799282036e-12}, {"id": 211, "seek": 67698, "start": 686.26, "end": 687.62, "text": " That completely changes the framing.", "tokens": [50829, 663, 2584, 2962, 264, 28971, 13, 50897], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14923670671988223, "compression_ratio": 1.5369458128078817, "no_speech_prob": 1.9347626799282036e-12}, {"id": 212, "seek": 67698, "start": 687.8000000000001, "end": 694.16, "text": " Because if we stop looking at level three rule level recursion as some magical sci-fi threshold in the future, we can look backward.", "tokens": [50906, 1436, 498, 321, 1590, 1237, 412, 1496, 1045, 4978, 1496, 20560, 313, 382, 512, 12066, 2180, 12, 13325, 14678, 294, 264, 2027, 11, 321, 393, 574, 23897, 13, 51224], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14923670671988223, "compression_ratio": 1.5369458128078817, "no_speech_prob": 1.9347626799282036e-12}, {"id": 213, "seek": 67698, "start": 694.46, "end": 694.7, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51239, 1779, 13, 51251], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14923670671988223, "compression_ratio": 1.5369458128078817, "no_speech_prob": 1.9347626799282036e-12}, {"id": 214, "seek": 69470, "start": 694.7, "end": 702.2800000000001, "text": " We can look at how the natural world has been solving this exact mathematical problem for billions of years without any conscious intelligence driving it.", "tokens": [50365, 492, 393, 574, 412, 577, 264, 3303, 1002, 575, 668, 12606, 341, 1900, 18894, 1154, 337, 17375, 295, 924, 1553, 604, 6648, 7599, 4840, 309, 13, 50744], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465298960528036, "compression_ratio": 1.5572289156626506, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555083042282814e-12}, {"id": 215, "seek": 69470, "start": 702.5, "end": 705.3000000000001, "text": " Biology is arguably the ultimate recursive engine.", "tokens": [50755, 48132, 307, 26771, 264, 9705, 20560, 488, 2848, 13, 50895], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465298960528036, "compression_ratio": 1.5572289156626506, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555083042282814e-12}, {"id": 216, "seek": 69470, "start": 705.44, "end": 705.6400000000001, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50902, 1079, 13, 50912], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465298960528036, "compression_ratio": 1.5572289156626506, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555083042282814e-12}, {"id": 217, "seek": 69470, "start": 706.2, "end": 709.2, "text": " And Fliction points to three massive domains where this happens constantly.", "tokens": [50940, 400, 3235, 4105, 2793, 281, 1045, 5994, 25514, 689, 341, 2314, 6460, 13, 51090], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465298960528036, "compression_ratio": 1.5572289156626506, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555083042282814e-12}, {"id": 218, "seek": 69470, "start": 709.36, "end": 711.9000000000001, "text": " The first one is a concept called autopoiesis.", "tokens": [51098, 440, 700, 472, 307, 257, 3410, 1219, 31090, 78, 530, 271, 13, 51225], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465298960528036, "compression_ratio": 1.5572289156626506, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555083042282814e-12}, {"id": 219, "seek": 69470, "start": 712.0, "end": 715.0200000000001, "text": " I had never heard this term before, but the mechanism is fascinating.", "tokens": [51230, 286, 632, 1128, 2198, 341, 1433, 949, 11, 457, 264, 7513, 307, 10343, 13, 51381], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465298960528036, "compression_ratio": 1.5572289156626506, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555083042282814e-12}, {"id": 220, "seek": 69470, "start": 715.7, "end": 717.96, "text": " Autopoiesis is a term from the 1970s.", "tokens": [51415, 6049, 404, 78, 530, 271, 307, 257, 1433, 490, 264, 14577, 82, 13, 51528], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465298960528036, "compression_ratio": 1.5572289156626506, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555083042282814e-12}, {"id": 221, "seek": 69470, "start": 718.58, "end": 723.38, "text": " Humberto Maturana and Francisco Barella, two Chilean biologists, coined it.", "tokens": [51559, 389, 4182, 1353, 6789, 374, 2095, 293, 12279, 363, 34704, 11, 732, 22238, 282, 3228, 12256, 11, 45222, 309, 13, 51799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1465298960528036, "compression_ratio": 1.5572289156626506, "no_speech_prob": 1.6555083042282814e-12}, {"id": 222, "seek": 72338, "start": 723.38, "end": 726.62, "text": " And it literally translates to self-creation.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 309, 3736, 28468, 281, 2698, 12, 14066, 399, 13, 50527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 223, "seek": 72338, "start": 726.84, "end": 726.88, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50538, 1779, 13, 50540], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 224, "seek": 72338, "start": 727.12, "end": 727.54, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50552, 1079, 13, 50573], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 225, "seek": 72338, "start": 728.38, "end": 733.5, "text": " They were trying to define the absolute minimal requirement for something to be considered alive.", "tokens": [50615, 814, 645, 1382, 281, 6964, 264, 8236, 13206, 11695, 337, 746, 281, 312, 4888, 5465, 13, 50871], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 226, "seek": 72338, "start": 733.66, "end": 739.2, "text": " Because a biological cell doesn't just sit there in space persisting through time the way a rock does.", "tokens": [50879, 1436, 257, 13910, 2815, 1177, 380, 445, 1394, 456, 294, 1901, 13233, 278, 807, 565, 264, 636, 257, 3727, 775, 13, 51156], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 227, "seek": 72338, "start": 739.26, "end": 739.4, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51159, 1779, 13, 51166], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 228, "seek": 72338, "start": 739.42, "end": 740.58, "text": " A rock just endures.", "tokens": [51167, 316, 3727, 445, 465, 769, 495, 13, 51225], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 229, "seek": 72338, "start": 740.86, "end": 742.74, "text": " But a cell is an active factory.", "tokens": [51239, 583, 257, 2815, 307, 364, 4967, 9265, 13, 51333], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 230, "seek": 72338, "start": 743.24, "end": 746.4399999999999, "text": " It is constantly rebuilding the lipid membranes that contain it.", "tokens": [51358, 467, 307, 6460, 36717, 264, 8280, 327, 15595, 12779, 300, 5304, 309, 13, 51518], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 231, "seek": 72338, "start": 746.74, "end": 750.94, "text": " It's continuously replacing the ribosomes and proteins that do the rebuilding.", "tokens": [51533, 467, 311, 15684, 19139, 264, 9162, 329, 18168, 293, 15577, 300, 360, 264, 36717, 13, 51743], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 232, "seek": 72338, "start": 750.94, "end": 753.36, "text": " So the factory builds the machines that build the factory.", "tokens": [51743, 407, 264, 9265, 15182, 264, 8379, 300, 1322, 264, 9265, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14068296872652494, "compression_ratio": 1.73421926910299, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147439067624615e-12}, {"id": 233, "seek": 75338, "start": 753.46, "end": 753.9399999999999, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50369, 7587, 13, 50393], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.234100341796875, "compression_ratio": 1.6077348066298343, "no_speech_prob": 1.4050197637283102e-12}, {"id": 234, "seek": 75338, "start": 754.42, "end": 760.48, "text": " The components produce the organization, and that organization governs the production of the next generation of components.", "tokens": [50417, 440, 6677, 5258, 264, 4475, 11, 293, 300, 4475, 1980, 82, 264, 4265, 295, 264, 958, 5125, 295, 6677, 13, 50720], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.234100341796875, "compression_ratio": 1.6077348066298343, "no_speech_prob": 1.4050197637283102e-12}, {"id": 235, "seek": 75338, "start": 761.04, "end": 763.16, "text": " It is a closed organizational loop.", "tokens": [50748, 467, 307, 257, 5395, 24730, 6367, 13, 50854], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.234100341796875, "compression_ratio": 1.6077348066298343, "no_speech_prob": 1.4050197637283102e-12}, {"id": 236, "seek": 75338, "start": 763.42, "end": 768.62, "text": " And Flisker's notes that the human immune system takes this to an even more extreme level three recursion.", "tokens": [50867, 400, 3235, 271, 5767, 311, 5570, 300, 264, 1952, 11992, 1185, 2516, 341, 281, 364, 754, 544, 8084, 1496, 1045, 20560, 313, 13, 51127], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.234100341796875, "compression_ratio": 1.6077348066298343, "no_speech_prob": 1.4050197637283102e-12}, {"id": 237, "seek": 75338, "start": 768.76, "end": 769.46, "text": " It really does.", "tokens": [51134, 467, 534, 775, 13, 51169], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.234100341796875, "compression_ratio": 1.6077348066298343, "no_speech_prob": 1.4050197637283102e-12}, {"id": 238, "seek": 76946, "start": 769.46, "end": 776.1800000000001, "text": " Like when a novel virus enters your body, your immune system doesn't just scan some pre-written database of antibodies.", "tokens": [50365, 1743, 562, 257, 7613, 5752, 18780, 428, 1772, 11, 428, 11992, 1185, 1177, 380, 445, 11049, 512, 659, 12, 26859, 8149, 295, 28356, 13, 50701], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16435988981332353, "compression_ratio": 1.4141414141414141, "no_speech_prob": 1.642023106027124e-12}, {"id": 239, "seek": 76946, "start": 776.44, "end": 778.94, "text": " It undergoes a process called somatic hypermutation.", "tokens": [50714, 467, 26426, 279, 257, 1399, 1219, 3307, 2399, 9848, 76, 11380, 13, 50839], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16435988981332353, "compression_ratio": 1.4141414141414141, "no_speech_prob": 1.642023106027124e-12}, {"id": 240, "seek": 76946, "start": 779.1800000000001, "end": 779.26, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50851, 1779, 13, 50855], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16435988981332353, "compression_ratio": 1.4141414141414141, "no_speech_prob": 1.642023106027124e-12}, {"id": 241, "seek": 76946, "start": 779.4200000000001, "end": 786.2800000000001, "text": " Your B cells literally mutate their own DNA, randomly trying out new physical shapes for antibodies.", "tokens": [50863, 2260, 363, 5438, 3736, 5839, 473, 641, 1065, 8272, 11, 16979, 1382, 484, 777, 4001, 10854, 337, 28356, 13, 51206], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16435988981332353, "compression_ratio": 1.4141414141414141, "no_speech_prob": 1.642023106027124e-12}, {"id": 242, "seek": 78628, "start": 786.28, "end": 792.54, "text": " They are rewriting their own genetic rules of production on the fly to find a lock and key fit.", "tokens": [50365, 814, 366, 319, 19868, 641, 1065, 12462, 4474, 295, 4265, 322, 264, 3603, 281, 915, 257, 4017, 293, 2141, 3318, 13, 50678], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15896632066413538, "compression_ratio": 1.4186046511627908, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201301569044983e-12}, {"id": 243, "seek": 78628, "start": 792.74, "end": 794.4, "text": " And there is no intelligence explosion.", "tokens": [50688, 400, 456, 307, 572, 7599, 15673, 13, 50771], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15896632066413538, "compression_ratio": 1.4186046511627908, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201301569044983e-12}, {"id": 244, "seek": 78628, "start": 794.8, "end": 795.1, "text": " No.", "tokens": [50791, 883, 13, 50806], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15896632066413538, "compression_ratio": 1.4186046511627908, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201301569044983e-12}, {"id": 245, "seek": 78628, "start": 795.28, "end": 800.06, "text": " My body is doing a level three recursion every time I get the flu, and I don't turn into a supervillain.", "tokens": [50815, 1222, 1772, 307, 884, 257, 1496, 1045, 20560, 313, 633, 565, 286, 483, 264, 5029, 11, 293, 286, 500, 380, 1261, 666, 257, 37971, 373, 491, 13, 51054], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15896632066413538, "compression_ratio": 1.4186046511627908, "no_speech_prob": 2.0201301569044983e-12}, {"id": 246, "seek": 80006, "start": 800.06, "end": 801.78, "text": " But notice the constraint there.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 3449, 264, 25534, 456, 13, 50451], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24757693030617453, "compression_ratio": 1.2542372881355932, "no_speech_prob": 1.6552491799090574e-12}, {"id": 247, "seek": 80006, "start": 802.0999999999999, "end": 803.42, "text": " Autopoiesis is local.", "tokens": [50467, 6049, 404, 78, 530, 271, 307, 2654, 13, 50533], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24757693030617453, "compression_ratio": 1.2542372881355932, "no_speech_prob": 1.6552491799090574e-12}, {"id": 248, "seek": 80006, "start": 803.9399999999999, "end": 807.06, "text": " It is tightly bounded inside a single physical unit.", "tokens": [50559, 467, 307, 21952, 37498, 1854, 257, 2167, 4001, 4985, 13, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24757693030617453, "compression_ratio": 1.2542372881355932, "no_speech_prob": 1.6552491799090574e-12}, {"id": 249, "seek": 80006, "start": 807.8199999999999, "end": 809.4599999999999, "text": " The feedback loops are contained.", "tokens": [50753, 440, 5824, 16121, 366, 16212, 13, 50835], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24757693030617453, "compression_ratio": 1.2542372881355932, "no_speech_prob": 1.6552491799090574e-12}, {"id": 250, "seek": 80006, "start": 809.6199999999999, "end": 809.76, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50843, 1779, 13, 50850], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.24757693030617453, "compression_ratio": 1.2542372881355932, "no_speech_prob": 1.6552491799090574e-12}, {"id": 251, "seek": 80976, "start": 809.76, "end": 813.66, "text": " But what happens when you have a recursive system that doesn't have a physical boundary?", "tokens": [50365, 583, 437, 2314, 562, 291, 362, 257, 20560, 488, 1185, 300, 1177, 380, 362, 257, 4001, 12866, 30, 50560], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17859362042139446, "compression_ratio": 1.6396103896103895, "no_speech_prob": 1.735100778332832e-12}, {"id": 252, "seek": 80976, "start": 813.92, "end": 816.72, "text": " Which brings us to the second domain, sympoiesis.", "tokens": [50573, 3013, 5607, 505, 281, 264, 1150, 9274, 11, 6697, 2259, 530, 271, 13, 50713], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17859362042139446, "compression_ratio": 1.6396103896103895, "no_speech_prob": 1.735100778332832e-12}, {"id": 253, "seek": 80976, "start": 816.96, "end": 817.24, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50725, 1079, 13, 50739], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17859362042139446, "compression_ratio": 1.6396103896103895, "no_speech_prob": 1.735100778332832e-12}, {"id": 254, "seek": 80976, "start": 817.42, "end": 818.52, "text": " Beth Dempster's concept.", "tokens": [50748, 14011, 4686, 79, 3120, 311, 3410, 13, 50803], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17859362042139446, "compression_ratio": 1.6396103896103895, "no_speech_prob": 1.735100778332832e-12}, {"id": 255, "seek": 80976, "start": 818.8199999999999, "end": 819.0, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50818, 1779, 13, 50827], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17859362042139446, "compression_ratio": 1.6396103896103895, "no_speech_prob": 1.735100778332832e-12}, {"id": 256, "seek": 80976, "start": 819.38, "end": 825.28, "text": " Sympoiesis describes collectively producing systems with no central boundary and no centralized control.", "tokens": [50846, 28877, 2259, 530, 271, 15626, 24341, 10501, 3652, 365, 572, 5777, 12866, 293, 572, 32395, 1969, 13, 51141], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17859362042139446, "compression_ratio": 1.6396103896103895, "no_speech_prob": 1.735100778332832e-12}, {"id": 257, "seek": 80976, "start": 825.8199999999999, "end": 828.88, "text": " And the most beautiful example of this is human language.", "tokens": [51168, 400, 264, 881, 2238, 1365, 295, 341, 307, 1952, 2856, 13, 51321], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17859362042139446, "compression_ratio": 1.6396103896103895, "no_speech_prob": 1.735100778332832e-12}, {"id": 258, "seek": 80976, "start": 829.06, "end": 835.6, "text": " Language is a perfect sympoietic system because no single human being holds the master grammar rulebook in their head.", "tokens": [51330, 24445, 307, 257, 2176, 6697, 2259, 1684, 299, 1185, 570, 572, 2167, 1952, 885, 9190, 264, 4505, 22317, 4978, 2939, 294, 641, 1378, 13, 51657], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17859362042139446, "compression_ratio": 1.6396103896103895, "no_speech_prob": 1.735100778332832e-12}, {"id": 259, "seek": 80976, "start": 835.68, "end": 837.4399999999999, "text": " There's no central server for English.", "tokens": [51661, 821, 311, 572, 5777, 7154, 337, 3669, 13, 51749], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17859362042139446, "compression_ratio": 1.6396103896103895, "no_speech_prob": 1.735100778332832e-12}, {"id": 260, "seek": 80976, "start": 837.54, "end": 837.9399999999999, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51754, 7587, 13, 51774], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17859362042139446, "compression_ratio": 1.6396103896103895, "no_speech_prob": 1.735100778332832e-12}, {"id": 261, "seek": 83794, "start": 837.94, "end": 842.8000000000001, "text": " When you or I speak, we are mostly just executing level one or level two adaptations.", "tokens": [50365, 1133, 291, 420, 286, 1710, 11, 321, 366, 5240, 445, 32368, 1496, 472, 420, 1496, 732, 44465, 13, 50608], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10479233311671837, "compression_ratio": 1.6030534351145038, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310845039723242e-12}, {"id": 262, "seek": 83794, "start": 843.12, "end": 845.1800000000001, "text": " We're just using the existing vocabulary.", "tokens": [50624, 492, 434, 445, 1228, 264, 6741, 19864, 13, 50727], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10479233311671837, "compression_ratio": 1.6030534351145038, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310845039723242e-12}, {"id": 263, "seek": 83794, "start": 845.7, "end": 856.24, "text": " But the aggregate of millions of people speaking, inventing slang, taking shortcuts, that aggregate activity continuously reshapes the grammar for the next generation.", "tokens": [50753, 583, 264, 26118, 295, 6803, 295, 561, 4124, 11, 7962, 278, 42517, 11, 1940, 34620, 11, 300, 26118, 5191, 15684, 725, 71, 569, 279, 264, 22317, 337, 264, 958, 5125, 13, 51280], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10479233311671837, "compression_ratio": 1.6030534351145038, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310845039723242e-12}, {"id": 264, "seek": 83794, "start": 856.5, "end": 857.82, "text": " Think about irregular verbs.", "tokens": [51293, 6557, 466, 29349, 30051, 13, 51359], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10479233311671837, "compression_ratio": 1.6030534351145038, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310845039723242e-12}, {"id": 265, "seek": 83794, "start": 858.46, "end": 861.98, "text": " A few hundred years ago, the past tense of help was hope.", "tokens": [51391, 316, 1326, 3262, 924, 2057, 11, 264, 1791, 18760, 295, 854, 390, 1454, 13, 51567], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10479233311671837, "compression_ratio": 1.6030534351145038, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310845039723242e-12}, {"id": 266, "seek": 83794, "start": 862.1600000000001, "end": 862.82, "text": " I hope him.", "tokens": [51576, 286, 1454, 796, 13, 51609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10479233311671837, "compression_ratio": 1.6030534351145038, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310845039723242e-12}, {"id": 267, "seek": 83794, "start": 862.8800000000001, "end": 864.2600000000001, "text": " That sounds so wrong now.", "tokens": [51612, 663, 3263, 370, 2085, 586, 13, 51681], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10479233311671837, "compression_ratio": 1.6030534351145038, "no_speech_prob": 1.5310845039723242e-12}, {"id": 268, "seek": 86426, "start": 864.26, "end": 870.92, "text": " But people started instinctively applying the standard ad rule, and eventually the language absorbed helped.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 561, 1409, 16556, 3413, 9275, 264, 3832, 614, 4978, 11, 293, 4728, 264, 2856, 20799, 4254, 13, 50698], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1777315650667463, "compression_ratio": 1.4678362573099415, "no_speech_prob": 1.630038226792252e-12}, {"id": 269, "seek": 86426, "start": 871.5, "end": 878.48, "text": " The language continuously modifies its own structural rules, but the locus of that recursion isn't in any one brain.", "tokens": [50727, 440, 2856, 15684, 1072, 11221, 1080, 1065, 15067, 4474, 11, 457, 264, 450, 1149, 295, 300, 20560, 313, 1943, 380, 294, 604, 472, 3567, 13, 51076], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1777315650667463, "compression_ratio": 1.4678362573099415, "no_speech_prob": 1.630038226792252e-12}, {"id": 270, "seek": 86426, "start": 878.7, "end": 879.9399999999999, "text": " It's totally distributed.", "tokens": [51087, 467, 311, 3879, 12631, 13, 51149], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1777315650667463, "compression_ratio": 1.4678362573099415, "no_speech_prob": 1.630038226792252e-12}, {"id": 271, "seek": 87994, "start": 879.94, "end": 883.08, "text": " And you see the exact same math in global currency markets.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 291, 536, 264, 1900, 912, 5221, 294, 4338, 13346, 8383, 13, 50522], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15142718325839954, "compression_ratio": 1.5793650793650793, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404799189056793e-12}, {"id": 272, "seek": 87994, "start": 883.12, "end": 883.6800000000001, "text": " Oh, absolutely.", "tokens": [50524, 876, 11, 3122, 13, 50552], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15142718325839954, "compression_ratio": 1.5793650793650793, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404799189056793e-12}, {"id": 273, "seek": 87994, "start": 883.6800000000001, "end": 887.9200000000001, "text": " An individual day trader isn't trying to change the rules of macroeconomics.", "tokens": [50552, 1107, 2609, 786, 31961, 1943, 380, 1382, 281, 1319, 264, 4474, 295, 18887, 68, 2291, 1167, 13, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15142718325839954, "compression_ratio": 1.5793650793650793, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404799189056793e-12}, {"id": 274, "seek": 87994, "start": 888.0200000000001, "end": 890.62, "text": " They're just following their own fixed trading strategy.", "tokens": [50769, 814, 434, 445, 3480, 641, 1065, 6806, 9529, 5206, 13, 50899], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15142718325839954, "compression_ratio": 1.5793650793650793, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404799189056793e-12}, {"id": 275, "seek": 87994, "start": 891.22, "end": 898.4000000000001, "text": " But the aggregate collision of millions of trades continuously rewrites the price formation rules for the next day.", "tokens": [50929, 583, 264, 26118, 24644, 295, 6803, 295, 21287, 15684, 319, 86, 30931, 264, 3218, 11723, 4474, 337, 264, 958, 786, 13, 51288], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15142718325839954, "compression_ratio": 1.5793650793650793, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404799189056793e-12}, {"id": 276, "seek": 87994, "start": 898.5400000000001, "end": 902.44, "text": " The system recursively modifies itself through distributed interactions.", "tokens": [51295, 440, 1185, 20560, 3413, 1072, 11221, 2564, 807, 12631, 13280, 13, 51490], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15142718325839954, "compression_ratio": 1.5793650793650793, "no_speech_prob": 1.3404799189056793e-12}, {"id": 277, "seek": 90244, "start": 902.44, "end": 912.7800000000001, "text": " So we have cells, which is autopoiesis and languages, sympoiesis, but then fliction goes even bigger into evolution itself, specifically this mechanism called niche construction.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 321, 362, 5438, 11, 597, 307, 31090, 78, 530, 271, 293, 8650, 11, 13240, 78, 530, 271, 11, 457, 550, 932, 4105, 1709, 754, 3801, 666, 9303, 2564, 11, 4682, 341, 7513, 1219, 19956, 6435, 13, 50882], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1396479217373595, "compression_ratio": 1.5568181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 2.0047193072247893e-12}, {"id": 278, "seek": 90244, "start": 913.22, "end": 915.2800000000001, "text": " Now, I have to push back here for a second.", "tokens": [50904, 823, 11, 286, 362, 281, 2944, 646, 510, 337, 257, 1150, 13, 51007], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1396479217373595, "compression_ratio": 1.5568181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 2.0047193072247893e-12}, {"id": 279, "seek": 90244, "start": 915.84, "end": 922.0400000000001, "text": " When I learned evolution in school, it was always framed as organisms adapting to a static environment.", "tokens": [51035, 1133, 286, 3264, 9303, 294, 1395, 11, 309, 390, 1009, 30420, 382, 22110, 34942, 281, 257, 13437, 2823, 13, 51345], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1396479217373595, "compression_ratio": 1.5568181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 2.0047193072247893e-12}, {"id": 280, "seek": 90244, "start": 922.3800000000001, "end": 925.58, "text": " A giraffe gets a longer neck because the trees are tall.", "tokens": [51362, 316, 49897, 2170, 257, 2854, 6189, 570, 264, 5852, 366, 6764, 13, 51522], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1396479217373595, "compression_ratio": 1.5568181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 2.0047193072247893e-12}, {"id": 281, "seek": 90244, "start": 925.6800000000001, "end": 926.9000000000001, "text": " The classic example, right.", "tokens": [51527, 440, 7230, 1365, 11, 558, 13, 51588], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1396479217373595, "compression_ratio": 1.5568181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 2.0047193072247893e-12}, {"id": 282, "seek": 92690, "start": 926.9, "end": 933.3199999999999, "text": " But if an organism changes its environment to suit its needs, doesn't that border on Lamarckian evolution?", "tokens": [50365, 583, 498, 364, 24128, 2962, 1080, 2823, 281, 5722, 1080, 2203, 11, 1177, 380, 300, 7838, 322, 18825, 289, 547, 952, 9303, 30, 50686], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13052857227814504, "compression_ratio": 1.7142857142857142, "no_speech_prob": 1.478204819833906e-12}, {"id": 283, "seek": 92690, "start": 934.3199999999999, "end": 937.26, "text": " How does a behavior change genetic rules?", "tokens": [50736, 1012, 775, 257, 5223, 1319, 12462, 4474, 30, 50883], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13052857227814504, "compression_ratio": 1.7142857142857142, "no_speech_prob": 1.478204819833906e-12}, {"id": 284, "seek": 92690, "start": 937.66, "end": 942.4399999999999, "text": " It's a really great question because it forces us to look at the feedback loop between behavior and genetics.", "tokens": [50903, 467, 311, 257, 534, 869, 1168, 570, 309, 5874, 505, 281, 574, 412, 264, 5824, 6367, 1296, 5223, 293, 26516, 13, 51142], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13052857227814504, "compression_ratio": 1.7142857142857142, "no_speech_prob": 1.478204819833906e-12}, {"id": 285, "seek": 92690, "start": 943.28, "end": 944.88, "text": " Nice construction isn't Lamarckian.", "tokens": [51184, 5490, 6435, 1943, 380, 18825, 289, 547, 952, 13, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13052857227814504, "compression_ratio": 1.7142857142857142, "no_speech_prob": 1.478204819833906e-12}, {"id": 286, "seek": 92690, "start": 945.1999999999999, "end": 947.26, "text": " It's about changing the selection pressure.", "tokens": [51280, 467, 311, 466, 4473, 264, 9450, 3321, 13, 51383], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13052857227814504, "compression_ratio": 1.7142857142857142, "no_speech_prob": 1.478204819833906e-12}, {"id": 287, "seek": 92690, "start": 947.42, "end": 948.28, "text": " Let's look at the beaver.", "tokens": [51391, 961, 311, 574, 412, 264, 312, 20655, 13, 51434], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13052857227814504, "compression_ratio": 1.7142857142857142, "no_speech_prob": 1.478204819833906e-12}, {"id": 288, "seek": 92690, "start": 948.4599999999999, "end": 949.16, "text": " Okay, the beaver.", "tokens": [51443, 1033, 11, 264, 312, 20655, 13, 51478], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13052857227814504, "compression_ratio": 1.7142857142857142, "no_speech_prob": 1.478204819833906e-12}, {"id": 289, "seek": 92690, "start": 949.18, "end": 953.34, "text": " A beaver inherits genetic instructions to chew down trees and build dams.", "tokens": [51479, 316, 312, 20655, 9484, 1208, 12462, 9415, 281, 21200, 760, 5852, 293, 1322, 2422, 82, 13, 51687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13052857227814504, "compression_ratio": 1.7142857142857142, "no_speech_prob": 1.478204819833906e-12}, {"id": 290, "seek": 95334, "start": 953.34, "end": 957.4, "text": " By doing so, the beaver drastically alters its physical environment.", "tokens": [50365, 3146, 884, 370, 11, 264, 312, 20655, 29673, 419, 1559, 1080, 4001, 2823, 13, 50568], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1273963905516125, "compression_ratio": 1.6238938053097345, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809501924078263e-12}, {"id": 291, "seek": 95334, "start": 958.08, "end": 961.36, "text": " It turns a fast-flowing stream into a deep, still pond.", "tokens": [50602, 467, 4523, 257, 2370, 12, 43955, 4309, 666, 257, 2452, 11, 920, 17384, 13, 50766], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1273963905516125, "compression_ratio": 1.6238938053097345, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809501924078263e-12}, {"id": 292, "seek": 95334, "start": 961.8000000000001, "end": 970.72, "text": " Now, the beaver hasn't directly altered its own DNA, but by creating that pond, it has completely altered the evolutionary selection pressure for all its descendants.", "tokens": [50788, 823, 11, 264, 312, 20655, 6132, 380, 3838, 28783, 1080, 1065, 8272, 11, 457, 538, 4084, 300, 17384, 11, 309, 575, 2584, 28783, 264, 27567, 9450, 3321, 337, 439, 1080, 31693, 13, 51234], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1273963905516125, "compression_ratio": 1.6238938053097345, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809501924078263e-12}, {"id": 293, "seek": 95334, "start": 971.2800000000001, "end": 976.1, "text": " Future generations are now evolving in an environment of still, deep water.", "tokens": [51262, 20805, 10593, 366, 586, 21085, 294, 364, 2823, 295, 920, 11, 2452, 1281, 13, 51503], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1273963905516125, "compression_ratio": 1.6238938053097345, "no_speech_prob": 1.6809501924078263e-12}, {"id": 294, "seek": 97610, "start": 976.1, "end": 982.46, "text": " So, genetic mutations favoring webbed feet or flatter tails are suddenly selected for.", "tokens": [50365, 407, 11, 12462, 29243, 2294, 278, 3670, 2883, 3521, 420, 41247, 28537, 366, 5800, 8209, 337, 13, 50683], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11036407030545749, "compression_ratio": 1.5954198473282444, "no_speech_prob": 1.7414697071546636e-12}, {"id": 295, "seek": 97610, "start": 982.94, "end": 989.02, "text": " The beaver's behavior rewrote the environmental rules, which in turn rewrote the genetic rules of the species.", "tokens": [50707, 440, 312, 20655, 311, 5223, 319, 7449, 1370, 264, 8303, 4474, 11, 597, 294, 1261, 319, 7449, 1370, 264, 12462, 4474, 295, 264, 6172, 13, 51011], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11036407030545749, "compression_ratio": 1.5954198473282444, "no_speech_prob": 1.7414697071546636e-12}, {"id": 296, "seek": 97610, "start": 989.36, "end": 991.52, "text": " And humans did the exact same thing with milk.", "tokens": [51028, 400, 6255, 630, 264, 1900, 912, 551, 365, 5392, 13, 51136], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11036407030545749, "compression_ratio": 1.5954198473282444, "no_speech_prob": 1.7414697071546636e-12}, {"id": 297, "seek": 97610, "start": 991.64, "end": 993.5600000000001, "text": " I was so fascinated by this example.", "tokens": [51142, 286, 390, 370, 24597, 538, 341, 1365, 13, 51238], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11036407030545749, "compression_ratio": 1.5954198473282444, "no_speech_prob": 1.7414697071546636e-12}, {"id": 298, "seek": 97610, "start": 994.28, "end": 1000.14, "text": " Historically, human beings, like all mammals, were lactose intolerant after infancy.", "tokens": [51274, 25108, 984, 11, 1952, 8958, 11, 411, 439, 35408, 11, 645, 34042, 541, 35278, 394, 934, 1536, 6717, 13, 51567], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11036407030545749, "compression_ratio": 1.5954198473282444, "no_speech_prob": 1.7414697071546636e-12}, {"id": 299, "seek": 97610, "start": 1000.34, "end": 1002.84, "text": " The gene that produced lactase would just shut off.", "tokens": [51577, 440, 12186, 300, 7126, 34042, 651, 576, 445, 5309, 766, 13, 51702], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11036407030545749, "compression_ratio": 1.5954198473282444, "no_speech_prob": 1.7414697071546636e-12}, {"id": 300, "seek": 100284, "start": 1002.84, "end": 1007.6, "text": " Right. But a few thousand years ago, culturally, we decided to start farming dairy.", "tokens": [50365, 1779, 13, 583, 257, 1326, 4714, 924, 2057, 11, 28879, 11, 321, 3047, 281, 722, 16557, 21276, 13, 50603], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12229348887567935, "compression_ratio": 1.6474358974358974, "no_speech_prob": 1.6684895652596676e-12}, {"id": 301, "seek": 100284, "start": 1008.5400000000001, "end": 1011.5400000000001, "text": " We domesticated cows and goats. That was a cultural behavior.", "tokens": [50650, 492, 39125, 3587, 19148, 293, 34219, 13, 663, 390, 257, 6988, 5223, 13, 50800], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12229348887567935, "compression_ratio": 1.6474358974358974, "no_speech_prob": 1.6684895652596676e-12}, {"id": 302, "seek": 100284, "start": 1011.76, "end": 1016.84, "text": " And by creating an environment where dairy was abundant, we massively shifted the selection pressure.", "tokens": [50811, 400, 538, 4084, 364, 2823, 689, 21276, 390, 30657, 11, 321, 29379, 18892, 264, 9450, 3321, 13, 51065], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12229348887567935, "compression_ratio": 1.6474358974358974, "no_speech_prob": 1.6684895652596676e-12}, {"id": 303, "seek": 100284, "start": 1017.5400000000001, "end": 1024.54, "text": " If an individual happened to have a random mutation where the lactase gene didn't shut off, they had a huge survival advantage during famines.", "tokens": [51100, 759, 364, 2609, 2011, 281, 362, 257, 4974, 27960, 689, 264, 34042, 651, 12186, 994, 380, 5309, 766, 11, 436, 632, 257, 2603, 12559, 5002, 1830, 1087, 1652, 13, 51450], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12229348887567935, "compression_ratio": 1.6474358974358974, "no_speech_prob": 1.6684895652596676e-12}, {"id": 304, "seek": 100284, "start": 1024.8600000000001, "end": 1031.3, "text": " So, the cultural behavior of farming literally drove the spread of the lactase persistence allele through our DNA.", "tokens": [51466, 407, 11, 264, 6988, 5223, 295, 16557, 3736, 13226, 264, 3974, 295, 264, 34042, 651, 37617, 5430, 306, 807, 527, 8272, 13, 51788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12229348887567935, "compression_ratio": 1.6474358974358974, "no_speech_prob": 1.6684895652596676e-12}, {"id": 305, "seek": 100284, "start": 1031.46, "end": 1031.98, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51796, 7587, 13, 51822], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12229348887567935, "compression_ratio": 1.6474358974358974, "no_speech_prob": 1.6684895652596676e-12}, {"id": 306, "seek": 103198, "start": 1031.98, "end": 1038.64, "text": " We culturally rewrote the genetic rulebook governing our own biological hardware, and absolutely no one consciously orchestrated it.", "tokens": [50365, 492, 28879, 319, 7449, 1370, 264, 12462, 4978, 2939, 30054, 527, 1065, 13910, 8837, 11, 293, 3122, 572, 472, 32538, 14161, 5468, 309, 13, 50698], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19182757673592404, "compression_ratio": 1.5679012345679013, "no_speech_prob": 1.8686066149270486e-12}, {"id": 307, "seek": 103198, "start": 1038.88, "end": 1040.44, "text": " No intelligent designer planned it.", "tokens": [50710, 883, 13232, 11795, 8589, 309, 13, 50788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19182757673592404, "compression_ratio": 1.5679012345679013, "no_speech_prob": 1.8686066149270486e-12}, {"id": 308, "seek": 103198, "start": 1040.58, "end": 1042.58, "text": " Which leads to a crucial synthesis.", "tokens": [50795, 3013, 6689, 281, 257, 11462, 30252, 13, 50895], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19182757673592404, "compression_ratio": 1.5679012345679013, "no_speech_prob": 1.8686066149270486e-12}, {"id": 309, "seek": 103198, "start": 1043.6, "end": 1046.38, "text": " Recursive rule modification does not require foresight.", "tokens": [50946, 9647, 2156, 488, 4978, 26747, 775, 406, 3651, 2091, 28654, 13, 51085], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19182757673592404, "compression_ratio": 1.5679012345679013, "no_speech_prob": 1.8686066149270486e-12}, {"id": 310, "seek": 103198, "start": 1046.78, "end": 1048.88, "text": " It requires zero intelligence.", "tokens": [51105, 467, 7029, 4018, 7599, 13, 51210], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19182757673592404, "compression_ratio": 1.5679012345679013, "no_speech_prob": 1.8686066149270486e-12}, {"id": 311, "seek": 103198, "start": 1049.24, "end": 1049.38, "text": " Zero.", "tokens": [51228, 17182, 13, 51235], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19182757673592404, "compression_ratio": 1.5679012345679013, "no_speech_prob": 1.8686066149270486e-12}, {"id": 312, "seek": 103198, "start": 1049.68, "end": 1054.14, "text": " It is simply the emergent condition of a complex system remaining viable over time.", "tokens": [51250, 467, 307, 2935, 264, 4345, 6930, 4188, 295, 257, 3997, 1185, 8877, 22024, 670, 565, 13, 51473], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19182757673592404, "compression_ratio": 1.5679012345679013, "no_speech_prob": 1.8686066149270486e-12}, {"id": 313, "seek": 105414, "start": 1054.14, "end": 1059.8000000000002, "text": " As long as the modifications keep the system inside its viability manifold, it survives.", "tokens": [50365, 1018, 938, 382, 264, 26881, 1066, 264, 1185, 1854, 1080, 1932, 2310, 47138, 11, 309, 46231, 13, 50648], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1593779762192528, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9054658025041693e-12}, {"id": 314, "seek": 105414, "start": 1060.8000000000002, "end": 1067.3400000000001, "text": " But, and this is a massive warning light for AGI local recursion, can absolutely escape the viability manifold.", "tokens": [50698, 583, 11, 293, 341, 307, 257, 5994, 9164, 1442, 337, 316, 26252, 2654, 20560, 313, 11, 393, 3122, 7615, 264, 1932, 2310, 47138, 13, 51025], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1593779762192528, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9054658025041693e-12}, {"id": 315, "seek": 105414, "start": 1067.46, "end": 1067.66, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51031, 1779, 13, 51041], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1593779762192528, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9054658025041693e-12}, {"id": 316, "seek": 105414, "start": 1067.74, "end": 1069.2800000000002, "text": " A system can break its own constraints.", "tokens": [51045, 316, 1185, 393, 1821, 1080, 1065, 18491, 13, 51122], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1593779762192528, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9054658025041693e-12}, {"id": 317, "seek": 105414, "start": 1069.6000000000001, "end": 1069.8000000000002, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51138, 865, 13, 51148], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1593779762192528, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9054658025041693e-12}, {"id": 318, "seek": 105414, "start": 1069.8600000000001, "end": 1076.0400000000002, "text": " Because if we look back at biology, there is a very specific term for level three recursion that loses its viability constraint.", "tokens": [51151, 1436, 498, 321, 574, 646, 412, 14956, 11, 456, 307, 257, 588, 2685, 1433, 337, 1496, 1045, 20560, 313, 300, 18293, 1080, 1932, 2310, 25534, 13, 51460], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1593779762192528, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9054658025041693e-12}, {"id": 319, "seek": 105414, "start": 1076.1000000000001, "end": 1076.5, "text": " Cancer.", "tokens": [51463, 26127, 13, 51483], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1593779762192528, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9054658025041693e-12}, {"id": 320, "seek": 105414, "start": 1076.74, "end": 1077.1000000000001, "text": " Cancer.", "tokens": [51495, 26127, 13, 51513], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1593779762192528, "compression_ratio": 1.6652719665271967, "no_speech_prob": 1.9054658025041693e-12}, {"id": 321, "seek": 107710, "start": 1077.1, "end": 1079.28, "text": " It's terrifying to think about it this way.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 18106, 281, 519, 466, 309, 341, 636, 13, 50474], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.200970220041799, "compression_ratio": 1.5258215962441315, "no_speech_prob": 1.9304664203995126e-12}, {"id": 322, "seek": 107710, "start": 1079.36, "end": 1082.04, "text": " It's a perfect model of catastrophic recursion.", "tokens": [50478, 467, 311, 257, 2176, 2316, 295, 34915, 20560, 313, 13, 50612], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.200970220041799, "compression_ratio": 1.5258215962441315, "no_speech_prob": 1.9304664203995126e-12}, {"id": 323, "seek": 107710, "start": 1082.04, "end": 1087.28, "text": " A cancer cell lineage is doing exactly what many tech CEOs want an AGI to do.", "tokens": [50612, 316, 5592, 2815, 38257, 307, 884, 2293, 437, 867, 7553, 40736, 528, 364, 316, 26252, 281, 360, 13, 50874], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.200970220041799, "compression_ratio": 1.5258215962441315, "no_speech_prob": 1.9304664203995126e-12}, {"id": 324, "seek": 107710, "start": 1087.54, "end": 1089.62, "text": " A normal cell has constraints on its replication.", "tokens": [50887, 316, 2710, 2815, 575, 18491, 322, 1080, 39911, 13, 50991], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.200970220041799, "compression_ratio": 1.5258215962441315, "no_speech_prob": 1.9304664203995126e-12}, {"id": 325, "seek": 107710, "start": 1090.06, "end": 1092.1999999999998, "text": " A cancer cell mutates its own production rule.", "tokens": [51013, 316, 5592, 2815, 5839, 1024, 1080, 1065, 4265, 4978, 13, 51120], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.200970220041799, "compression_ratio": 1.5258215962441315, "no_speech_prob": 1.9304664203995126e-12}, {"id": 326, "seek": 107710, "start": 1092.26, "end": 1094.1, "text": " It disables its self-destruct mechanism.", "tokens": [51123, 467, 717, 2965, 1080, 2698, 12, 23748, 1757, 7513, 13, 51215], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.200970220041799, "compression_ratio": 1.5258215962441315, "no_speech_prob": 1.9304664203995126e-12}, {"id": 327, "seek": 107710, "start": 1094.1599999999999, "end": 1094.32, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51218, 1779, 13, 51226], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.200970220041799, "compression_ratio": 1.5258215962441315, "no_speech_prob": 1.9304664203995126e-12}, {"id": 328, "seek": 107710, "start": 1094.48, "end": 1095.1599999999999, "text": " Apoptosis.", "tokens": [51234, 8723, 5747, 8211, 13, 51268], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.200970220041799, "compression_ratio": 1.5258215962441315, "no_speech_prob": 1.9304664203995126e-12}, {"id": 329, "seek": 109516, "start": 1095.16, "end": 1098.88, "text": " It increases its local capability to multiply at every single step.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 8637, 1080, 2654, 13759, 281, 12972, 412, 633, 2167, 1823, 13, 50551], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14827134676068743, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.352908232833295e-12}, {"id": 330, "seek": 109516, "start": 1099.1000000000001, "end": 1102.52, "text": " It is a hyper-efficient, self-improving recursive loop.", "tokens": [50562, 467, 307, 257, 9848, 12, 68, 7816, 11, 2698, 12, 332, 4318, 798, 20560, 488, 6367, 13, 50733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14827134676068743, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.352908232833295e-12}, {"id": 331, "seek": 109516, "start": 1102.8200000000002, "end": 1104.4, "text": " But, it's a systemic failure.", "tokens": [50748, 583, 11, 309, 311, 257, 23789, 7763, 13, 50827], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14827134676068743, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.352908232833295e-12}, {"id": 332, "seek": 109516, "start": 1104.94, "end": 1112.5600000000002, "text": " Because it's optimizing entirely for its own local capability, completely ignoring the structural integrity of the macro system hosting it.", "tokens": [50854, 1436, 309, 311, 40425, 7696, 337, 1080, 1065, 2654, 13759, 11, 2584, 26258, 264, 15067, 16000, 295, 264, 18887, 1185, 16058, 309, 13, 51235], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14827134676068743, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.352908232833295e-12}, {"id": 333, "seek": 109516, "start": 1112.6200000000001, "end": 1116.42, "text": " It improves itself right into killing the body, which kills the cancer cell too.", "tokens": [51238, 467, 24771, 2564, 558, 666, 8011, 264, 1772, 11, 597, 14563, 264, 5592, 2815, 886, 13, 51428], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14827134676068743, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.352908232833295e-12}, {"id": 334, "seek": 109516, "start": 1116.6000000000001, "end": 1121.3600000000001, "text": " It optimizes itself to death, exactly like the Brittle Supply Chain Corporation.", "tokens": [51437, 467, 5028, 5660, 2564, 281, 2966, 11, 2293, 411, 264, 1603, 703, 9391, 356, 33252, 26464, 13, 51675], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14827134676068743, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 2.352908232833295e-12}, {"id": 335, "seek": 112136, "start": 1121.36, "end": 1126.08, "text": " And this highlights a really subtle distinction in the mathematics of continuation.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 341, 14254, 257, 534, 13743, 16844, 294, 264, 18666, 295, 29357, 13, 50601], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493453661600748, "compression_ratio": 1.5826446280991735, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428663121402897e-12}, {"id": 336, "seek": 112136, "start": 1127.04, "end": 1130.56, "text": " When systems rewrite their rules, what is actually surviving?", "tokens": [50649, 1133, 3652, 28132, 641, 4474, 11, 437, 307, 767, 24948, 30, 50825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493453661600748, "compression_ratio": 1.5826446280991735, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428663121402897e-12}, {"id": 337, "seek": 112136, "start": 1130.8, "end": 1132.32, "text": " Is it the parts or the pattern?", "tokens": [50837, 1119, 309, 264, 3166, 420, 264, 5102, 30, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493453661600748, "compression_ratio": 1.5826446280991735, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428663121402897e-12}, {"id": 338, "seek": 112136, "start": 1132.74, "end": 1134.26, "text": " The ship of Theseus paradox.", "tokens": [50934, 440, 5374, 295, 1981, 301, 26221, 13, 51010], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493453661600748, "compression_ratio": 1.5826446280991735, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428663121402897e-12}, {"id": 339, "seek": 112136, "start": 1134.58, "end": 1135.12, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51026, 7587, 13, 51053], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493453661600748, "compression_ratio": 1.5826446280991735, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428663121402897e-12}, {"id": 340, "seek": 112136, "start": 1135.4399999999998, "end": 1140.36, "text": " Fliction separates this into object admissibility versus process admissibility.", "tokens": [51069, 3235, 4105, 34149, 341, 666, 2657, 5910, 891, 2841, 5717, 1399, 5910, 891, 2841, 13, 51315], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493453661600748, "compression_ratio": 1.5826446280991735, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428663121402897e-12}, {"id": 341, "seek": 112136, "start": 1140.74, "end": 1145.4799999999998, "text": " If you replace every plank of wood on a ship over 10 years, is it the same ship?", "tokens": [51334, 759, 291, 7406, 633, 27861, 295, 4576, 322, 257, 5374, 670, 1266, 924, 11, 307, 309, 264, 912, 5374, 30, 51571], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493453661600748, "compression_ratio": 1.5826446280991735, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428663121402897e-12}, {"id": 342, "seek": 112136, "start": 1145.6, "end": 1145.84, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51577, 1779, 13, 51589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18493453661600748, "compression_ratio": 1.5826446280991735, "no_speech_prob": 1.5428663121402897e-12}, {"id": 343, "seek": 114584, "start": 1145.84, "end": 1151.52, "text": " Or apply that to a human institution, like a shipbuilding tradition in a coastal city that lasts for 500 years.", "tokens": [50365, 1610, 3079, 300, 281, 257, 1952, 7818, 11, 411, 257, 5374, 28126, 6994, 294, 257, 25050, 2307, 300, 20669, 337, 5923, 924, 13, 50649], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13718850524337203, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.88257634307909e-12}, {"id": 344, "seek": 114584, "start": 1151.6799999999998, "end": 1153.6999999999998, "text": " Every single object changes over that time.", "tokens": [50657, 2048, 2167, 2657, 2962, 670, 300, 565, 13, 50758], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13718850524337203, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.88257634307909e-12}, {"id": 345, "seek": 114584, "start": 1153.84, "end": 1156.36, "text": " The whole designs shift from galleons to steamships.", "tokens": [50765, 440, 1379, 11347, 5513, 490, 8527, 68, 892, 281, 2126, 4070, 7640, 13, 50891], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13718850524337203, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.88257634307909e-12}, {"id": 346, "seek": 114584, "start": 1156.98, "end": 1158.4199999999998, "text": " Hand tools become power tools.", "tokens": [50922, 8854, 3873, 1813, 1347, 3873, 13, 50994], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13718850524337203, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.88257634307909e-12}, {"id": 347, "seek": 114584, "start": 1158.82, "end": 1159.58, "text": " Wood become steel.", "tokens": [51014, 11558, 1813, 8269, 13, 51052], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13718850524337203, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.88257634307909e-12}, {"id": 348, "seek": 114584, "start": 1160.26, "end": 1167.62, "text": " If you measure survival purely by whether the original object survived, object admissibility, then the tradition failed completely.", "tokens": [51086, 759, 291, 3481, 12559, 17491, 538, 1968, 264, 3380, 2657, 14433, 11, 2657, 5910, 891, 2841, 11, 550, 264, 6994, 7612, 2584, 13, 51454], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13718850524337203, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.88257634307909e-12}, {"id": 349, "seek": 114584, "start": 1167.84, "end": 1169.56, "text": " But the tradition obviously survived.", "tokens": [51465, 583, 264, 6994, 2745, 14433, 13, 51551], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13718850524337203, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.88257634307909e-12}, {"id": 350, "seek": 114584, "start": 1169.6599999999999, "end": 1170.9599999999998, "text": " Yes, because the process continued.", "tokens": [51556, 1079, 11, 570, 264, 1399, 7014, 13, 51621], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13718850524337203, "compression_ratio": 1.6395759717314489, "no_speech_prob": 1.88257634307909e-12}, {"id": 351, "seek": 117096, "start": 1170.96, "end": 1176.9, "text": " The process of building ships, informed by how ships were previously built, maintained its viability.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 1399, 295, 2390, 11434, 11, 11740, 538, 577, 11434, 645, 8046, 3094, 11, 17578, 1080, 1932, 2310, 13, 50662], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11177427952106182, "compression_ratio": 1.5977859778597785, "no_speech_prob": 2.176066401723964e-12}, {"id": 352, "seek": 117096, "start": 1177.74, "end": 1182.0, "text": " For a complex system to survive, it often must discard its old objects.", "tokens": [50704, 1171, 257, 3997, 1185, 281, 7867, 11, 309, 2049, 1633, 31597, 1080, 1331, 6565, 13, 50917], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11177427952106182, "compression_ratio": 1.5977859778597785, "no_speech_prob": 2.176066401723964e-12}, {"id": 353, "seek": 117096, "start": 1182.58, "end": 1184.76, "text": " Survival is a verb, not a noun.", "tokens": [50946, 40716, 3576, 307, 257, 9595, 11, 406, 257, 23307, 13, 51055], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11177427952106182, "compression_ratio": 1.5977859778597785, "no_speech_prob": 2.176066401723964e-12}, {"id": 354, "seek": 117096, "start": 1185.1000000000001, "end": 1187.38, "text": " Okay, so this brings up a massive question for me.", "tokens": [51072, 1033, 11, 370, 341, 5607, 493, 257, 5994, 1168, 337, 385, 13, 51186], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11177427952106182, "compression_ratio": 1.5977859778597785, "no_speech_prob": 2.176066401723964e-12}, {"id": 355, "seek": 117096, "start": 1187.76, "end": 1196.74, "text": " If all these systems, cells, languages, economies, are constantly running these complex rule updates, how are they not constantly crashing?", "tokens": [51205, 759, 439, 613, 3652, 11, 5438, 11, 8650, 11, 23158, 11, 366, 6460, 2614, 613, 3997, 4978, 9205, 11, 577, 366, 436, 406, 6460, 26900, 30, 51654], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11177427952106182, "compression_ratio": 1.5977859778597785, "no_speech_prob": 2.176066401723964e-12}, {"id": 356, "seek": 117096, "start": 1197.02, "end": 1198.6000000000001, "text": " That is the million-dollar question.", "tokens": [51668, 663, 307, 264, 2459, 12, 40485, 1168, 13, 51747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11177427952106182, "compression_ratio": 1.5977859778597785, "no_speech_prob": 2.176066401723964e-12}, {"id": 357, "seek": 119860, "start": 1198.6, "end": 1202.54, "text": " Right. If I keep adding code to a software program, eventually it breaks.", "tokens": [50365, 1779, 13, 759, 286, 1066, 5127, 3089, 281, 257, 4722, 1461, 11, 4728, 309, 9857, 13, 50562], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12673570821573446, "compression_ratio": 1.532520325203252, "no_speech_prob": 1.7970222749089104e-12}, {"id": 358, "seek": 119860, "start": 1202.9599999999998, "end": 1205.0, "text": " So why doesn't an ecosystem just break?", "tokens": [50583, 407, 983, 1177, 380, 364, 11311, 445, 1821, 30, 50685], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12673570821573446, "compression_ratio": 1.532520325203252, "no_speech_prob": 1.7970222749089104e-12}, {"id": 359, "seek": 119860, "start": 1205.52, "end": 1211.6399999999999, "text": " This brings us to a huge mathematical pivot in the paper, the price of capability and the repair dominance theorem.", "tokens": [50711, 639, 5607, 505, 281, 257, 2603, 18894, 14538, 294, 264, 3035, 11, 264, 3218, 295, 13759, 293, 264, 10535, 34987, 20904, 13, 51017], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12673570821573446, "compression_ratio": 1.532520325203252, "no_speech_prob": 1.7970222749089104e-12}, {"id": 360, "seek": 119860, "start": 1211.98, "end": 1216.9399999999998, "text": " To understand how systems survive complexity, we first have to redefine capability.", "tokens": [51034, 1407, 1223, 577, 3652, 7867, 14024, 11, 321, 700, 362, 281, 38818, 533, 13759, 13, 51282], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12673570821573446, "compression_ratio": 1.532520325203252, "no_speech_prob": 1.7970222749089104e-12}, {"id": 361, "seek": 119860, "start": 1217.4199999999998, "end": 1220.02, "text": " When we talk about AI, we usually just mean being smart.", "tokens": [51306, 1133, 321, 751, 466, 7318, 11, 321, 2673, 445, 914, 885, 4069, 13, 51436], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12673570821573446, "compression_ratio": 1.532520325203252, "no_speech_prob": 1.7970222749089104e-12}, {"id": 362, "seek": 119860, "start": 1220.1599999999999, "end": 1220.3799999999999, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51443, 1779, 13, 51454], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12673570821573446, "compression_ratio": 1.532520325203252, "no_speech_prob": 1.7970222749089104e-12}, {"id": 363, "seek": 122038, "start": 1220.38, "end": 1224.7, "text": " But in complex systems theory, capability is formally defined as reachability.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 294, 3997, 3652, 5261, 11, 13759, 307, 25983, 7642, 382, 2524, 2310, 13, 50581], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1664212771824428, "compression_ratio": 1.6802973977695168, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980816930188935e-12}, {"id": 364, "seek": 122038, "start": 1225.22, "end": 1228.5, "text": " It is the mathematical log volume of states a system can navigate.", "tokens": [50607, 467, 307, 264, 18894, 3565, 5523, 295, 4368, 257, 1185, 393, 12350, 13, 50771], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1664212771824428, "compression_ratio": 1.6802973977695168, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980816930188935e-12}, {"id": 365, "seek": 122038, "start": 1228.74, "end": 1231.6000000000001, "text": " Give me a concrete example of reachability for people listening.", "tokens": [50783, 5303, 385, 257, 9859, 1365, 295, 2524, 2310, 337, 561, 4764, 13, 50926], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1664212771824428, "compression_ratio": 1.6802973977695168, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980816930188935e-12}, {"id": 366, "seek": 122038, "start": 1231.7, "end": 1232.6000000000001, "text": " Think about transportation.", "tokens": [50931, 6557, 466, 11328, 13, 50976], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1664212771824428, "compression_ratio": 1.6802973977695168, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980816930188935e-12}, {"id": 367, "seek": 122038, "start": 1233.0800000000002, "end": 1235.0800000000002, "text": " A bicycle has a certain level of reachability.", "tokens": [51000, 316, 20888, 575, 257, 1629, 1496, 295, 2524, 2310, 13, 51100], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1664212771824428, "compression_ratio": 1.6802973977695168, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980816930188935e-12}, {"id": 368, "seek": 122038, "start": 1235.5400000000002, "end": 1240.4, "text": " It can navigate dirt paths, tight alleys, but its overall state space is small.", "tokens": [51123, 467, 393, 12350, 11483, 14518, 11, 4524, 5430, 749, 11, 457, 1080, 4787, 1785, 1901, 307, 1359, 13, 51366], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1664212771824428, "compression_ratio": 1.6802973977695168, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980816930188935e-12}, {"id": 369, "seek": 122038, "start": 1240.5600000000002, "end": 1240.7800000000002, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [51374, 1033, 13, 51385], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1664212771824428, "compression_ratio": 1.6802973977695168, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980816930188935e-12}, {"id": 370, "seek": 122038, "start": 1241.0200000000002, "end": 1242.98, "text": " Now compare that to an F-22 fighter jet.", "tokens": [51397, 823, 6794, 300, 281, 364, 479, 12, 7490, 15932, 14452, 13, 51495], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1664212771824428, "compression_ratio": 1.6802973977695168, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980816930188935e-12}, {"id": 371, "seek": 122038, "start": 1243.3600000000001, "end": 1245.8600000000001, "text": " The jet has vastly higher reachability.", "tokens": [51514, 440, 14452, 575, 41426, 2946, 2524, 2310, 13, 51639], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1664212771824428, "compression_ratio": 1.6802973977695168, "no_speech_prob": 1.5980816930188935e-12}, {"id": 372, "seek": 124586, "start": 1245.86, "end": 1251.34, "text": " It can operate at 50,000 feet, break the sound barrier, navigate across continents.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 393, 9651, 412, 2625, 11, 1360, 3521, 11, 1821, 264, 1626, 13357, 11, 12350, 2108, 38598, 13, 50639], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.129099704251431, "compression_ratio": 1.6859205776173285, "no_speech_prob": 1.7208197757370702e-12}, {"id": 373, "seek": 124586, "start": 1251.62, "end": 1255.0, "text": " But with that massive reachability comes a massive maintenance burden.", "tokens": [50653, 583, 365, 300, 5994, 2524, 2310, 1487, 257, 5994, 11258, 12578, 13, 50822], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.129099704251431, "compression_ratio": 1.6859205776173285, "no_speech_prob": 1.7208197757370702e-12}, {"id": 374, "seek": 124586, "start": 1255.1, "end": 1255.56, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50827, 7587, 13, 50850], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.129099704251431, "compression_ratio": 1.6859205776173285, "no_speech_prob": 1.7208197757370702e-12}, {"id": 375, "seek": 124586, "start": 1256.1, "end": 1259.24, "text": " A bicycle requires a little chain oil and some air in the tires.", "tokens": [50877, 316, 20888, 7029, 257, 707, 5021, 3184, 293, 512, 1988, 294, 264, 13885, 13, 51034], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.129099704251431, "compression_ratio": 1.6859205776173285, "no_speech_prob": 1.7208197757370702e-12}, {"id": 376, "seek": 124586, "start": 1259.9199999999998, "end": 1266.4799999999998, "text": " An F-22 requires dozens of hours of highly specialized ground maintenance for every single hour it spends in the air.", "tokens": [51068, 1107, 479, 12, 7490, 7029, 18431, 295, 2496, 295, 5405, 19813, 2727, 11258, 337, 633, 2167, 1773, 309, 25620, 294, 264, 1988, 13, 51396], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.129099704251431, "compression_ratio": 1.6859205776173285, "no_speech_prob": 1.7208197757370702e-12}, {"id": 377, "seek": 124586, "start": 1266.6399999999999, "end": 1272.84, "text": " Every domain that accumulates capability simultaneously accumulates a deadly cost of keeping that capability functional.", "tokens": [51404, 2048, 9274, 300, 12989, 26192, 13759, 16561, 12989, 26192, 257, 18232, 2063, 295, 5145, 300, 13759, 11745, 13, 51714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.129099704251431, "compression_ratio": 1.6859205776173285, "no_speech_prob": 1.7208197757370702e-12}, {"id": 378, "seek": 127284, "start": 1272.84, "end": 1276.3799999999999, "text": " Fliction formalizes this in the complexity repair theorem.", "tokens": [50365, 3235, 4105, 9860, 5660, 341, 294, 264, 14024, 10535, 20904, 13, 50542], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355457305908203, "compression_ratio": 1.6735537190082646, "no_speech_prob": 1.5368574468599405e-12}, {"id": 379, "seek": 127284, "start": 1276.8999999999999, "end": 1281.5, "text": " It essentially states that a system's repair capacity must always exceed its maintenance burden.", "tokens": [50568, 467, 4476, 4368, 300, 257, 1185, 311, 10535, 6042, 1633, 1009, 14048, 1080, 11258, 12578, 13, 50798], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355457305908203, "compression_ratio": 1.6735537190082646, "no_speech_prob": 1.5368574468599405e-12}, {"id": 380, "seek": 127284, "start": 1282.02, "end": 1290.22, "text": " If the burden outpaces your ability to diagnose and repair the system, you don't just gracefully degrade, you face divergent collapse.", "tokens": [50824, 759, 264, 12578, 484, 79, 2116, 428, 3485, 281, 36238, 293, 10535, 264, 1185, 11, 291, 500, 380, 445, 10042, 2277, 368, 8692, 11, 291, 1851, 18558, 6930, 15584, 13, 51234], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355457305908203, "compression_ratio": 1.6735537190082646, "no_speech_prob": 1.5368574468599405e-12}, {"id": 381, "seek": 127284, "start": 1290.54, "end": 1296.1799999999998, "text": " And this leads to what I think is the most profound insight in the entire deep dive, the repair dominance theorem.", "tokens": [51250, 400, 341, 6689, 281, 437, 286, 519, 307, 264, 881, 14382, 11269, 294, 264, 2302, 2452, 9192, 11, 264, 10535, 34987, 20904, 13, 51532], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1355457305908203, "compression_ratio": 1.6735537190082646, "no_speech_prob": 1.5368574468599405e-12}, {"id": 382, "seek": 129618, "start": 1296.18, "end": 1303.1200000000001, "text": " Fliction mathematically proves that as a system's capability grows, the maintenance cost does not grow linearly.", "tokens": [50365, 3235, 4105, 44003, 25019, 300, 382, 257, 1185, 311, 13759, 13156, 11, 264, 11258, 2063, 775, 406, 1852, 43586, 13, 50712], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1618717528961517, "compression_ratio": 1.5577689243027888, "no_speech_prob": 2.7930591867120214e-12}, {"id": 383, "seek": 129618, "start": 1303.24, "end": 1303.8, "text": " It goes convex.", "tokens": [50718, 467, 1709, 42432, 13, 50746], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1618717528961517, "compression_ratio": 1.5577689243027888, "no_speech_prob": 2.7930591867120214e-12}, {"id": 384, "seek": 129618, "start": 1303.9, "end": 1305.24, "text": " It curves sharply upward.", "tokens": [50751, 467, 19490, 42893, 23452, 13, 50818], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1618717528961517, "compression_ratio": 1.5577689243027888, "no_speech_prob": 2.7930591867120214e-12}, {"id": 385, "seek": 129618, "start": 1305.76, "end": 1310.8600000000001, "text": " And because of that convexity, every system inevitably hits a specific threshold called KSTAR.", "tokens": [50844, 400, 570, 295, 300, 42432, 507, 11, 633, 1185, 28171, 8664, 257, 2685, 14678, 1219, 591, 6840, 1899, 13, 51099], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1618717528961517, "compression_ratio": 1.5577689243027888, "no_speech_prob": 2.7930591867120214e-12}, {"id": 386, "seek": 129618, "start": 1311.16, "end": 1315.46, "text": " KSTAR is the inflection point where the rules of survival fundamentally flip.", "tokens": [51114, 591, 6840, 1899, 307, 264, 1536, 5450, 935, 689, 264, 4474, 295, 12559, 17879, 7929, 13, 51329], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1618717528961517, "compression_ratio": 1.5577689243027888, "no_speech_prob": 2.7930591867120214e-12}, {"id": 387, "seek": 129618, "start": 1316.1200000000001, "end": 1320.48, "text": " Before KSTAR, investing in more capability yields huge returns.", "tokens": [51362, 4546, 591, 6840, 1899, 11, 10978, 294, 544, 13759, 32168, 2603, 11247, 13, 51580], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1618717528961517, "compression_ratio": 1.5577689243027888, "no_speech_prob": 2.7930591867120214e-12}, {"id": 388, "seek": 132048, "start": 1320.48, "end": 1331.52, "text": " But past KSTAR, the convex cost of maintenance is so severe that investing in a marginal unit of repair buys you vastly more viability than investing in capability.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 1791, 591, 6840, 1899, 11, 264, 42432, 2063, 295, 11258, 307, 370, 8922, 300, 10978, 294, 257, 16885, 4985, 295, 10535, 28153, 291, 41426, 544, 1932, 2310, 813, 10978, 294, 13759, 13, 50917], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1075086144840016, "compression_ratio": 1.5394190871369295, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006128694128767e-12}, {"id": 389, "seek": 132048, "start": 1331.8, "end": 1335.4, "text": " Explain how this plays out in the real world because it's everywhere, like aging.", "tokens": [50931, 39574, 577, 341, 5749, 484, 294, 264, 957, 1002, 570, 309, 311, 5315, 11, 411, 19090, 13, 51111], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1075086144840016, "compression_ratio": 1.5394190871369295, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006128694128767e-12}, {"id": 390, "seek": 132048, "start": 1335.88, "end": 1339.08, "text": " Aging is a perfect biological manifestation of KSTAR.", "tokens": [51135, 2725, 278, 307, 257, 2176, 13910, 29550, 295, 591, 6840, 1899, 13, 51295], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1075086144840016, "compression_ratio": 1.5394190871369295, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006128694128767e-12}, {"id": 391, "seek": 132048, "start": 1339.5, "end": 1343.72, "text": " When a human body reaches mature adulthood, its capability is immense.", "tokens": [51316, 1133, 257, 1952, 1772, 14235, 14442, 42328, 11, 1080, 13759, 307, 22920, 13, 51527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1075086144840016, "compression_ratio": 1.5394190871369295, "no_speech_prob": 2.1006128694128767e-12}, {"id": 392, "seek": 134372, "start": 1343.72, "end": 1350.08, "text": " But over decades, cellular damaged DNA mutations, misfolded proteins, builds up exponentially.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 670, 7878, 11, 29267, 14080, 8272, 29243, 11, 3346, 18353, 292, 15577, 11, 15182, 493, 37330, 13, 50683], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 393, "seek": 134372, "start": 1350.52, "end": 1351.8600000000001, "text": " The maintenance burden goes convex.", "tokens": [50705, 440, 11258, 12578, 1709, 42432, 13, 50772], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 394, "seek": 134372, "start": 1352.16, "end": 1352.24, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50787, 1779, 13, 50791], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 395, "seek": 134372, "start": 1352.8, "end": 1356.02, "text": " An 80-year-old doesn't need to learn a new metabolic trick to survive.", "tokens": [50819, 1107, 4688, 12, 5294, 12, 2641, 1177, 380, 643, 281, 1466, 257, 777, 36464, 4282, 281, 7867, 13, 50980], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 396, "seek": 134372, "start": 1356.26, "end": 1358.0, "text": " They are entirely limited by repair.", "tokens": [50992, 814, 366, 7696, 5567, 538, 10535, 13, 51079], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 397, "seek": 134372, "start": 1358.2, "end": 1360.52, "text": " They need their cellular mechanisms to clear out the garbage.", "tokens": [51089, 814, 643, 641, 29267, 15902, 281, 1850, 484, 264, 14150, 13, 51205], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 398, "seek": 134372, "start": 1360.74, "end": 1361.7, "text": " They've crossed KSTAR.", "tokens": [51216, 814, 600, 14622, 591, 6840, 1899, 13, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 399, "seek": 134372, "start": 1361.9, "end": 1364.88, "text": " And software technical debt operates on the exact same physics.", "tokens": [51274, 400, 4722, 6191, 7831, 22577, 322, 264, 1900, 912, 10649, 13, 51423], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 400, "seek": 134372, "start": 1365.38, "end": 1368.06, "text": " If you're building a new app, adding features is easy.", "tokens": [51448, 759, 291, 434, 2390, 257, 777, 724, 11, 5127, 4122, 307, 1858, 13, 51582], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 401, "seek": 134372, "start": 1368.24, "end": 1370.1000000000001, "text": " You write some code, you have a login screen.", "tokens": [51591, 509, 2464, 512, 3089, 11, 291, 362, 257, 24276, 2568, 13, 51684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 402, "seek": 134372, "start": 1370.32, "end": 1371.28, "text": " Capability is growing.", "tokens": [51695, 8363, 2310, 307, 4194, 13, 51743], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14751184793343222, "compression_ratio": 1.5508982035928143, "no_speech_prob": 1.5612952554075465e-12}, {"id": 403, "seek": 137128, "start": 1371.28, "end": 1374.32, "text": " But eventually, you hit a combinatorial explosion.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 4728, 11, 291, 2045, 257, 2512, 31927, 831, 15673, 13, 50517], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07610039162424813, "compression_ratio": 1.6478405315614617, "no_speech_prob": 1.7275519122866845e-12}, {"id": 404, "seek": 137128, "start": 1374.8999999999999, "end": 1381.6399999999999, "text": " You add a simple photo filter, and suddenly it interacts with the messaging protocol in a way that randomly crashes the login screen.", "tokens": [50546, 509, 909, 257, 2199, 5052, 6608, 11, 293, 5800, 309, 43582, 365, 264, 21812, 10336, 294, 257, 636, 300, 16979, 28642, 264, 24276, 2568, 13, 50883], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07610039162424813, "compression_ratio": 1.6478405315614617, "no_speech_prob": 1.7275519122866845e-12}, {"id": 405, "seek": 137128, "start": 1381.84, "end": 1385.0, "text": " Because every new feature interacts with every existing feature.", "tokens": [50893, 1436, 633, 777, 4111, 43582, 365, 633, 6741, 4111, 13, 51051], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07610039162424813, "compression_ratio": 1.6478405315614617, "no_speech_prob": 1.7275519122866845e-12}, {"id": 406, "seek": 137128, "start": 1385.12, "end": 1385.36, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51057, 1079, 13, 51069], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07610039162424813, "compression_ratio": 1.6478405315614617, "no_speech_prob": 1.7275519122866845e-12}, {"id": 407, "seek": 137128, "start": 1385.8999999999999, "end": 1391.58, "text": " So mature software companies hit KSTAR, where they realize they have to literally stop adding features", "tokens": [51096, 407, 14442, 4722, 3431, 2045, 591, 6840, 1899, 11, 689, 436, 4325, 436, 362, 281, 3736, 1590, 5127, 4122, 51380], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07610039162424813, "compression_ratio": 1.6478405315614617, "no_speech_prob": 1.7275519122866845e-12}, {"id": 408, "seek": 137128, "start": 1391.58, "end": 1397.02, "text": " and just spend all their time refactoring the old code to keep the platform from collapsing.", "tokens": [51380, 293, 445, 3496, 439, 641, 565, 1895, 578, 3662, 264, 1331, 3089, 281, 1066, 264, 3663, 490, 45339, 13, 51652], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07610039162424813, "compression_ratio": 1.6478405315614617, "no_speech_prob": 1.7275519122866845e-12}, {"id": 409, "seek": 137128, "start": 1397.32, "end": 1400.6, "text": " We can even scale this up to ancient empires.", "tokens": [51667, 492, 393, 754, 4373, 341, 493, 281, 7832, 4012, 3145, 13, 51831], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07610039162424813, "compression_ratio": 1.6478405315614617, "no_speech_prob": 1.7275519122866845e-12}, {"id": 410, "seek": 140060, "start": 1400.6, "end": 1401.6399999999999, "text": " The Roman Empire?", "tokens": [50365, 440, 8566, 12197, 30, 50417], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21001069810655382, "compression_ratio": 1.55859375, "no_speech_prob": 2.133988732250236e-12}, {"id": 411, "seek": 140060, "start": 1401.82, "end": 1403.8, "text": " Yes, during the crisis of the 3rd century.", "tokens": [50426, 1079, 11, 1830, 264, 5869, 295, 264, 805, 7800, 4901, 13, 50525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21001069810655382, "compression_ratio": 1.55859375, "no_speech_prob": 2.133988732250236e-12}, {"id": 412, "seek": 140060, "start": 1404.12, "end": 1406.6399999999999, "text": " Initially, expanding the empire increased capability.", "tokens": [50541, 29446, 11, 14702, 264, 17506, 6505, 13759, 13, 50667], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21001069810655382, "compression_ratio": 1.55859375, "no_speech_prob": 2.133988732250236e-12}, {"id": 413, "seek": 140060, "start": 1406.9199999999998, "end": 1408.2199999999998, "text": " More land, more taxes.", "tokens": [50681, 5048, 2117, 11, 544, 10041, 13, 50746], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21001069810655382, "compression_ratio": 1.55859375, "no_speech_prob": 2.133988732250236e-12}, {"id": 414, "seek": 140060, "start": 1408.78, "end": 1413.9199999999998, "text": " But the administrative overhead of adding one more province eventually scaled worse than linearly.", "tokens": [50774, 583, 264, 17900, 19922, 295, 5127, 472, 544, 16705, 4728, 36039, 5324, 813, 43586, 13, 51031], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21001069810655382, "compression_ratio": 1.55859375, "no_speech_prob": 2.133988732250236e-12}, {"id": 415, "seek": 140060, "start": 1414.36, "end": 1415.84, "text": " Because of the communication lag.", "tokens": [51053, 1436, 295, 264, 6101, 8953, 13, 51127], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21001069810655382, "compression_ratio": 1.55859375, "no_speech_prob": 2.133988732250236e-12}, {"id": 416, "seek": 140060, "start": 1416.5, "end": 1423.9399999999998, "text": " When your border is in Scotland and the emperor is in Rome, the sheer cost of transmitting orders securely becomes astronomical.", "tokens": [51160, 1133, 428, 7838, 307, 294, 11180, 293, 264, 20255, 307, 294, 12043, 11, 264, 23061, 2063, 295, 7715, 2414, 9470, 38348, 3643, 49035, 13, 51532], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21001069810655382, "compression_ratio": 1.55859375, "no_speech_prob": 2.133988732250236e-12}, {"id": 417, "seek": 142394, "start": 1423.94, "end": 1425.76, "text": " The empire crossed KSTAR.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 17506, 14622, 591, 6840, 1899, 13, 50456], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18688445621066624, "compression_ratio": 1.4819277108433735, "no_speech_prob": 1.6106056375739253e-12}, {"id": 418, "seek": 142394, "start": 1426.1200000000001, "end": 1432.18, "text": " The convex cost of maintaining their vast reachability completely overwhelmed their civilizational repair capacity.", "tokens": [50474, 440, 42432, 2063, 295, 14916, 641, 8369, 2524, 2310, 2584, 19042, 641, 5605, 590, 1478, 10535, 6042, 13, 50777], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18688445621066624, "compression_ratio": 1.4819277108433735, "no_speech_prob": 1.6106056375739253e-12}, {"id": 419, "seek": 142394, "start": 1432.66, "end": 1432.94, "text": " They splintered.", "tokens": [50801, 814, 4732, 5106, 292, 13, 50815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18688445621066624, "compression_ratio": 1.4819277108433735, "no_speech_prob": 1.6106056375739253e-12}, {"id": 420, "seek": 142394, "start": 1433.54, "end": 1439.94, "text": " Okay, so if repair is the ultimate bottleneck for survival, we have to define what repair actually entails.", "tokens": [50845, 1033, 11, 370, 498, 10535, 307, 264, 9705, 44641, 547, 337, 12559, 11, 321, 362, 281, 6964, 437, 10535, 767, 50133, 13, 51165], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18688445621066624, "compression_ratio": 1.4819277108433735, "no_speech_prob": 1.6106056375739253e-12}, {"id": 421, "seek": 142394, "start": 1440.3400000000001, "end": 1443.96, "text": " Because my first instinct is to just throw more bodies at the problem.", "tokens": [51185, 1436, 452, 700, 16556, 307, 281, 445, 3507, 544, 7510, 412, 264, 1154, 13, 51366], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18688445621066624, "compression_ratio": 1.4819277108433735, "no_speech_prob": 1.6106056375739253e-12}, {"id": 422, "seek": 142394, "start": 1444.3200000000002, "end": 1445.3600000000001, "text": " Hire 10 more developers.", "tokens": [51384, 389, 621, 1266, 544, 8849, 13, 51436], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18688445621066624, "compression_ratio": 1.4819277108433735, "no_speech_prob": 1.6106056375739253e-12}, {"id": 423, "seek": 142394, "start": 1445.76, "end": 1446.0800000000002, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51456, 1779, 13, 51472], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18688445621066624, "compression_ratio": 1.4819277108433735, "no_speech_prob": 1.6106056375739253e-12}, {"id": 424, "seek": 144608, "start": 1446.08, "end": 1448.54, "text": " But repair isn't just about raw effort.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 10535, 1943, 380, 445, 466, 8936, 4630, 13, 50488], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567216682434082, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 2.012254729163998e-12}, {"id": 425, "seek": 144608, "start": 1449.12, "end": 1451.22, "text": " Repair requires diagnostic information.", "tokens": [50517, 3696, 1246, 7029, 27897, 1589, 13, 50622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567216682434082, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 2.012254729163998e-12}, {"id": 426, "seek": 144608, "start": 1451.72, "end": 1454.76, "text": " You have to know what is broken before you can apply the effort.", "tokens": [50647, 509, 362, 281, 458, 437, 307, 5463, 949, 291, 393, 3079, 264, 4630, 13, 50799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567216682434082, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 2.012254729163998e-12}, {"id": 427, "seek": 144608, "start": 1455.1, "end": 1456.6599999999999, "text": " And this introduces a critical metric.", "tokens": [50816, 400, 341, 31472, 257, 4924, 20678, 13, 50894], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567216682434082, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 2.012254729163998e-12}, {"id": 428, "seek": 144608, "start": 1457.36, "end": 1458.1399999999999, "text": " Repair entropy.", "tokens": [50929, 3696, 1246, 30867, 13, 50968], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567216682434082, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 2.012254729163998e-12}, {"id": 429, "seek": 144608, "start": 1458.72, "end": 1461.54, "text": " Repair entropy measures the ambiguity of a failure.", "tokens": [50997, 3696, 1246, 30867, 8000, 264, 46519, 295, 257, 7763, 13, 51138], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567216682434082, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 2.012254729163998e-12}, {"id": 430, "seek": 144608, "start": 1462.26, "end": 1466.6999999999998, "text": " If the entropy is zero, the symptom points uniquely to one specific fault.", "tokens": [51174, 759, 264, 30867, 307, 4018, 11, 264, 29370, 2793, 31474, 281, 472, 2685, 7441, 13, 51396], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567216682434082, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 2.012254729163998e-12}, {"id": 431, "seek": 144608, "start": 1467.26, "end": 1472.08, "text": " If it's high, the symptom could be caused by hundreds of deeply buried faults.", "tokens": [51424, 759, 309, 311, 1090, 11, 264, 29370, 727, 312, 7008, 538, 6779, 295, 8760, 14101, 36090, 13, 51665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1567216682434082, "compression_ratio": 1.646341463414634, "no_speech_prob": 2.012254729163998e-12}, {"id": 432, "seek": 147208, "start": 1472.08, "end": 1476.98, "text": " And any effort spent under high repair entropy is mostly just wasted time diagnosing the problem.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 604, 4630, 4418, 833, 1090, 10535, 30867, 307, 5240, 445, 19496, 565, 7234, 6110, 264, 1154, 13, 50610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1286581646312367, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362188296967228e-12}, {"id": 433, "seek": 147208, "start": 1477.28, "end": 1477.72, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50625, 7587, 13, 50647], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1286581646312367, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362188296967228e-12}, {"id": 434, "seek": 147208, "start": 1478.0, "end": 1479.4199999999998, "text": " It's like taking your car to the mechanic.", "tokens": [50661, 467, 311, 411, 1940, 428, 1032, 281, 264, 23860, 13, 50732], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1286581646312367, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362188296967228e-12}, {"id": 435, "seek": 147208, "start": 1479.58, "end": 1479.8, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50740, 865, 13, 50751], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1286581646312367, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362188296967228e-12}, {"id": 436, "seek": 147208, "start": 1479.8999999999999, "end": 1484.6799999999998, "text": " If I pull in with a flat tire and a massive steel nail sticking out of it, the repair entropy is zero.", "tokens": [50756, 759, 286, 2235, 294, 365, 257, 4962, 11756, 293, 257, 5994, 8269, 10173, 13465, 484, 295, 309, 11, 264, 10535, 30867, 307, 4018, 13, 50995], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1286581646312367, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362188296967228e-12}, {"id": 437, "seek": 147208, "start": 1485.06, "end": 1486.26, "text": " The fix takes 10 minutes.", "tokens": [51014, 440, 3191, 2516, 1266, 2077, 13, 51074], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1286581646312367, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362188296967228e-12}, {"id": 438, "seek": 147208, "start": 1486.4399999999998, "end": 1491.1, "text": " But what if you tell the mechanic, there's a rattling sound from the dashboard, but only when I turn left.", "tokens": [51083, 583, 437, 498, 291, 980, 264, 23860, 11, 456, 311, 257, 48822, 1626, 490, 264, 18342, 11, 457, 787, 562, 286, 1261, 1411, 13, 51316], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1286581646312367, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362188296967228e-12}, {"id": 439, "seek": 147208, "start": 1491.3, "end": 1493.5, "text": " And only when the AC is running on a Tuesday.", "tokens": [51326, 400, 787, 562, 264, 8157, 307, 2614, 322, 257, 10017, 13, 51436], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1286581646312367, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362188296967228e-12}, {"id": 440, "seek": 147208, "start": 1493.98, "end": 1495.98, "text": " A mechanic's absolute nightmare.", "tokens": [51460, 316, 23860, 311, 8236, 18724, 13, 51560], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1286581646312367, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362188296967228e-12}, {"id": 441, "seek": 147208, "start": 1496.5, "end": 1498.46, "text": " That is incredibly high repair entropy.", "tokens": [51586, 663, 307, 6252, 1090, 10535, 30867, 13, 51684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1286581646312367, "compression_ratio": 1.6612377850162867, "no_speech_prob": 1.6362188296967228e-12}, {"id": 442, "seek": 149846, "start": 1498.46, "end": 1504.42, "text": " The symptom could be a loose screw, a failing steering column, a bad compressor bearing.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 29370, 727, 312, 257, 9612, 5630, 11, 257, 18223, 14823, 7738, 11, 257, 1578, 28765, 17350, 13, 50663], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13784529205061433, "compression_ratio": 1.5442176870748299, "no_speech_prob": 1.4953973389436603e-12}, {"id": 443, "seek": 149846, "start": 1504.82, "end": 1506.8, "text": " So the mechanic keeps my car for three days.", "tokens": [50683, 407, 264, 23860, 5965, 452, 1032, 337, 1045, 1708, 13, 50782], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13784529205061433, "compression_ratio": 1.5442176870748299, "no_speech_prob": 1.4953973389436603e-12}, {"id": 444, "seek": 149846, "start": 1507.52, "end": 1511.6200000000001, "text": " 95% of my massive bill is just the labor of diagnosing the complexity.", "tokens": [50818, 13420, 4, 295, 452, 5994, 2961, 307, 445, 264, 5938, 295, 7234, 6110, 264, 14024, 13, 51023], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13784529205061433, "compression_ratio": 1.5442176870748299, "no_speech_prob": 1.4953973389436603e-12}, {"id": 445, "seek": 149846, "start": 1511.96, "end": 1512.44, "text": " Precisely.", "tokens": [51040, 48746, 736, 13, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13784529205061433, "compression_ratio": 1.5442176870748299, "no_speech_prob": 1.4953973389436603e-12}, {"id": 446, "seek": 149846, "start": 1513.06, "end": 1518.72, "text": " In a recursively modifying system, like an advanced AI, repair entropy naturally explodes.", "tokens": [51095, 682, 257, 20560, 3413, 42626, 1185, 11, 411, 364, 7339, 7318, 11, 10535, 30867, 8195, 42610, 13, 51378], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13784529205061433, "compression_ratio": 1.5442176870748299, "no_speech_prob": 1.4953973389436603e-12}, {"id": 447, "seek": 149846, "start": 1519.14, "end": 1521.3, "text": " An error isn't a simple syntax typo.", "tokens": [51399, 1107, 6713, 1943, 380, 257, 2199, 28431, 2125, 78, 13, 51507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13784529205061433, "compression_ratio": 1.5442176870748299, "no_speech_prob": 1.4953973389436603e-12}, {"id": 448, "seek": 149846, "start": 1521.6200000000001, "end": 1525.48, "text": " It's an emergent hallucination buried in a billion parameter matrix.", "tokens": [51523, 467, 311, 364, 4345, 6930, 35212, 2486, 14101, 294, 257, 5218, 13075, 8141, 13, 51716], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13784529205061433, "compression_ratio": 1.5442176870748299, "no_speech_prob": 1.4953973389436603e-12}, {"id": 449, "seek": 149846, "start": 1525.6000000000001, "end": 1527.4, "text": " So you can't just throw raw effort at it.", "tokens": [51722, 407, 291, 393, 380, 445, 3507, 8936, 4630, 412, 309, 13, 51812], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13784529205061433, "compression_ratio": 1.5442176870748299, "no_speech_prob": 1.4953973389436603e-12}, {"id": 450, "seek": 152740, "start": 1527.4, "end": 1534.3200000000002, "text": " You need diverse, independent verification, which exposes the actual terrifying topology of how EGI could fail.", "tokens": [50365, 509, 643, 9521, 11, 6695, 30206, 11, 597, 1278, 4201, 264, 3539, 18106, 1192, 1793, 295, 577, 462, 26252, 727, 3061, 13, 50711], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1360172362554641, "compression_ratio": 1.5528169014084507, "no_speech_prob": 1.4552889058758178e-12}, {"id": 451, "seek": 152740, "start": 1534.44, "end": 1534.72, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [50717, 1079, 13, 50731], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1360172362554641, "compression_ratio": 1.5528169014084507, "no_speech_prob": 1.4552889058758178e-12}, {"id": 452, "seek": 152740, "start": 1534.8600000000001, "end": 1536.5800000000002, "text": " Fliction lays out the compression principle.", "tokens": [50738, 3235, 4105, 32714, 484, 264, 19355, 8665, 13, 50824], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1360172362554641, "compression_ratio": 1.5528169014084507, "no_speech_prob": 1.4552889058758178e-12}, {"id": 453, "seek": 152740, "start": 1536.7, "end": 1539.5400000000002, "text": " The systemic risk of collapse scales with two variables.", "tokens": [50830, 440, 23789, 3148, 295, 15584, 17408, 365, 732, 9102, 13, 50972], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1360172362554641, "compression_ratio": 1.5528169014084507, "no_speech_prob": 1.4552889058758178e-12}, {"id": 454, "seek": 152740, "start": 1539.7800000000002, "end": 1543.16, "text": " The first is N star, the ratio of iteration to verification.", "tokens": [50984, 440, 700, 307, 426, 3543, 11, 264, 8509, 295, 24784, 281, 30206, 13, 51153], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1360172362554641, "compression_ratio": 1.5528169014084507, "no_speech_prob": 1.4552889058758178e-12}, {"id": 455, "seek": 152740, "start": 1543.38, "end": 1546.22, "text": " How many times it updates before an external check can catch an error.", "tokens": [51164, 1012, 867, 1413, 309, 9205, 949, 364, 8320, 1520, 393, 3745, 364, 6713, 13, 51306], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1360172362554641, "compression_ratio": 1.5528169014084507, "no_speech_prob": 1.4552889058758178e-12}, {"id": 456, "seek": 152740, "start": 1546.3000000000002, "end": 1546.7800000000002, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51310, 7587, 13, 51334], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1360172362554641, "compression_ratio": 1.5528169014084507, "no_speech_prob": 1.4552889058758178e-12}, {"id": 457, "seek": 152740, "start": 1547.02, "end": 1551.14, "text": " But the second variable is even more critical, DR, or effective repair diversity.", "tokens": [51346, 583, 264, 1150, 7006, 307, 754, 544, 4924, 11, 12118, 11, 420, 4942, 10535, 8811, 13, 51552], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1360172362554641, "compression_ratio": 1.5528169014084507, "no_speech_prob": 1.4552889058758178e-12}, {"id": 458, "seek": 155114, "start": 1551.14, "end": 1555.0200000000002, "text": " Let's break this down meticulously because my human intuition utterly fails here.", "tokens": [50365, 961, 311, 1821, 341, 760, 41566, 25038, 570, 452, 1952, 24002, 30251, 18199, 510, 13, 50559], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1295562505722046, "compression_ratio": 1.4763948497854078, "no_speech_prob": 1.299236543003679e-12}, {"id": 459, "seek": 155114, "start": 1555.3000000000002, "end": 1559.68, "text": " My intuition says if I have 10 identical channels of backup, I have 10 units of safety.", "tokens": [50573, 1222, 24002, 1619, 498, 286, 362, 1266, 14800, 9235, 295, 14807, 11, 286, 362, 1266, 6815, 295, 4514, 13, 50792], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1295562505722046, "compression_ratio": 1.4763948497854078, "no_speech_prob": 1.299236543003679e-12}, {"id": 460, "seek": 155114, "start": 1560.0600000000002, "end": 1560.2800000000002, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50811, 1779, 13, 50822], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1295562505722046, "compression_ratio": 1.4763948497854078, "no_speech_prob": 1.299236543003679e-12}, {"id": 461, "seek": 155114, "start": 1560.44, "end": 1567.3400000000001, "text": " But Fliction's math, using the beta binomial distribution, proves that raw count does not equal effective diversity.", "tokens": [50830, 583, 3235, 4105, 311, 5221, 11, 1228, 264, 9861, 5171, 47429, 7316, 11, 25019, 300, 8936, 1207, 775, 406, 2681, 4942, 8811, 13, 51175], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1295562505722046, "compression_ratio": 1.4763948497854078, "no_speech_prob": 1.299236543003679e-12}, {"id": 462, "seek": 155114, "start": 1567.8000000000002, "end": 1569.98, "text": " Walk through the corporate server example he uses.", "tokens": [51198, 10818, 807, 264, 10896, 7154, 1365, 415, 4960, 13, 51307], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1295562505722046, "compression_ratio": 1.4763948497854078, "no_speech_prob": 1.299236543003679e-12}, {"id": 463, "seek": 156998, "start": 1569.98, "end": 1576.8, "text": " Imagine system A. It has 10 identical replica servers running the exact same software image.", "tokens": [50365, 11739, 1185, 316, 13, 467, 575, 1266, 14800, 35456, 15909, 2614, 264, 1900, 912, 4722, 3256, 13, 50706], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15963401513941147, "compression_ratio": 1.4184782608695652, "no_speech_prob": 2.0514993783610214e-12}, {"id": 464, "seek": 156998, "start": 1577.44, "end": 1580.7, "text": " The admin thinks, if one goes down, I have nine backups.", "tokens": [50738, 440, 24236, 7309, 11, 498, 472, 1709, 760, 11, 286, 362, 4949, 50160, 13, 50901], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15963401513941147, "compression_ratio": 1.4184782608695652, "no_speech_prob": 2.0514993783610214e-12}, {"id": 465, "seek": 156998, "start": 1580.94, "end": 1581.64, "text": " Seems safe.", "tokens": [50913, 22524, 3273, 13, 50948], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15963401513941147, "compression_ratio": 1.4184782608695652, "no_speech_prob": 2.0514993783610214e-12}, {"id": 466, "seek": 156998, "start": 1581.74, "end": 1583.56, "text": " But the failures are highly correlated.", "tokens": [50953, 583, 264, 20774, 366, 5405, 38574, 13, 51044], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15963401513941147, "compression_ratio": 1.4184782608695652, "no_speech_prob": 2.0514993783610214e-12}, {"id": 467, "seek": 156998, "start": 1584.1200000000001, "end": 1587.92, "text": " If a fatal software bug exists in one, it exists in all 10.", "tokens": [51072, 759, 257, 24069, 4722, 7426, 8198, 294, 472, 11, 309, 8198, 294, 439, 1266, 13, 51262], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15963401513941147, "compression_ratio": 1.4184782608695652, "no_speech_prob": 2.0514993783610214e-12}, {"id": 468, "seek": 158792, "start": 1587.92, "end": 1593.26, "text": " A specific input that crashes server 1 will instantaneously crash servers 2 through 10.", "tokens": [50365, 316, 2685, 4846, 300, 28642, 7154, 502, 486, 9836, 13131, 8252, 15909, 568, 807, 1266, 13, 50632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12101895691918545, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 1.675170744307175e-12}, {"id": 469, "seek": 158792, "start": 1593.66, "end": 1597.6000000000001, "text": " So their effective repair diversity, their DR, is barely above 1.", "tokens": [50652, 407, 641, 4942, 10535, 8811, 11, 641, 12118, 11, 307, 10268, 3673, 502, 13, 50849], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12101895691918545, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 1.675170744307175e-12}, {"id": 470, "seek": 158792, "start": 1597.78, "end": 1600.04, "text": " It calculates to roughly 1.1.", "tokens": [50858, 467, 4322, 1024, 281, 9810, 502, 13, 16, 13, 50971], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12101895691918545, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 1.675170744307175e-12}, {"id": 471, "seek": 158792, "start": 1600.16, "end": 1603.3600000000001, "text": " You paid for 10 servers, but mathematically you have the safety of 1.", "tokens": [50977, 509, 4835, 337, 1266, 15909, 11, 457, 44003, 291, 362, 264, 4514, 295, 502, 13, 51137], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12101895691918545, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 1.675170744307175e-12}, {"id": 472, "seek": 158792, "start": 1603.48, "end": 1604.8600000000001, "text": " Now contrast that with System B.", "tokens": [51143, 823, 8712, 300, 365, 8910, 363, 13, 51212], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12101895691918545, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 1.675170744307175e-12}, {"id": 473, "seek": 158792, "start": 1605.1000000000001, "end": 1608.94, "text": " System B also has 10 servers, but they used N version programming.", "tokens": [51224, 8910, 363, 611, 575, 1266, 15909, 11, 457, 436, 1143, 426, 3037, 9410, 13, 51416], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12101895691918545, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 1.675170744307175e-12}, {"id": 474, "seek": 158792, "start": 1609.4, "end": 1613.42, "text": " Different coding teams in different countries using Python, Rust, C++ Lay.", "tokens": [51439, 20825, 17720, 5491, 294, 819, 3517, 1228, 15329, 11, 34952, 11, 383, 25472, 20084, 13, 51640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12101895691918545, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 1.675170744307175e-12}, {"id": 475, "seek": 158792, "start": 1614.0, "end": 1617.22, "text": " They serve the exact same function, but the internal pathways are distinct.", "tokens": [51669, 814, 4596, 264, 1900, 912, 2445, 11, 457, 264, 6920, 22988, 366, 10644, 13, 51830], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12101895691918545, "compression_ratio": 1.6363636363636365, "no_speech_prob": 1.675170744307175e-12}, {"id": 476, "seek": 161722, "start": 1617.22, "end": 1620.74, "text": " A memory leak in the C++ server won't exist in the Rust server.", "tokens": [50365, 316, 4675, 17143, 294, 264, 383, 25472, 7154, 1582, 380, 2514, 294, 264, 34952, 7154, 13, 50541], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15650814335520674, "compression_ratio": 1.5068027210884354, "no_speech_prob": 2.6975806571155614e-12}, {"id": 477, "seek": 161722, "start": 1620.82, "end": 1621.22, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50545, 7587, 13, 50565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15650814335520674, "compression_ratio": 1.5068027210884354, "no_speech_prob": 2.6975806571155614e-12}, {"id": 478, "seek": 161722, "start": 1621.74, "end": 1624.42, "text": " The mathematics show their DR is 5.26.", "tokens": [50591, 440, 18666, 855, 641, 12118, 307, 1025, 13, 10880, 13, 50725], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15650814335520674, "compression_ratio": 1.5068027210884354, "no_speech_prob": 2.6975806571155614e-12}, {"id": 479, "seek": 161722, "start": 1624.98, "end": 1628.9, "text": " The exact same raw count gives you nearly five times the effective diversity.", "tokens": [50753, 440, 1900, 912, 8936, 1207, 2709, 291, 6217, 1732, 1413, 264, 4942, 8811, 13, 50949], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15650814335520674, "compression_ratio": 1.5068027210884354, "no_speech_prob": 2.6975806571155614e-12}, {"id": 480, "seek": 161722, "start": 1629.22, "end": 1631.04, "text": " And this leads to the monoculture corollary.", "tokens": [50965, 400, 341, 6689, 281, 264, 1108, 905, 8389, 1181, 1833, 822, 13, 51056], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15650814335520674, "compression_ratio": 1.5068027210884354, "no_speech_prob": 2.6975806571155614e-12}, {"id": 481, "seek": 161722, "start": 1631.8600000000001, "end": 1635.94, "text": " When DR approaches 1, a single error isn't caught by a diverse neighbor.", "tokens": [51097, 1133, 12118, 11587, 502, 11, 257, 2167, 6713, 1943, 380, 5415, 538, 257, 9521, 5987, 13, 51301], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15650814335520674, "compression_ratio": 1.5068027210884354, "no_speech_prob": 2.6975806571155614e-12}, {"id": 482, "seek": 161722, "start": 1636.38, "end": 1637.52, "text": " It propagates globally.", "tokens": [51323, 467, 12425, 1024, 18958, 13, 51380], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15650814335520674, "compression_ratio": 1.5068027210884354, "no_speech_prob": 2.6975806571155614e-12}, {"id": 483, "seek": 161722, "start": 1638.1200000000001, "end": 1640.72, "text": " Like the Log4j vulnerability in 2021.", "tokens": [51410, 1743, 264, 10824, 19, 73, 24210, 294, 7201, 13, 51540], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15650814335520674, "compression_ratio": 1.5068027210884354, "no_speech_prob": 2.6975806571155614e-12}, {"id": 484, "seek": 161722, "start": 1641.42, "end": 1643.3, "text": " Log4j was a stark demonstration.", "tokens": [51575, 10824, 19, 73, 390, 257, 17417, 16520, 13, 51669], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15650814335520674, "compression_ratio": 1.5068027210884354, "no_speech_prob": 2.6975806571155614e-12}, {"id": 485, "seek": 161722, "start": 1643.72, "end": 1646.04, "text": " It's a mundane logging utility for Java.", "tokens": [51690, 467, 311, 257, 43497, 27991, 14877, 337, 10745, 13, 51806], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15650814335520674, "compression_ratio": 1.5068027210884354, "no_speech_prob": 2.6975806571155614e-12}, {"id": 486, "seek": 164604, "start": 1646.04, "end": 1653.28, "text": " But because it was free and standardized, virtually every major enterprise software system on the planet integrated it.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 570, 309, 390, 1737, 293, 31677, 11, 14103, 633, 2563, 14132, 4722, 1185, 322, 264, 5054, 10919, 309, 13, 50727], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13701767757021147, "compression_ratio": 1.49746192893401, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279068359107088e-12}, {"id": 487, "seek": 164604, "start": 1653.8, "end": 1657.5, "text": " So the raw count was massive, but the effective repair diversity was basically one.", "tokens": [50753, 407, 264, 8936, 1207, 390, 5994, 11, 457, 264, 4942, 10535, 8811, 390, 1936, 472, 13, 50938], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13701767757021147, "compression_ratio": 1.49746192893401, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279068359107088e-12}, {"id": 488, "seek": 164604, "start": 1658.04, "end": 1662.56, "text": " When a vulnerability was found, the entire global ecosystem was compromised simultaneously.", "tokens": [50965, 1133, 257, 24210, 390, 1352, 11, 264, 2302, 4338, 11311, 390, 32463, 16561, 13, 51191], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13701767757021147, "compression_ratio": 1.49746192893401, "no_speech_prob": 1.9279068359107088e-12}, {"id": 489, "seek": 166256, "start": 1662.56, "end": 1665.74, "text": " And biology provides an even more devastating example.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 14956, 6417, 364, 754, 544, 21280, 1365, 13, 50524], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15919611189100477, "compression_ratio": 1.5289855072463767, "no_speech_prob": 2.068027606799694e-12}, {"id": 490, "seek": 166256, "start": 1666.32, "end": 1667.62, "text": " The Irish potato famine.", "tokens": [50553, 440, 16801, 7445, 42790, 13, 50618], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15919611189100477, "compression_ratio": 1.5289855072463767, "no_speech_prob": 2.068027606799694e-12}, {"id": 491, "seek": 166256, "start": 1668.02, "end": 1669.46, "text": " Millions of individual farms.", "tokens": [50638, 7190, 626, 295, 2609, 20366, 13, 50710], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15919611189100477, "compression_ratio": 1.5289855072463767, "no_speech_prob": 2.068027606799694e-12}, {"id": 492, "seek": 166256, "start": 1669.58, "end": 1670.6399999999999, "text": " A massive raw count.", "tokens": [50716, 316, 5994, 8936, 1207, 13, 50769], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15919611189100477, "compression_ratio": 1.5289855072463767, "no_speech_prob": 2.068027606799694e-12}, {"id": 493, "seek": 166256, "start": 1671.1799999999998, "end": 1676.34, "text": " But almost the entire crop was a single genetically identical cultivar called the Irish lumper.", "tokens": [50796, 583, 1920, 264, 2302, 9086, 390, 257, 2167, 37582, 14800, 15298, 289, 1219, 264, 16801, 24635, 610, 13, 51054], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15919611189100477, "compression_ratio": 1.5289855072463767, "no_speech_prob": 2.068027606799694e-12}, {"id": 494, "seek": 166256, "start": 1676.74, "end": 1677.62, "text": " Propagated by cloning.", "tokens": [51074, 21944, 559, 770, 538, 596, 16638, 13, 51118], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15919611189100477, "compression_ratio": 1.5289855072463767, "no_speech_prob": 2.068027606799694e-12}, {"id": 495, "seek": 166256, "start": 1677.72, "end": 1679.12, "text": " So the genetic DR was 1.", "tokens": [51123, 407, 264, 12462, 12118, 390, 502, 13, 51193], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15919611189100477, "compression_ratio": 1.5289855072463767, "no_speech_prob": 2.068027606799694e-12}, {"id": 496, "seek": 166256, "start": 1679.26, "end": 1679.54, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51200, 1079, 13, 51214], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15919611189100477, "compression_ratio": 1.5289855072463767, "no_speech_prob": 2.068027606799694e-12}, {"id": 497, "seek": 166256, "start": 1679.8999999999999, "end": 1683.06, "text": " When the blight arrived, the potatoes didn't have diverse immune responses.", "tokens": [51232, 1133, 264, 888, 397, 6678, 11, 264, 11811, 994, 380, 362, 9521, 11992, 13019, 13, 51390], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15919611189100477, "compression_ratio": 1.5289855072463767, "no_speech_prob": 2.068027606799694e-12}, {"id": 498, "seek": 166256, "start": 1683.62, "end": 1686.56, "text": " The error propagated globally, leading to total systemic collapse.", "tokens": [51418, 440, 6713, 12425, 770, 18958, 11, 5775, 281, 3217, 23789, 15584, 13, 51565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15919611189100477, "compression_ratio": 1.5289855072463767, "no_speech_prob": 2.068027606799694e-12}, {"id": 499, "seek": 168656, "start": 1686.56, "end": 1692.1799999999998, "text": " Infliction points out that when DR drops to 1, you lose what he calls counterfactual futures.", "tokens": [50365, 682, 3423, 4105, 2793, 484, 300, 562, 12118, 11438, 281, 502, 11, 291, 3624, 437, 415, 5498, 5682, 44919, 901, 26071, 13, 50646], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13895673500864128, "compression_ratio": 1.4805825242718447, "no_speech_prob": 1.761998316349156e-12}, {"id": 500, "seek": 168656, "start": 1692.62, "end": 1696.5, "text": " In a diverse system, outliers might hold the key to surviving a new environment.", "tokens": [50668, 682, 257, 9521, 1185, 11, 484, 23646, 1062, 1797, 264, 2141, 281, 24948, 257, 777, 2823, 13, 50862], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13895673500864128, "compression_ratio": 1.4805825242718447, "no_speech_prob": 1.761998316349156e-12}, {"id": 501, "seek": 168656, "start": 1697.1599999999999, "end": 1701.56, "text": " If you converge into a monoculture, you wipe out those parallel histories.", "tokens": [50895, 759, 291, 41881, 666, 257, 1108, 905, 8389, 11, 291, 14082, 484, 729, 8952, 30631, 13, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13895673500864128, "compression_ratio": 1.4805825242718447, "no_speech_prob": 1.761998316349156e-12}, {"id": 502, "seek": 168656, "start": 1702.24, "end": 1705.3799999999999, "text": " You engineer away your ability to adapt to the unknown.", "tokens": [51149, 509, 11403, 1314, 428, 3485, 281, 6231, 281, 264, 9841, 13, 51306], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13895673500864128, "compression_ratio": 1.4805825242718447, "no_speech_prob": 1.761998316349156e-12}, {"id": 503, "seek": 170538, "start": 1705.38, "end": 1707.38, "text": " So how has humanity survived?", "tokens": [50365, 407, 577, 575, 10243, 14433, 30, 50465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15326561377598688, "compression_ratio": 1.5559322033898304, "no_speech_prob": 2.1847920608081273e-12}, {"id": 504, "seek": 170538, "start": 1707.94, "end": 1712.7800000000002, "text": " How have we built massive civilizations without collapsing into a fatal monoculture?", "tokens": [50493, 1012, 362, 321, 3094, 5994, 40749, 1553, 45339, 666, 257, 24069, 1108, 905, 8389, 30, 50735], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15326561377598688, "compression_ratio": 1.5559322033898304, "no_speech_prob": 2.1847920608081273e-12}, {"id": 505, "seek": 170538, "start": 1713.0800000000002, "end": 1716.18, "text": " We engineered macro repair systems, like science.", "tokens": [50750, 492, 38648, 18887, 10535, 3652, 11, 411, 3497, 13, 50905], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15326561377598688, "compression_ratio": 1.5559322033898304, "no_speech_prob": 2.1847920608081273e-12}, {"id": 506, "seek": 170538, "start": 1716.6200000000001, "end": 1719.0800000000002, "text": " Science is the ultimate level 3 recursive system.", "tokens": [50927, 8976, 307, 264, 9705, 1496, 805, 20560, 488, 1185, 13, 51050], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15326561377598688, "compression_ratio": 1.5559322033898304, "no_speech_prob": 2.1847920608081273e-12}, {"id": 507, "seek": 170538, "start": 1719.6000000000001, "end": 1723.16, "text": " It revises its own methods, like inventing the double blind protocol.", "tokens": [51076, 467, 3698, 3598, 1080, 1065, 7150, 11, 411, 7962, 278, 264, 3834, 6865, 10336, 13, 51254], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15326561377598688, "compression_ratio": 1.5559322033898304, "no_speech_prob": 2.1847920608081273e-12}, {"id": 508, "seek": 170538, "start": 1723.3600000000001, "end": 1727.3400000000001, "text": " And it enforces high DR through competing labs and independent replication.", "tokens": [51264, 400, 309, 25495, 887, 1090, 12118, 807, 15439, 20339, 293, 6695, 39911, 13, 51463], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15326561377598688, "compression_ratio": 1.5559322033898304, "no_speech_prob": 2.1847920608081273e-12}, {"id": 509, "seek": 170538, "start": 1727.5800000000002, "end": 1729.0800000000002, "text": " But even science isn't immune.", "tokens": [51475, 583, 754, 3497, 1943, 380, 11992, 13, 51550], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15326561377598688, "compression_ratio": 1.5559322033898304, "no_speech_prob": 2.1847920608081273e-12}, {"id": 510, "seek": 170538, "start": 1729.38, "end": 1733.0200000000002, "text": " The replication crisis in psychology was a mathematical DR failure.", "tokens": [51565, 440, 39911, 5869, 294, 15105, 390, 257, 18894, 12118, 7763, 13, 51747], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15326561377598688, "compression_ratio": 1.5559322033898304, "no_speech_prob": 2.1847920608081273e-12}, {"id": 511, "seek": 173302, "start": 1733.02, "end": 1738.16, "text": " Thousands of researchers were highly correlated in flawed methodologies, like p-hacking.", "tokens": [50365, 40535, 295, 10309, 645, 5405, 38574, 294, 38823, 3170, 6204, 11, 411, 280, 12, 71, 14134, 13, 50622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 512, "seek": 173302, "start": 1738.28, "end": 1740.84, "text": " Because they were all taught the exact same statistical heuristics,", "tokens": [50628, 1436, 436, 645, 439, 5928, 264, 1900, 912, 22820, 415, 374, 6006, 11, 50756], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 513, "seek": 173302, "start": 1741.3799999999999, "end": 1743.12, "text": " the peer reviewers couldn't catch the errors.", "tokens": [50783, 264, 15108, 45837, 2809, 380, 3745, 264, 13603, 13, 50870], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 514, "seek": 173302, "start": 1743.52, "end": 1745.9, "text": " They were using the same flawed mental software.", "tokens": [50890, 814, 645, 1228, 264, 912, 38823, 4973, 4722, 13, 51009], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 515, "seek": 173302, "start": 1746.08, "end": 1746.48, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [51018, 7587, 13, 51038], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 516, "seek": 173302, "start": 1746.86, "end": 1750.92, "text": " And look at civilizational meta-learning, the transition from scribes to the printing press.", "tokens": [51057, 400, 574, 412, 5605, 590, 1478, 19616, 12, 47204, 11, 264, 6034, 490, 39435, 279, 281, 264, 14699, 1886, 13, 51260], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 517, "seek": 173302, "start": 1751.06, "end": 1751.18, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51267, 1779, 13, 51273], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 518, "seek": 173302, "start": 1751.26, "end": 1753.68, "text": " A scribe copying a manuscript is a linear chain.", "tokens": [51277, 316, 5545, 650, 27976, 257, 23928, 307, 257, 8213, 5021, 13, 51398], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 519, "seek": 173302, "start": 1754.16, "end": 1756.54, "text": " If monk A makes a typo, monk B copies it.", "tokens": [51422, 759, 27698, 316, 1669, 257, 2125, 78, 11, 27698, 363, 14341, 309, 13, 51541], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 520, "seek": 173302, "start": 1756.6, "end": 1757.9, "text": " The DR is basically 1.", "tokens": [51544, 440, 12118, 307, 1936, 502, 13, 51609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 521, "seek": 173302, "start": 1758.02, "end": 1761.56, "text": " But the printing press introduced parallel, independent transmissions.", "tokens": [51615, 583, 264, 14699, 1886, 7268, 8952, 11, 6695, 7715, 7922, 13, 51792], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13122402664518704, "compression_ratio": 1.6666666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 1.9126150316295387e-12}, {"id": 522, "seek": 176156, "start": 1761.56, "end": 1766.7, "text": " If a printing house in Venice made an error, scholars could cross-check it against a completely", "tokens": [50365, 759, 257, 14699, 1782, 294, 32707, 1027, 364, 6713, 11, 8553, 727, 3278, 12, 15723, 309, 1970, 257, 2584, 50622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14472331815552944, "compression_ratio": 1.503787878787879, "no_speech_prob": 2.133993502739795e-12}, {"id": 523, "seek": 176156, "start": 1766.7, "end": 1768.54, "text": " different print run from Paris.", "tokens": [50622, 819, 4482, 1190, 490, 8380, 13, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14472331815552944, "compression_ratio": 1.503787878787879, "no_speech_prob": 2.133993502739795e-12}, {"id": 524, "seek": 176156, "start": 1769.04, "end": 1774.94, "text": " So coordination mechanisms, courts, audits, peer review, are the literal manufacturing of", "tokens": [50739, 407, 21252, 15902, 11, 14141, 11, 2379, 1208, 11, 15108, 3131, 11, 366, 264, 20411, 11096, 295, 51034], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14472331815552944, "compression_ratio": 1.503787878787879, "no_speech_prob": 2.133993502739795e-12}, {"id": 525, "seek": 176156, "start": 1774.94, "end": 1777.32, "text": " repair capacity to keep DR high.", "tokens": [51034, 10535, 6042, 281, 1066, 12118, 1090, 13, 51153], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14472331815552944, "compression_ratio": 1.503787878787879, "no_speech_prob": 2.133993502739795e-12}, {"id": 526, "seek": 176156, "start": 1777.52, "end": 1780.1599999999999, "text": " Which sets up the ultimate warning about AGI.", "tokens": [51163, 3013, 6352, 493, 264, 9705, 9164, 466, 316, 26252, 13, 51295], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14472331815552944, "compression_ratio": 1.503787878787879, "no_speech_prob": 2.133993502739795e-12}, {"id": 527, "seek": 176156, "start": 1780.54, "end": 1783.46, "text": " AGI isn't dangerous just because it recurses.", "tokens": [51314, 316, 26252, 1943, 380, 5795, 445, 570, 309, 20560, 279, 13, 51460], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14472331815552944, "compression_ratio": 1.503787878787879, "no_speech_prob": 2.133993502739795e-12}, {"id": 528, "seek": 176156, "start": 1783.6399999999999, "end": 1784.78, "text": " Biology recurses.", "tokens": [51469, 48132, 20560, 279, 13, 51526], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14472331815552944, "compression_ratio": 1.503787878787879, "no_speech_prob": 2.133993502739795e-12}, {"id": 529, "seek": 176156, "start": 1784.8799999999999, "end": 1785.12, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [51531, 1779, 13, 51543], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14472331815552944, "compression_ratio": 1.503787878787879, "no_speech_prob": 2.133993502739795e-12}, {"id": 530, "seek": 176156, "start": 1785.24, "end": 1786.6799999999998, "text": " So what is the actual threat?", "tokens": [51549, 407, 437, 307, 264, 3539, 4734, 30, 51621], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14472331815552944, "compression_ratio": 1.503787878787879, "no_speech_prob": 2.133993502739795e-12}, {"id": 531, "seek": 178668, "start": 1786.68, "end": 1791.88, "text": " It threatens to take a process that civilization has only run safely over centuries, using", "tokens": [50365, 467, 47511, 281, 747, 257, 1399, 300, 18036, 575, 787, 1190, 11750, 670, 13926, 11, 1228, 50625], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12539010529124409, "compression_ratio": 1.6372549019607843, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147396783739888e-12}, {"id": 532, "seek": 178668, "start": 1791.88, "end": 1796.72, "text": " millions of independent minds for distributed verification, and it compresses that into a", "tokens": [50625, 6803, 295, 6695, 9634, 337, 12631, 30206, 11, 293, 309, 14778, 279, 300, 666, 257, 50867], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12539010529124409, "compression_ratio": 1.6372549019607843, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147396783739888e-12}, {"id": 533, "seek": 178668, "start": 1796.72, "end": 1799.42, "text": " single, low-diversity computational substrate.", "tokens": [50867, 2167, 11, 2295, 12, 67, 2550, 28270, 27585, 13, 51002], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12539010529124409, "compression_ratio": 1.6372549019607843, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147396783739888e-12}, {"id": 534, "seek": 178668, "start": 1799.9, "end": 1804.3, "text": " It drives the iteration rate to infinity and the effect of diversity to one.", "tokens": [51026, 467, 11754, 264, 24784, 3314, 281, 13202, 293, 264, 1802, 295, 8811, 281, 472, 13, 51246], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12539010529124409, "compression_ratio": 1.6372549019607843, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147396783739888e-12}, {"id": 535, "seek": 178668, "start": 1804.42, "end": 1804.76, "text": " Yes.", "tokens": [51252, 1079, 13, 51269], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12539010529124409, "compression_ratio": 1.6372549019607843, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147396783739888e-12}, {"id": 536, "seek": 178668, "start": 1804.94, "end": 1810.96, "text": " So if we follow the tech industry's current path, building one centralized god AI with one", "tokens": [51278, 407, 498, 321, 1524, 264, 7553, 3518, 311, 2190, 3100, 11, 2390, 472, 32395, 3044, 7318, 365, 472, 51579], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12539010529124409, "compression_ratio": 1.6372549019607843, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147396783739888e-12}, {"id": 537, "seek": 178668, "start": 1810.96, "end": 1816.38, "text": " massive alignment protocol, aren't we just building the log4j vulnerability into human intelligence?", "tokens": [51579, 5994, 18515, 10336, 11, 3212, 380, 321, 445, 2390, 264, 3565, 19, 73, 24210, 666, 1952, 7599, 30, 51850], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12539010529124409, "compression_ratio": 1.6372549019607843, "no_speech_prob": 1.7147396783739888e-12}, {"id": 538, "seek": 181638, "start": 1816.68, "end": 1817.6200000000001, "text": " Mathematically, yes.", "tokens": [50380, 15776, 40197, 11, 2086, 13, 50427], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 539, "seek": 181638, "start": 1817.88, "end": 1821.96, "text": " We are collapsing our repair diversity to near zero in the name of efficiency.", "tokens": [50440, 492, 366, 45339, 527, 10535, 8811, 281, 2651, 4018, 294, 264, 1315, 295, 10493, 13, 50644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 540, "seek": 181638, "start": 1822.2800000000002, "end": 1823.94, "text": " That is deeply unnerving.", "tokens": [50660, 663, 307, 8760, 517, 1193, 798, 13, 50743], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 541, "seek": 181638, "start": 1824.0600000000002, "end": 1824.24, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [50749, 865, 13, 50758], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 542, "seek": 181638, "start": 1824.38, "end": 1825.72, "text": " Because you can't just patch that.", "tokens": [50765, 1436, 291, 393, 380, 445, 9972, 300, 13, 50832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 543, "seek": 181638, "start": 1825.8000000000002, "end": 1827.2, "text": " It's a structural inevitability.", "tokens": [50836, 467, 311, 257, 15067, 14481, 2310, 13, 50906], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 544, "seek": 181638, "start": 1827.46, "end": 1827.9, "text": " It is.", "tokens": [50919, 467, 307, 13, 50941], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 545, "seek": 181638, "start": 1828.1000000000001, "end": 1832.48, "text": " And in the final section, fliction shows that this mathematical challenge is arguably the", "tokens": [50951, 400, 294, 264, 2572, 3541, 11, 932, 4105, 3110, 300, 341, 18894, 3430, 307, 26771, 264, 51170], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 546, "seek": 181638, "start": 1832.48, "end": 1834.8400000000001, "text": " oldest philosophical problem in human history.", "tokens": [51170, 14026, 25066, 1154, 294, 1952, 2503, 13, 51288], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 547, "seek": 181638, "start": 1835.0800000000002, "end": 1836.92, "text": " The concept of truth.", "tokens": [51300, 440, 3410, 295, 3494, 13, 51392], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 548, "seek": 181638, "start": 1837.0600000000002, "end": 1838.6000000000001, "text": " Truth without propositions.", "tokens": [51399, 20522, 1553, 7532, 2451, 13, 51476], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 549, "seek": 181638, "start": 1839.2800000000002, "end": 1840.24, "text": " I loved this part.", "tokens": [51510, 286, 4333, 341, 644, 13, 51558], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 550, "seek": 181638, "start": 1840.24, "end": 1842.4, "text": " Normally, we restrict truth to sentences.", "tokens": [51558, 17424, 11, 321, 7694, 3494, 281, 16579, 13, 51666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 551, "seek": 181638, "start": 1842.92, "end": 1844.7800000000002, "text": " The sky is blue is a true proposition.", "tokens": [51692, 440, 5443, 307, 3344, 307, 257, 2074, 24830, 13, 51785], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19959799448649088, "compression_ratio": 1.616393442622951, "no_speech_prob": 2.012745872748134e-12}, {"id": 552, "seek": 184478, "start": 1844.78, "end": 1849.72, "text": " But in ordinary language, we talk about a true friend or a true wall.", "tokens": [50365, 583, 294, 10547, 2856, 11, 321, 751, 466, 257, 2074, 1277, 420, 257, 2074, 2929, 13, 50612], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15837324076685413, "compression_ratio": 1.624031007751938, "no_speech_prob": 2.522654611245012e-12}, {"id": 553, "seek": 184478, "start": 1850.1, "end": 1852.8, "text": " Rawleys and Dixon argue objects are truth bearers, too.", "tokens": [50631, 23732, 306, 749, 293, 413, 23226, 9695, 6565, 366, 3494, 6155, 433, 11, 886, 13, 50766], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15837324076685413, "compression_ratio": 1.624031007751938, "no_speech_prob": 2.522654611245012e-12}, {"id": 554, "seek": 184478, "start": 1853.26, "end": 1856.08, "text": " Infliction maps this perfectly onto the viability manifold.", "tokens": [50789, 682, 3423, 4105, 11317, 341, 6239, 3911, 264, 1932, 2310, 47138, 13, 50930], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15837324076685413, "compression_ratio": 1.624031007751938, "no_speech_prob": 2.522654611245012e-12}, {"id": 555, "seek": 184478, "start": 1856.36, "end": 1856.58, "text": " Right.", "tokens": [50944, 1779, 13, 50955], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15837324076685413, "compression_ratio": 1.624031007751938, "no_speech_prob": 2.522654611245012e-12}, {"id": 556, "seek": 184478, "start": 1856.8999999999999, "end": 1858.18, "text": " Take the non-deception theory.", "tokens": [50971, 3664, 264, 2107, 12, 1479, 7311, 5261, 13, 51035], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15837324076685413, "compression_ratio": 1.624031007751938, "no_speech_prob": 2.522654611245012e-12}, {"id": 557, "seek": 184478, "start": 1858.72, "end": 1860.32, "text": " A true chair supports your weight.", "tokens": [51062, 316, 2074, 6090, 9346, 428, 3364, 13, 51142], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15837324076685413, "compression_ratio": 1.624031007751938, "no_speech_prob": 2.522654611245012e-12}, {"id": 558, "seek": 184478, "start": 1860.78, "end": 1863.24, "text": " A false chair made of balsa wood shatters.", "tokens": [51165, 316, 7908, 6090, 1027, 295, 272, 24816, 4576, 402, 37690, 13, 51288], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15837324076685413, "compression_ratio": 1.624031007751938, "no_speech_prob": 2.522654611245012e-12}, {"id": 559, "seek": 184478, "start": 1863.6399999999999, "end": 1865.5, "text": " It deceives the functional profile.", "tokens": [51308, 467, 14088, 1539, 264, 11745, 7964, 13, 51401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15837324076685413, "compression_ratio": 1.624031007751938, "no_speech_prob": 2.522654611245012e-12}, {"id": 560, "seek": 184478, "start": 1865.8799999999999, "end": 1870.22, "text": " Translated to the math, a chair that collapses has exited its viability manifold.", "tokens": [51420, 6531, 38539, 281, 264, 5221, 11, 257, 6090, 300, 48765, 575, 454, 1226, 1080, 1932, 2310, 47138, 13, 51637], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15837324076685413, "compression_ratio": 1.624031007751938, "no_speech_prob": 2.522654611245012e-12}, {"id": 561, "seek": 187022, "start": 1870.22, "end": 1870.9, "text": " Exactly.", "tokens": [50365, 7587, 13, 50399], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14370765500855678, "compression_ratio": 1.67578125, "no_speech_prob": 2.227673124091667e-12}, {"id": 562, "seek": 187022, "start": 1871.14, "end": 1872.54, "text": " Or the teleological theory.", "tokens": [50411, 1610, 264, 4304, 4383, 5261, 13, 50481], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14370765500855678, "compression_ratio": 1.67578125, "no_speech_prob": 2.227673124091667e-12}, {"id": 563, "seek": 187022, "start": 1872.98, "end": 1875.14, "text": " A true heart continuously pumps blood.", "tokens": [50503, 316, 2074, 1917, 15684, 27648, 3390, 13, 50611], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14370765500855678, "compression_ratio": 1.67578125, "no_speech_prob": 2.227673124091667e-12}, {"id": 564, "seek": 187022, "start": 1875.66, "end": 1877.3600000000001, "text": " If it stubs, it is a false heart.", "tokens": [50637, 759, 309, 342, 5432, 11, 309, 307, 257, 7908, 1917, 13, 50722], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14370765500855678, "compression_ratio": 1.67578125, "no_speech_prob": 2.227673124091667e-12}, {"id": 565, "seek": 187022, "start": 1877.88, "end": 1882.42, "text": " The mathematical boundary of the viability manifold is literally the philosophical concept", "tokens": [50748, 440, 18894, 12866, 295, 264, 1932, 2310, 47138, 307, 3736, 264, 25066, 3410, 50975], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14370765500855678, "compression_ratio": 1.67578125, "no_speech_prob": 2.227673124091667e-12}, {"id": 566, "seek": 187022, "start": 1882.42, "end": 1883.68, "text": " of a true object.", "tokens": [50975, 295, 257, 2074, 2657, 13, 51038], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14370765500855678, "compression_ratio": 1.67578125, "no_speech_prob": 2.227673124091667e-12}, {"id": 567, "seek": 187022, "start": 1883.82, "end": 1888.74, "text": " Like a cancer cell, it escapes its constraints, so it is quite literally a false human cell.", "tokens": [51045, 1743, 257, 5592, 2815, 11, 309, 43769, 1080, 18491, 11, 370, 309, 307, 1596, 3736, 257, 7908, 1952, 2815, 13, 51291], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14370765500855678, "compression_ratio": 1.67578125, "no_speech_prob": 2.227673124091667e-12}, {"id": 568, "seek": 187022, "start": 1889.38, "end": 1893.18, "text": " Truth is about maintaining organizational integrity against the entropy of time.", "tokens": [51323, 20522, 307, 466, 14916, 24730, 16000, 1970, 264, 30867, 295, 565, 13, 51513], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14370765500855678, "compression_ratio": 1.67578125, "no_speech_prob": 2.227673124091667e-12}, {"id": 569, "seek": 187022, "start": 1893.74, "end": 1895.44, "text": " Truth is mathematical admissibility.", "tokens": [51541, 20522, 307, 18894, 5910, 891, 2841, 13, 51626], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14370765500855678, "compression_ratio": 1.67578125, "no_speech_prob": 2.227673124091667e-12}, {"id": 570, "seek": 189544, "start": 1895.44, "end": 1897.24, "text": " It's a profound synthesis.", "tokens": [50365, 467, 311, 257, 14382, 30252, 13, 50455], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12937068939208984, "compression_ratio": 1.6241379310344828, "no_speech_prob": 1.8832561378412382e-12}, {"id": 571, "seek": 189544, "start": 1897.78, "end": 1901.8200000000002, "text": " Survival is about preserving vital distinctions across endless transformations.", "tokens": [50482, 40716, 3576, 307, 466, 33173, 11707, 1483, 49798, 2108, 16144, 34852, 13, 50684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12937068939208984, "compression_ratio": 1.6241379310344828, "no_speech_prob": 1.8832561378412382e-12}, {"id": 572, "seek": 189544, "start": 1902.7, "end": 1904.8200000000002, "text": " So for you listening, think about what this means.", "tokens": [50728, 407, 337, 291, 4764, 11, 519, 466, 437, 341, 1355, 13, 50834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12937068939208984, "compression_ratio": 1.6241379310344828, "no_speech_prob": 1.8832561378412382e-12}, {"id": 573, "seek": 189544, "start": 1905.3200000000002, "end": 1909.48, "text": " If you declare someone a true friend, you aren't just using a metaphor.", "tokens": [50859, 759, 291, 19710, 1580, 257, 2074, 1277, 11, 291, 3212, 380, 445, 1228, 257, 19157, 13, 51067], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12937068939208984, "compression_ratio": 1.6241379310344828, "no_speech_prob": 1.8832561378412382e-12}, {"id": 574, "seek": 189544, "start": 1910.0800000000002, "end": 1912.26, "text": " You are stating a systems-level fact.", "tokens": [51097, 509, 366, 26688, 257, 3652, 12, 12418, 1186, 13, 51206], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12937068939208984, "compression_ratio": 1.6241379310344828, "no_speech_prob": 1.8832561378412382e-12}, {"id": 575, "seek": 189544, "start": 1912.8600000000001, "end": 1918.1000000000001, "text": " They stay inside the functional viability manifold of friendship, even as life gets complicated", "tokens": [51236, 814, 1754, 1854, 264, 11745, 1932, 2310, 47138, 295, 13216, 11, 754, 382, 993, 2170, 6179, 51498], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12937068939208984, "compression_ratio": 1.6241379310344828, "no_speech_prob": 1.8832561378412382e-12}, {"id": 576, "seek": 189544, "start": 1918.1000000000001, "end": 1920.2, "text": " and their internal parameters update.", "tokens": [51498, 293, 641, 6920, 9834, 5623, 13, 51603], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12937068939208984, "compression_ratio": 1.6241379310344828, "no_speech_prob": 1.8832561378412382e-12}, {"id": 577, "seek": 189544, "start": 1920.3400000000001, "end": 1924.1000000000001, "text": " It grounds our highest ideals in the bedrock mathematics of survival.", "tokens": [51610, 467, 19196, 527, 6343, 30956, 294, 264, 2901, 17799, 18666, 295, 12559, 13, 51798], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12937068939208984, "compression_ratio": 1.6241379310344828, "no_speech_prob": 1.8832561378412382e-12}, {"id": 578, "seek": 192410, "start": 1924.1, "end": 1925.4599999999998, "text": " Okay, let's pull this all together.", "tokens": [50365, 1033, 11, 718, 311, 2235, 341, 439, 1214, 13, 50433], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13292023492237878, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 2.5841264891801607e-12}, {"id": 579, "seek": 192410, "start": 1926.1399999999999, "end": 1930.58, "text": " The real takeaway isn't to cower in fear of AGI just because it can rewrite its code.", "tokens": [50467, 440, 957, 30681, 1943, 380, 281, 269, 968, 294, 4240, 295, 316, 26252, 445, 570, 309, 393, 28132, 1080, 3089, 13, 50689], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13292023492237878, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 2.5841264891801607e-12}, {"id": 580, "seek": 192410, "start": 1931.32, "end": 1933.1999999999998, "text": " Your immune cells do that every day.", "tokens": [50726, 2260, 11992, 5438, 360, 300, 633, 786, 13, 50820], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13292023492237878, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 2.5841264891801607e-12}, {"id": 581, "seek": 192410, "start": 1933.5, "end": 1935.8799999999999, "text": " Recursion is the baseline state of the universe.", "tokens": [50835, 9647, 2156, 313, 307, 264, 20518, 1785, 295, 264, 6445, 13, 50954], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13292023492237878, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 2.5841264891801607e-12}, {"id": 582, "seek": 192410, "start": 1936.1799999999998, "end": 1941.86, "text": " What we should fear is an AGI engineered as a correlated monoculture that updates faster", "tokens": [50969, 708, 321, 820, 4240, 307, 364, 316, 26252, 38648, 382, 257, 38574, 1108, 905, 8389, 300, 9205, 4663, 51253], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13292023492237878, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 2.5841264891801607e-12}, {"id": 583, "seek": 192410, "start": 1941.86, "end": 1943.4199999999998, "text": " than reality can cross-check it.", "tokens": [51253, 813, 4103, 393, 3278, 12, 15723, 309, 13, 51331], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13292023492237878, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 2.5841264891801607e-12}, {"id": 584, "seek": 192410, "start": 1944.02, "end": 1947.1999999999998, "text": " Capability is cheap, but repair is incredibly expensive.", "tokens": [51361, 8363, 2310, 307, 7084, 11, 457, 10535, 307, 6252, 5124, 13, 51520], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13292023492237878, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 2.5841264891801607e-12}, {"id": 585, "seek": 192410, "start": 1947.5, "end": 1948.82, "text": " Diversity isn't a buzzword.", "tokens": [51535, 44187, 1943, 380, 257, 13036, 7462, 13, 51601], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13292023492237878, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 2.5841264891801607e-12}, {"id": 586, "seek": 192410, "start": 1948.9399999999998, "end": 1952.78, "text": " It is a rigid mathematical prerequisite for civilizational continuation.", "tokens": [51607, 467, 307, 257, 22195, 18894, 38333, 34152, 337, 5605, 590, 1478, 29357, 13, 51799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13292023492237878, "compression_ratio": 1.5659163987138263, "no_speech_prob": 2.5841264891801607e-12}, {"id": 587, "seek": 195278, "start": 1952.78, "end": 1956.0, "text": " Which leaves us with one final, deeply provocative thought.", "tokens": [50365, 3013, 5510, 505, 365, 472, 2572, 11, 8760, 47663, 1194, 13, 50526], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1803675279384706, "compression_ratio": 1.503968253968254, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661238782886503e-12}, {"id": 588, "seek": 195278, "start": 1956.56, "end": 1962.1399999999999, "text": " Right now, governments and tech conglomerates are pushing for unified, centralized AI safety standards.", "tokens": [50554, 1779, 586, 11, 11280, 293, 7553, 416, 7191, 14301, 1024, 366, 7380, 337, 26787, 11, 32395, 7318, 4514, 7787, 13, 50833], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1803675279384706, "compression_ratio": 1.503968253968254, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661238782886503e-12}, {"id": 589, "seek": 195278, "start": 1962.66, "end": 1964.98, "text": " One massive regulatory bottleneck.", "tokens": [50859, 1485, 5994, 18260, 44641, 547, 13, 50975], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1803675279384706, "compression_ratio": 1.503968253968254, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661238782886503e-12}, {"id": 590, "seek": 195278, "start": 1965.1, "end": 1967.36, "text": " A single global alignment protocol.", "tokens": [50981, 316, 2167, 4338, 18515, 10336, 13, 51094], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1803675279384706, "compression_ratio": 1.503968253968254, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661238782886503e-12}, {"id": 591, "seek": 195278, "start": 1967.76, "end": 1975.22, "text": " But if centralizing self-improvement into a highly correlated monoculture guarantees a catastrophic systemic collapse when a novel error occurs,", "tokens": [51114, 583, 498, 5777, 3319, 2698, 12, 332, 46955, 518, 666, 257, 5405, 38574, 1108, 905, 8389, 32567, 257, 34915, 23789, 15584, 562, 257, 7613, 6713, 11843, 11, 51487], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1803675279384706, "compression_ratio": 1.503968253968254, "no_speech_prob": 1.9661238782886503e-12}, {"id": 592, "seek": 197522, "start": 1975.22, "end": 1984.06, "text": " does that mean the global push for unified safety regulations might actually be engineering the exact mathematical conditions for the disaster it's trying to prevent?", "tokens": [50365, 775, 300, 914, 264, 4338, 2944, 337, 26787, 4514, 12563, 1062, 767, 312, 7043, 264, 1900, 18894, 4487, 337, 264, 11293, 309, 311, 1382, 281, 4871, 30, 50807], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12594075281111922, "compression_ratio": 1.523076923076923, "no_speech_prob": 2.1083733717230935e-12}, {"id": 593, "seek": 197522, "start": 1984.58, "end": 1988.56, "text": " Think about that the next time you hear someone ask for a single ruling algorithm for humanity.", "tokens": [50833, 6557, 466, 300, 264, 958, 565, 291, 1568, 1580, 1029, 337, 257, 2167, 21437, 9284, 337, 10243, 13, 51032], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12594075281111922, "compression_ratio": 1.523076923076923, "no_speech_prob": 2.1083733717230935e-12}, {"id": 594, "seek": 197522, "start": 1988.98, "end": 1990.84, "text": " Until next time, keep diving deep.", "tokens": [51053, 9088, 958, 565, 11, 1066, 20241, 2452, 13, 51146], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12594075281111922, "compression_ratio": 1.523076923076923, "no_speech_prob": 2.1083733717230935e-12}, {"id": 595, "seek": 199084, "start": 1990.84, "end": 2006.54, "text": " Thank you.", "tokens": [50365, 1044, 291, 13, 51150], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.5114647258411753, "compression_ratio": 0.6363636363636364, "no_speech_prob": 3.303345097460664e-11}, {"id": 596, "seek": 199084, "start": 2006.76, "end": 2007.12, "text": " So,", "tokens": [51161, 407, 11, 51179], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -2.5114647258411753, "compression_ratio": 0.6363636363636364, "no_speech_prob": 3.303345097460664e-11}], "language": "en"}
